<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaya</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Isaya nayali mloli yawele nayali yochikala Yelusalemu. Itagwa lya heye nalyali na mana ya, “Mkulu Nguluwi Kangulohola.” Wasomile wenji wangukunda kota heye yuye ndo nakandika chitabu achi, kuno wasomile wanji wangukunda kota kulawa Isaya loyabagame, uloli wunji wa Isaya nawandichigwa na konjezwa kuli chitabu achi. Mijito ja Isaya najaluka kuli mwaka wuwula uwele mndewa Usiya nakabagama (Isaya 6:1), uwele nawali ndo mwaka miya saba na makumi gane (740) Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa. Wone mloli Isaya nakandika chitabu achi cheng'ha, yoweza kuwa nakasinda kwandika kuli mhela uwele mijito ja heye ja uloli najisinda, kuli mwaka wa miya sita na makumi nane (680) Yesu yang'hali kupondigwa. Chitabu cha Isaya changuzeleka lukami hali vitabu vya uloli vya Ilagano lya Katali. Wanhu wanji wangumchema Isaya kota ndo “mwana wa chiundewa wa waloli.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Mloli ndo munhu yoneche yalingulonga honhu ha Nguluwi na yalingigala usenga kulawa kwa Nguluwi. Kwa kukolela Isaya, Nguluwi nakalavya uloli kuwala wajenzi kuuvaba na kuuhola muji wa Yelusalemu (Isaya 39:6) na kuhiluka kwa Waisilaeli kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi (Isaya 40:2-3). Isaya nakalonga kota kugazigwa ako nakwambuzwa na gehile ga wanhu. Isaya kahi nakalavya uloli kuwala kuya kwa mndewa mkulu kulawa kuli ivyazi lya Daudi (Isaya 9:7). Wanhu wawele nawandika vitabu vya Ilagano Linyale nawatumiya ulonzi wa Isaya mala nyinji na kulajila kota ayo mndewa mkulu yawele Isaya nakalavya uloli kuwala heye, ndo Yesu. Kuli Isaya 40:3 yangutulonjela kuwala kuya kwa Yohana Mbatiza yawele nakawika goya nzila kwa chiwalo cha Yesu, kwa kudamla kuwala kuya kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka sula ya 39 nazandichigwa mhela uwele Wayahudi wang'hali kuluta kuli isi ya chijenzi, kula Babuloni. Honhu aha ha Isaya hangulonga kuwala utaguso wa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 40 mbaka sula ya 66 zangulonga kuwala Isilaeli kuwa isi kahi na kuwikula kuwala kuhembulizwa kwa wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Aku ndo uloli wa Isaya mwana wa Amosi, kuwala isi ya Yuda na muji wa Yelusalemu, kuli mihela ja ulongozi wa Usiya na Yotamu na Ahasi na Hesekiya, wandewa wa Yuda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa isi ya Yuda wangubelenhuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">“Mhulichize hemwe ulanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">Uwiche goya ikutu gwa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">Nandiwalisa wana na kuwalolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">ila nawambelenhuka heni.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Isenga lyangumzelaga yula yalingulidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">nalyo idogowi lyangumzelaga yalingulipa chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">ila Waisilaeli hawanzelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">wanhu wa heni hawavizelele kota heni ndo ndilinguwalolela!”<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Wochona wanhu wa isi wawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">wanhu wawele na itunyo lya wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">lulelo lwa walingudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">wana wawele nawazizowela nzila za kwajilila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">Nawamleka Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">nawamlema kwa kumbeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">heye yawele yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">na kumhinduchizila chigosi.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Lekachoni mlutilile kudita mbuli zilinguwambuza hemwe kugazigwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Lekachoni mlutilile kikala kuli kubelenhuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Vitwi vya hemwe vyeng'ha navilumizwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">nhumbula yeng'ha ya chila yumwe wa hemwe ndo ng'hochele.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Kulawa kuli uzayo mbaka kumutwi mwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">haduhu honhu hawele goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">ndo kulumila hela na vilonda vilingulavya danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">viwele havihovujigwe ne kuwopigwa ne kubakalizwa mafuta.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Isi ya hemwe naiwifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">miji ja hemwe najilakazwa kwa chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">Wajenzi nawahola mbena za migunda ja hemwe na kuziwifya kuno mlola.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Muji wa Yelusalemu naulechigwa uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">kota chibumuli chilechigwe na yalingwamila kuli mgunda wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">ama kuli mgunda wa matango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">kota muji uwele nauzungulutwa na wang'honyo.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakawaleka wanhu wachefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">ahyo muji wa Yelusalemu haudumigwe ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">kota Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Yelusalemu, vilongozi wa hegwe na wanhu wa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">ndo kota wala wa Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Mhulichize choyalinguwalonjela Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">chila choyalinguwalangusa heye!<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">“Mwangijesa kota ndanguzigana nhambiko za hemwe zeng'ha zomlingundavila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Nandali na ming'holo minji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">jiwele namjilakaza kota nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">na mafuta ga migongolo ja hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Silingunojezwa na danda ya mibuguma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">na ming'holo myana na mipongo.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Homkuya hali heni kufugamila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:12">haduhu yawele nakawalajiza kubiganga mgati mwa lugagala lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:12">kuno mlavya nhambiko azo.<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Mleche kingalila kahi nhambiko za hemwe, kwa vila hazilingunhanza chinhu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Ubani wa hemwe ndo izudizo kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Siweza kwimilila wihe wa hemwe womlingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">kuli mnvina za hemwe za kulawa kwa nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">ama kuli mazuwa ga hemwe ga Kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">na kuli mihela jinji ja kufugamila.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Nhumbula ya heni yanguzizudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">mnvina za hemwe za kulawa kwa nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">na mnvina zinji ziwichigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">Naziwa itunyo ikulu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">nani nhoka kwimilila.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Homgolola moko ga hemwe kuli kulanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">ndokuvisa kumeho kwa heni leka ndeche kuwona hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">hanga molanda lukami, siwahulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">kwa vila moko ga hemwe nagamema danda.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Mihovuje na kiyeliza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">Mgose madito ga hemwe gehile hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">mleche kudita wihe.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Milanguse kudita ganojile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">Mpale hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">muwatanze walingutunyigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">Muwape walekwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">muwalewele wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">“Muye lelo tijese kuwala kwamula kwa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">Hanga gehile ga hemwe ga kota lanji ndung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">gowa gazelu kota seluji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">hanga ndo gadung'hu ng'hatu kota danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">gowa gazelu ng'hatu kota sufi.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Wone mokunda kunyhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:19">molya ganojile ga isi,<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />ila wone molema na kumbelenhuka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">modumigwa kwa ipanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga.”<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Ulole, Yelusalemu, muji uwele nawali nzinzili aho hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">lelo nauwa muji wa ung'hondwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">Mwaluko nawali umemile kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">hachi nayali yangikala mgati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">ila lelo naumema kukopola!<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Sendi zake naziwa wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:22">divai yake inojile naihanzigwa na mazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Vilongozi wake ndo walingubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">wangihanza na wahizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">weng'ha wangugana kupegwa chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">na kubilimila kubochela ndolendole kwa uviso.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">Hawalinguwalewela walekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">hachi za wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo haiwele chinhu kwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Lelo, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">“Ndobohola ng'halazi ya heni kwa wang'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">ndohilula chibida kwa walingitwanza na heni.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Ndogolola moko wa heni kuwawika hemwe mchanya mwa chiluli kota sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">ahyo, ndowusa wavu wa hemwe weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">na ukokomoche wa hemwe weng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Ndowapa hemwe watagusa kota vyoiwele hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">na walinguwalonjela hemwe mbuli za luhala kota vyoiwele aho mwaluko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">Hamba, Yelusalemu wochemigwa muji wa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">muji uwele nzinzili.”<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Muji wa Yelusalemu wogomboligwa kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:27">wala wawele mgati mwake, wawele nawalonga gehile ga hewo kwa kutanganika, woloholigwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Ila walingubelenhuka na wawele na gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:28">weng'ha wodumigwa hamwe na walingumleka Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Mobasigwa soni kwa vila namjifugamila jimalukolo hasi ha migodi ja mialoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">jiwele namwali mchijesa kota ndo jelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">modeuzwa kwa vila namjifugamila jimalukolo kuli vigunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">honhu hawele namihagulila kujifugamila.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Mowa kota mwaloni uwele mahamba gake ganguswina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:30">kota kagunda kalihela mazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Munhu yawele na mong'ho kokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">kota mahamba gakalile vyogalingulakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">mijito ja heye ndo kota ilapi lya chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">vyeng'ha vyolakala hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">haduhu wa kuchizimya acho chiluli.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">Kikala goya kulihela kuduma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mika 4:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Awu ndo ulonzi woyapegwe Isaya mwana wa Amosi, kuwala isi ya Yuda na muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Mhela wokuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">uwele chidunda cha ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">chowa chikulu kusinda vidunda vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">ena, chotogoligwa hali vidunda vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha woluta ako.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Wanhu wa isi nyinji wokuya na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">“Tuche, tulute kuchanya kuli chidunda cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">leka yatulanguse nzila za heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">natwe tuwinze vyoyodita heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Kwa vila malajizo golawa ako Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Kowadita wanhu wa isi nyinji wehanyise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">na kwamula kitwanza kwa wanhu wa isi zinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Wogongomanya mipanga ja hewo jiwe mihuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">na migoha ja hewo jiwe sengo za kutemela nhagala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Wanhu wa isi imwe hawochitowa na wanhu wa isi iyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">ne kilangusa ngondo kahi.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Muye, hemwe ivyazi lya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:5">tujende hali lumuli lwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Gwa Nguluwi, nakuwaleka wanhu wa hegwe, ivyazi lya Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">Nawamema uhawi ulingulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">wangulagula kota Wafilisti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">wangiyamba moko na wohambe wakuzele.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Isi ya hewo naimema sendi na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">ng'hano ya hewo ndo ng'hulu ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">Isi ya hewo naimema falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">mituka ja hewo ja kukwejigwa ndo minji lukami.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Isi ya hewo naimema jimalukolo ja milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">wangufugamila mijito ja moko ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">vinhu viwele navigongomanyigwa na hewo wawo.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Ahyo, chila munhu kobasigwa soni na kudeuzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:9">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kuwalechela ne hado!<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Mwinjile kuli mhalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">mivise kuli misimo ja kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">leka kiwika kutali na ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">kutali na ukulu wa undewa wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Zuwa lyanguya na ujuvi wa wanhu woduliswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">kidaya kwa chila munhu kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">Mkulu Nguluwi yaliyeka ndo kotogoligwa kuli zuwa alyo.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">kanalyo zuwa lyoyaliwichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">kwa chiwalo cha weng'ha walingidaya na wajuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">kowadulisa weng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Kojidumya mielezi jeng'ha ja Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:13">jiwele ng'wemang'wema lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:13">na mialoni jeng'ha ja Bashani,<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />na vidunda vyeng'ha viwele ng'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:14">na vidunda vidodo vyeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Kojiwifya milingo jiwele ng'wemang'wema ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:15">na chila ng'hanzi ziwele na ngome,<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />na meli zeng'ha za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:16">na chila meli inojile iwele kuli bahali.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17-18" />Kidaya kwa chila munhu kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17-18">na ujuvi wa wanhu woduliswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17-18">jimalukolo jeng'ha ja milungu jokwajilila ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17-18">Mkulu Nguluwi yaliyeka ndo kokwinuligwa kuli zuwa alyo.<verse eid="ISA 2:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Wanhu wobilimila kuli mhalika mgati mwa mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">kuli mikulubila kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">leka kiwika kutali na ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">na ukulu wa undewa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">hoyokuya kuikabusa isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Zuwa alyo, wanhu wojitajila migule na mipalabutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">jimalukolo ja hewo ja sendi na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">jowajigongomanye leka wajifugamile.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Wokwinjila kuli mhalika za kuli mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">na kuli misimo ja mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">leka kiwika kutali na ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">na ukulu wa undewa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">hoyokuya kuikabusa isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Mleche kitumbila kwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">kwa vila howeza kuwatanza hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">heye ndo ng'hochele na kobagama kuli mhela uchefu hela.<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Utaguso kwa wanhu wa muji wa Yelusalemu na kwa wa isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Lelo, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">ka habehi kuwosela wanhu wa muji wa Yelusalemu na isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">kitumbila kweng'ha kwa chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">na kitumbila kweng'ha kwa mazi.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Kahi kowosa wazidahe na wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">walingwamula na waloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">walaguzi na sekulu,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />chila chilongozi wa wamizi wa makumi gahano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">na wang'hangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">wanhu walinguwalonjela mbuli za luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">wawanzi ng'hatu na wahawi lukami.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Nguluwi kowadita wasongolo wawe wang'hangala wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:4">wana ndo wowalongoza.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Wanhu wochibunza hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">chila munhu na yalingikalasa habehi na heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">Msongolo kombeza sekulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">mpoka kombeza yalingutogoligwa.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Mhela awo munhu yumwe komlonjela mng'holoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">kuno wawele wang'hali kuli ng'handa ya mhaza wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">“Kwanalyo ikanzu, kwangutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">lelo uwe chilongozi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">ulongoze kuli muji awu, uwele sambi ndo chilundo cha mahame!”<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Ila zuwa alyo komwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">“Siweza kuwalolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">ndahela mzidi wa chilyo ne mivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">mleche kundita ndiwe chilongozi wa hemwe.”<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Wanhu wa muji wa Yelusalemu wanguzebeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">wanhu wa isi ya Yuda wangugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">kwa vila wangumbelenhuka Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">kwa ulonzi na madito ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">woubeza ukulu wa heye uwele hali hewo.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Kumeho kwa hewo kwangoneka kwangutawiza ago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">wangidayilaga gehile ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">hawalingugavisa kota Sodoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">Wochona wanhu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">kwa vila nawegalila hewo wawo kubagama.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Muwalonjele watanganiche ndaze vyowatambichizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:10">kwa vila wolya mafuza ga madito ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Wochona wehile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">Mbuli za hewo zowalutila vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">kwa vila gala gowaditile gowafika hewo wawo.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Wasongolo wanguwagaza wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">wadala wanguwalongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">Wanhu wa heni, vilongozi wa hemwe wanguwajiliza hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">wanguwadita hemwe mwajilile.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakewika goya kwamula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:13">kangwima kuwatagusa wanhu.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwalonjeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">wasekulu na vilongozi wa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">“Hemwe namuwifya mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">lufufu lowasukulwe wazunwa, lwa mng'handa mwa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Mwangulajila choni kuwabunza wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">na kuwaditila vibi wazunwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho, ndanguuza.”<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">“Wadala wa muji wa Yelusalemu ndo wajuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">wangujenda kuno nawenula singo za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">na meho gawele na maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">wangujenda kwa kidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">wawele na nhogo kuli magulu ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Ahyo, heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndogala mipu kuli vitwi vya wadala wa Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:17">na kuwavula nguwo leka wawe mwanzi.”<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Kuli zuwa alyo Mkulu kowasukula wadala wa Yelusalemu vinhu vya hewo vyeng'ha vyowalingidayila, viwele ndo nhogo na ugasi na vinoligo viwele na ulajilo wa nyelezi ndodo <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />na heleni na banjili za kuli magulu na shela <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />na vipembelo na ugasi wa vifundo vya kuli magulu na isali na mibuli ja unhunyhililo na mihilizi <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />na pete ziwele na muhuli na pete za kuli mhenyelo <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />na mikanzu jinojile na mivalo jinji na vihako vya kuwichila sendi <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />na vilolelo na mivalo ja kitani na nguwo zinojile za kuvala kuli vitwi na nguwo zinojile za kuvala kumeho.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Honhu ha kunhunyhilila kunojile, kowa kunhung'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">honhu ha isali, kowa ng'weso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">honhu ha mnvili zinojile, kowa chibuje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">honhu ha mivalo jinojile, kowa migunila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">honhu ha koneka kunojile, ndo ulajilo wa upogozi kwa mhuli wa chuma cha chiluli.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Walume wa hewo wokopoligwa kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:25">wazidahe wa hewo wokopoligwa kuli ngondo.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Lwizi ja muji wa Yelusalemu jolombocheza na kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">muji wowa kota mdala yasukuligwe chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">yekalise kuli nhimbwisi yawele yalihela chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Kuli zuwa alyo wadala saba womibata mlume yumwe na kumlonjela, “Chilyo na mivalo tochipalila twetwe, ila hegwe utusile soni ya hetwe, utukundize tuchemigwe kwa itagwa lya hegwe.”<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muji wa Yelusalemu wozenjigwa kahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Mhela wanguya uwele Mkulu Nguluwi koudita muji wa heye uwe na ukulu na mafuza menji na Waisilaeli wawele nawasigala amo wochidayila kuli chila chinhu kulawa kuli muji awo. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Chila yumwe yawele nakalechigwa ako Yelusalemu, yawele nakasulupuka kuli kukopoligwa kuli muji wula loudumigwe, kochemigwa wa chiuyeng'ha. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Mkulu wa heni kouhovuga wavu wa wadala wa Siyoni, koweliza usalagwe wa danda kulawa kwa wanhu wa Yelusalemu kwa muhe wa utaguso na muhe wa chiluli. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Hamba, Mkulu Nguluwi kolajila kota ka hamwe na hewo kwa kuidita ng'hungugu mhela wa nemisi na iyosi na chiluli chilingwaka goya mhela wa nechilo kuli chila honhu mchanya mwa chidunda cha Siyoni na mchanya hali nhing'hano za wanhu. Mzidi wa ago ukulu wa Nguluwi wougubika na kuwamila muji weng'ha. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Ukulu wa heye wowa ndo lubehelo lwa hewo kuli ivuche lya nemisi na honhu ha kubilimila na ngawo ya hewo mhela wa nhigu na nhonya.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lulinguwala mgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Ndokwimba kwa chiwalo cha goloko wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">kuwala mgunda wa heye wa mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">Goloko wa heni nayali na mgunda wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">kuli chidunda chiwele na mboto.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Nakaulima goya na kusa maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">nakoteza mizabibu jinojile ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">nakazenga ilingo lya kwamila mgati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">nakabawa isimo lya kukamila divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">Hamba nakabeteza kupata mbeta zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">ila mizabibu ajo najilela mafuza gausungu.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Ahyo goloko wa heni nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">“Lelo hemwe wenyeng'haye wa Yelusalemu na wanhu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:3">mtaguse hali heni na mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Ndahaditile chinhu chachi cha mzidi kuli mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">Nandali ndibeteza zabibu zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">lekachoni najilela zabibu zausungu?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Lelo ndowalonjela hemwe chondilingijesa kudita kuli mgunda wa heni wa mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">Ndokusa lugagala lwake, nawo wowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">ndobomola lukanzi lwake, nawo wobigangwa.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Ndouleka uwifigwe ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">mizabibu jake jolechigwa ne kutemigwa nhagala ne kulimilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">Mikwangwasale na miwa jozuchila amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">ndoilemeza nhonya ileche kutowa mchanya mwake.”<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Ena! Mgunda wa mizabibu wa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">ndo ivyazi lya Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">na mizabibu jinojile jiwele mgati mwake, ndo wanhu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Nayali yochitumbila hachi, ila nakona kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">nayali yochitumbila kutanganika, ila nawambuza chililo!<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wihe na nhaguso</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Mochona hemwe mlingonjeza kugula ng'handa chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">na kulutilila kugula migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">honhu heng'ha hanguwa ha hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">mbaka hanguwa haduhu honhu ha kikala wanhu wanji kuli isi.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakalonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">“Ndikomya, ng'handa ng'hulu zowa uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">ng'handa zizenjigwe kwa sendi nyinji, zowa zilihela wanhu wa kikala.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Mgunda wa mizabibu wa eka kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">wolavya lita makumi meli na gane hela ga divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">yalingunyala kilo miya imwe za nyhadikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">kobeta kilo kumi hela za nyhule.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Wochona hewo walingwinuka lufuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">leka kubilimila kunwa ujimbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">na walingukawila ng'hatu mbaka nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">mbaka wagale ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Wana ving'hweleng'hwele na igombogombo kuli mnvina za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">ngoma ndodo na mluli na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">ila hawalingijesa kuwala madito ga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">ne kujitogola mijito jake.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Ahyo, wanhu wa heni wowinjigwa leka walute kuli isi ya chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">kwa vila wahela kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">wang'hangala wa hewo wobagama kwa nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">wanhu wa hewo wenji wobagama kwa ng'halu.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Isi ya wabagame yanguwabeteza kwa maya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">yangugabula mlomo mbaka kuduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">Mgati mwake wodulika wakulu wa hewo na wanhu wanji wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">hamwe na wajuvi na walingudita mnvina weng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Chila munhu koditigwa yadeule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:15">weng'ha walingidaya woduliswa.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kotogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">kwa chiwalo cha hachi ya heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">Nguluwi Yelile kochilajila yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">kota ka yelile kwa hachi ya heye.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Kuli mahame ga miji ajo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">ming'holo jolya misolo amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">vinyehe vyopata chilyo mumo.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Wochona walingukwega gehile kwa ng'weso za uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">na wihe kota kwa ng'weso za ibilibingwa,<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />walingulonga kuno womseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">“Nguluwi udite himahima kutugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">twangugana kona goulonjile kota kogadita.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">Gwa, yelile wa Isilaeli weneze kunuwila kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">utawize leka tuvizele.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Wochona walingulonga kota wihe ndo kunoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">na kunoga ndo wihe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">Wochona kahi walingulonga kota jiza ndo lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">na lumuli ndo jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">na kota usungu ndo unojenoje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">na unojenoje ndo usungu.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Wochona walingiwona kota wana luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:21">na kota wana nyhala.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Wochona hewo walingunwa divai lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:22">walingunwa ujimbi ulivinji,<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />wala walinguwalechela wawele na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:23">kwa kubochela chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:23">ila wanguwabunza hachi walihela nongwa.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Ahyo, kota chiluli chilingulakaza misolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">kota vila miwa vyojilingulakala kuli milapi ja chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">ndo mizabi ja hewo vyojilingola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">Uluwa wake wowembeluswa kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">kwa vila nawagalema malajizo ga Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">na kuubeza ulonzi wa Yelile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Ahyo, ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi yangwaka kwa wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">moko wa heye nawinuligwa na kanguwatowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Vidunda vyangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">mitufi ndo kota wavu kuli nzila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Ila ng'halazi ya heye haisindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">moko wa heye ung'hali winuligwe leka kuwatowa.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangwinula bendela ya ulajilo kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">kanguwatowela mluli wanhu wawele kuli kuduma kwa isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">Nawo wanguya himahima!<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Haduhu ne yumwe hali hewo yatochile ne kikwang'wala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">ne yumwe wa yalingusinzila ne kuwasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">ne isali liwele haliwopigwe goya mchuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">ne ng'weso ya ikwamba idumuche.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Misale ja hewo najihongoka lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">mipinde ja hewo najikwejigwa leka kiwika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">kwato za falasi wa hewo ndo kota maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">maguludumu ga mituka ja hewo ja kitowela ngondo ndo kota mbeho ya chivuluvumbi.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Wamizi wa hewo wangubuma kota misimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">jiwele najibata upelembi na kuhilika honhu ha kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">hawele haduhu yoneche yawele koweza kusukula.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Kuli zuwa alyo meswang'honyo wa Waisilaeli wobuma kuli isi ya Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">kota kubuguma kwa bahali itiguche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">Wone munhu koilola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">kovyona jiza na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">lumuli logubikwa na jiza totolo lya ng'hungugu.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangumchema Isaya leka yawe mloli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Kuli mwaka wula uwele mndewa Usiya nakabagama, nandimona Mkulu Nguluwi yekalise kuli chigoda cha undewa, chiwele kuchanya ng'hatu na chitogoligwe ng'hatu, lupembo lwa ikanzu lyake nalyenela kuli ng'handa yeng'ha ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Nakwali na vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa viwele navichizunguluta chigoda, chila chimwe nachali na mabawa sita. Mabawa meli nagagubika kumeho kwa hewo na mabawa ganji meli nagagubika magulu ga hewo na mabawa ganji meli navitumiya kuguluka. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Chila chilumbigwe nachali chitowa iyowe na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">“Yelile, yelile, yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">ndo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na mong'ho!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">Isi yeng'ha naimema ukulu wa heye.”<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Kwa lizi lyawo fulemu za lwizi na mhajilo zake kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi navitigasika na ng'handa ya Nguluwi naimema iyosi. <verse eid="ISA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Ahyo nandonga, “Ndochona heni! Aku ndo kuduma kwa heni, kwa vila mlomo wa heni ndo ukokomoche na ndangikala hali wanhu wakokomoche. Kwa meho gangu nandimona mndewa, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Hamba chilumbigwe chimwe hali vila vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa nachiguluka kuya kwa heni chiwele na ikala lya chiluli lilingwaka mmoko mwake, liwele nayali yaliholile kwa kolewo kulawa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Nakandoliza nalyo kuli mlomo wa heni na kulonga, “Ulole, ali nalidoliza mlomo wa hegwe, wihe wa hegwe nawusigwa na gehile ga hegwe nagalechelwa.”<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Hamba nanyulika lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi yolonga, “Ndimlajize whaani? Whaani koluta kwa chiwalo cha hetwe?” Nani nandonga, “Heni baha. Ndajize heni!”<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Naye nakalonga, “Ulute ukawalonjele wanhu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">“ ‘Mohulichiza ng'hatu, ila hamuweza kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">molola ng'hatu, ila hamkona kukomya.’<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Uzidite nhumbula za wanhu wano ziwe zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">udite makutu ga hewo galeche kuhulika, meho ga hewo gafute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">leka waleche kona kwa meho ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">na kuhulika kwa makutu ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">kuvizela kwa nyhala za hewo na kungalamchila na kuloholigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Ahyo nandonga, “Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, mbaka nili?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">Naye nakanyhidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">“Mbaka aho miji hojilechigwa mahame ne wenyeng'haye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">mbaka ng'handa hoziwa ne wanhu wa kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">na migunda hojiwifigwa na kudumigwa,<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />mbaka Mkulu Nguluwi hoyosinda kumhilika chila yumwe kutali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:12">na kuidita isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli iwe uchiwa.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Hanga honhu hamwe ha kumi ha wanhu wosigala kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">wodumigwa kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">Ila kota vila mvinje ama mwaloni vyoulinguleka chibichi houtemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">ndo vyoiwa nyhadikwa yelile kuli isi.”<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa mndewa Ahasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Mhela mndewa Ahasi, mwana wa Yotamu, mwana wa Usiya, loyawele mndewa wa Yuda, mndewa Lesini, wa Alamu na Peka, mwana wa Lemaliya, mndewa wa Isilaeli, nawaluta kuutowa muji wa Yelusalemu, ila hawawezile kuuhola. <verse eid="ISA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Mndewa wa Yuda loyahuliche kota Waalamu nawelumba na Waefulaimu, heye hamwe na wanhu wake weng'ha wa Yuda nawadumba na kukakama kota migodi ja kuchihulo jilingutigaswa kwa mbeho. <verse eid="ISA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlonjela Isaya, “Hegwe na mwanago Sheali-Yashubu mlute kiting'hana na mndewa Ahasi. Komfika mnzila hawele hana wanhu walingugongomanya nguwo, kuli kuduma kwa chikolola chilingigala mazi kulawa kuli ilamba lya kuchanya. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Mlonjele yelolele goya na yasindamale na yaleche kudumba. Yaleche kutweguka nhumbula kwa chiwalo cha wanhu awa weli wawele kota vibichi vya ngodi vilingufung'ha iyosi. Chiluli cha ng'halazi ing'ang'ale ya Lesini wa Alamu na ya mwana wa Lemaliya cha habehi kuzimya. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Kwa vila nawewika goya leka kukudumya kuno wolonga, <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />‘Tulute kuivaba isi ya Yuda, tuwadite wanhu wawe na lunhwinhwi leka tuihole isi na tumuwiche mwana wa Tabeeli leka yawe mndewa wa hewo.’<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />“Ila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:7">mbuli ayi haikoleka ne kulawila,<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8-9" />kwa vila muji ukulu wa Alamu ndo Damasiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">na ayo Lesini ndo chilongozi wa Damasiko hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">Muji ukulu wa Efulaimu ndo Samaliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">na mwana wa Lemaliya ndo mkulu wa Samaliya hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">Kuli miyaka makumi sita na jihano jilinguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">ulongozi wa Efulaimu wowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">Efulaimu haiweza kuchemigwa isi kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8-9">Wone makundo ga hemwe hagowa nzinzili, hamuweza kwimilila.”<verse eid="ISA 7:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalajiza usenga wunji kwa mndewa Ahasi kwa kukolela Isaya, ulingulonga, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />“Mlande Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe yakupe ulajilo, hanji uwe kulawa mgati ng'hatu ama kulawa kuchanya ng'hatu.” <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Ila Ahasi nakedichila, “Silanda ulajilo! Silingugana kumjeza Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Lelo Isaya nakalonga, “Uhulichize lelo hegwe ivyazi lya Daudi! Ihega kuwajeza wanhu. Dedede, mleche kumjeza Nguluwi wa heni. <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kowapa ulajilo. Mhinza kowa na himila na koponda mwana mlume, naye komchema itagwa lyake Imanweli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Imanweli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ulonzi awu una mana Nguluwi ka hamwe na hetwe.</char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Kolya jibini na hanombwa mbaka hoyoweza kulema gehile na kuhagula ganojile. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Ila mhela mwana hoyowa yang'hali kuvizela kulema gehile na kuhagula ganojile, isi za wandewa awo weli ulinguwadumba zowa mahame. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Mkulu Nguluwi kokugalila hegwe hamwe na wanhu wa hegwe na ivyazi lyeng'ha lya chiundewa mazuwa ga magazo kusinda mazuwa gala gawele nagalawila kulawa mhela uwele wanhu wa Efulaimu lowebagule na isi ya Yuda, mina kowegalila hemwe mndewa wa Ashulu.”<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Kuli zuwa alyo Mkulu Nguluwi kowatowela mluli wanhu wa Misili woye kota ng'honzi kulawa kuli vikolola vya lwanda lwa Naili na wanhu wa Ashulu woye kota nzuchi kulawa kuli isi ya hewo. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Weng'ha wokuya na kikala kuli mibindi jiwele uchiwa na kuli mhalika ziwele kuli mitalawe na kuli visosolo vyeng'ha viwele na miwa na kuli honhu hawele migongolo jangunwaga mazi. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Kuli zuwa alyo Mkulu Nguluwi kotumiya nzembe kulawa kumwambu mwa lwanda lwa Eyufulate, iwele ndo mndewa wa Ashulu, kobeya mnvili za kumutwi mwa hemwe na milaika ja kuli ng'huli za hemwe na kusa kahi lulevu lwa hemwe. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Kuli zuwa alyo, munhu koweza kuwa na ilogota limwe na ming'holo mili hela, <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />najo jolavya matombo kwa winji mbaka kowa na jibini ya kulya. Wanhu wawele wosigala kuli isi wolya jibini na hanombwa. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Mhela awo, chila honhu kuli mgunda wa mizabibu uwele na mizabibu elufu imwe jiwele chila mzabibu nawali uwhanizwa na sendi igwala limwe, wowa na mikwangwasale na miwa yeka. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Wanhu woluta ako kupelemba wawele na mipinde na misale, kwa vila isi yeng'ha yowa igubikwe na miwa na mikwangwasale. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Kuwala vidunda vyeng'ha viwele navyali vilimigwa kwa ihuka, hamuweza kuluta ako kahi, kwa chiwalo cha lunhwinhwi lwa kuhomwa na miwa. Howa ndo honhu ha kudimila misenga na ming'holo hela.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Isaya kanguwa ulajilo kwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela, “Uhole mbawo ng'hulu, wandiche mchanya mwake kwa kalamu ya hihi hela ulonzi awu, ‘Maheli-shalali-hashi-basi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maheli-shalali-hashi-basi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ulonzi awu kwa Chiebulaniya una mana ya “Uhole himahima, usukule himahima.”</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Nani ndowachema watambika Uliya na Sekaliya, mwana wa Yebelekiya, kota walolezi wa heni wa kitumbila.”<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Hamba nanduta na kuwasa na mche wa heni yawele naye kahi nayali mloli, naye nakawa na himila, nakaponda mwana. Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela, “Mcheme ayo mwana Maheli-shalali-hashi-basi. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Mwana hoyowa yang'hali kudaha kulonga, ‘Mhaza’ ama ‘Mamo,’ lufufu lwa Damasiko na vinhu viholigwe kulawa kuli ngondo ako Samaliya, vyoholigwa na mndewa wa Ashulu.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa wa Ashulu kanguya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na heni kahi, nakandonjela, <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />“Kwa vila wanhu awa nawagalema mazi ga Shilo galinguchililika mholemhole na nawasangalala kwa chiwalo cha Lesini na Peka, mwana wa Lemaliya, <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />ahyo, heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndowegala wamizi wa isi ya Ashulu na mong'ho wawo weng'ha kuivaba isi ya Yuda. Wokuya kota mazi tendema ga lwanda lwa Eyufulate, gomema mbaka kuli nhenje za lwanda lweng'ha, <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />gozunguluta himahima mchanya mwake, kuno gokola hagati mbaka kufika kuli singo. Ila Nguluwi ka hamwe na hetwe na mabawa gake gagonzoligwe gogubika isi yeng'ha kwa chiwalo cha kutwamila!”<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">mlute kumwando na miwiche goya kwa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">ila mobenangwa kuli vihande!<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Miwiche goya, ila molemwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">muwalajize wamizi wa hemwe, ila hawoweza kulutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">kwa vila Nguluwi ka hamwe na hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangumkanya mloli kuwala kudumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalongasa na heni kuno moko wa heye uwele na mong'ho uwele mchanya mwa heni, yondonjela ndeche kuiwinza nzila ya wanhu wa isi ayi, nakalonga, <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />“Uleche kilumba kuli mbuli za hewo zihile ne kudumba gala gowalingugadumba ne kuwa na lunhwinhwi. <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />Unzele heni ndiliyeka, Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho kota ndo yelile, undumbe na kufugamila heni ndiliyeka. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Ndowa honhu ha kubilimila, kahi ndowa iganga lilingwambuza wanhu kikwang'wala na italawe lya kuugwisa undewa wa isi za Isilaeli na Yuda, ndowa idiwa lya kuwagwiliza wenyeng'haye wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Wanhu wenji wochikwang'wala na kugwa na kubeneka, wogwilizwa kuli idiwa alyo na kuholigwa na wang'honyo wa hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Uliwiche goya ilajizo alyo na kulihinda ilanguso hali walingumbinza. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Nani ndombeteza Mkulu Nguluwi yawele nakevisa, nakewika kutali na walelwa wa Yakobo, ndochitumbila kwa heye. <verse eid="ISA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Heni hamwe na wana woyamhele Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ulajilo wa makanyo kuli Isilaeli, kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, yalingikala kuli chidunda cha Siyoni. <verse eid="ISA 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Wanhu wanji wowalonjela hemwe, “Mlande utanzi kwa walingulonga na mihoka na kwa walaguzi walingulila kota videje. Ndaze, wanhu hawalinguganigwa kupala mbuli kwa Nguluwi wa hewo? Ndaze, walute kwa wanhu wabagame kwa chiwalo cha walingikala?” <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Ndikomya, yalingulonga ahyo yang'hali kona lumuli. Ila hemwe mibatilile gala malajizo ga malanguso ga Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Wanhu wolubaluba kuli isi kuno wawele wagaziche ng'hatu na wawele na nzala. Howogazika kwa nzala, wowa na ng'halazi lukami na kumpanjila mndewa wa hewo na kumpanjila Nguluwi wa hewo howolola kuchanya. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Wolola kuli chila honhu muisi, wogona magazo hela na jiza na masinzo. Haduhuli yawele koweza kiwika kutali na jiza alyo likulu.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">Mwana nakapondigwa kwa chiwalo cha hetwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Wala wanhu wawele nawali wochikala kuli isi ya Yuda wawele nawagazigwa, hawolutilila kuwa kuli magazo. Aho hamwande Mkulu Nguluwi nakawadita wanhu wa isi ziwele nhanzi za Sebuluni na Nafutali nazali zichikala, wanyenyetele. Ila kuli mazuwa galinguya Nguluwi kowadita wanhu walingikala kuli mkowa wa Galilaya hafungo ha nzila, kuwele ndo hagati ha lwanda lwa Yolodani na bahali ya Mediteleniyani, kuwele wajenzi walingikala, watogoligwe.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Wanhu walingujenda kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">nawalwona lumuli lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">wala walingikala kuli isi ya jiza totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">lelo lumuli naluwalangazila.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuwadita wanhu wa hegwe Waisilaeli wonjezeche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">nakonjeza kusangalala kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">wangusangalala hali hegwe kota wanhu vyowalingusangalala mhela wa mbena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">kota wamizi vyowalingusangalala howowa wochigawila vinhu vya kulawa kuli ngondo.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Nakubena mong'ho wa walinguwatunya wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">wanhu wawele nawawadita wanhu wa hegwe wawe wapogozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">Nakuwagombola kota vyouwalohole wanhu wa hegwe kulawa kwa Wamidiani.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Chila ikwamba lya mwamizi litumiche kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">chila ivalo liwele na usalagwa wa danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">vyowichigwa kwa chiwalo cha kulakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">vyowa usalagani wa kubwinila chiluli.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Mina kwa chiwalo cha hetwe, mwana nakapondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">natupegwa mwana mlume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">naye kopegwa ludali lwa kulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">kochemigwa, “Yalingulonga mbuli za luhala, yalingububuwaza” na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">“Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho” na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">“Mhaza wa mazuwa gose” na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">“Mndewa wa kikala goya.”<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Mong'ho wa ulongozi wa heye wolutilila kukula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">undewa wa heye wowa kuli kikala goya mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">Kowa mhalizi wa mndewa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">kolongoza kwa hachi na kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">kulawa sambi mbaka mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">Maya ga Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, gokweneza aga.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi kwa Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalavya utaguso kuli undewa wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:8">kuli lulelo lwa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Wanhu weng'ha wovizela kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">Waefulaimu na wenyeng'haye wa Samaliya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">wawele wangulonga kwa ujuvi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">na kidaya kwa nhumbula za hewo, wolonga,<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Ng'hanzi ziwele nazizenjigwa kwa mitufali nazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:10">ila tozizenga kahi kwa maganga gahongoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:10">mitini najigwiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:10">ila tonyala mielezi honhu hake.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Kwa chiwalo acho Mkulu Nguluwi komha mong'ho mng'honyo wa Lesini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">kowadita wawe na ng'halazi ing'ang'ale.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Waalamu kulawa ubanzi wa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">Wafilisti kulawa ubanzi wa kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">nawagabula milomo ja hewo kuimela Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">Ila, ng'halazi ya heye haisindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">moko wa heye ung'hali ugololigwe kwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Hanga nakawagaza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">ila hawamhiluchile Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Lelo, kwa mhela wa zuwa limwe hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">Mkulu Nguluwi kodumula vitwi na michila kuli Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">nhagala ya igodi lya mchikichi na misolo.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Wasekulu na wanhu walinguzeleka lukami ndo vitwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:15">waloli walingulangusa udesi ndo michila.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Wala walinguwalongoza wanhu awa wanguwajiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">walingulongozwa nawajilila.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi halingusangalala kwa chiwalo cha wasongolo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">ne kuwonela isungu walekwa na wadala wafililwe na walume wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">kwa vila haduhu ne yumwe wa hewo yalingumdumba Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">nawo ndo wehile na walingulonga mbuli za upoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">Ila ng'halazi ya heye haisindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">yang'hali yagolole moko wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Ndikomya wihe wangwakaga kota chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">wangulakaza miwa na mikwangwasale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">wangwakaga kota chiluli kuli visosolo vya kuchihulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">wangipilinjila kuluta kuchanya kota izengo lya iyosi.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Kwa ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">isi yolakazwa kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">wanhu wowa ngodi za chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">Haduhu munhu yoweza kumonela isungu mng'holoze.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Ubanzi wa kudilo wowa wodakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">ila wang'hali wokona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">ubanzi wa kumoso wowa wolya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">ila hawochiguta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Chila yumwe komulya mwanage yuye.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manase komulya Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">naye Efulaimu komulya Manase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">nawo weng'ha weli, womditila vibi Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">Ila ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi haisindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:21">yang'hali yagolole moko wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Wochona walinguwika malajizo galihela hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:1">walingulavya mizilo ja kubunza,<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />kuleka kuwapa wazunwa hachi za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">na kulemeza hachi za wanhu wa heni walingubunzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">kuwadita wafililwe na walume wa hewo kuwa upelembi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">na kuwasukula walekwa.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Modita choni kuli zuwa lya magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">mhela kubagama hokukuya kulawa kutali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Mombilimila whaani yawape utanzi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Moleka kohi lufufu lwa hemwe?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Hakuwa na chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">ila kisinza hali wapogozi wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">ama kugwa hali wakopoligwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Kwa aga geng'ha, ng'halazi ya heye haisindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">moko wa heye ung'hali winuligwe mchanya.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa Nguluwi hali Ashulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">“Kochona heye Ashulu, ng'hobwa ya ng'halazi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">heye yalingibata nyhimbati ya kuzudila kwa heni!<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Ndangumlajiza kwa wanhu wa isi wohambe wafugamile heni Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">ndangumlajiza hali wanhu wa isi walingundita nzudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">kuwabata wapogozi wa ngondo na kuhola vinhu vya kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">kahi kuwabiganga hasi kota nhope kuli nzila.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Ila heye Ashulu hanuwile ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">heye nayali na kunuwila kunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">nakanuwila kuwifya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">kuwadumya wanhu wa isi zinji wenji ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Kwa vila nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:8">‘Vilongozi wa wamizi wa heni ndo wanoga kota wandewa.<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Nandiudumya muji wa Kalino kota vyondiudumye muji wa Kalikemishi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">Nandiudumya muji wa Hamati kota vyondiudumye muji wa Alipadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">nandiudumya muji wa Samaliya kota vyondiudumye muji wa Damasiko.<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Kota vila moko wa heni vyouholile undewa wa jimalukolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:10">undewa uwele jimalukolo ja hewo najali minji kusinda jila ja Yelusalemu na Samaliya.<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />Ndaze, siuditila vibi muji wa Yelusalemu na jimalukolo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:11">kota vyondiuditile vibi muji wa Samaliya na jimalukolo jake?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi hoyowa yasindile mijito ja heye jeng'ha kuli chidunda cha Siyoni na kuli muji wa Yelusalemu, kolonga, “Ndomtowa mndewa wa Ashulu kwa chiwalo cha kidaya na ujuvi wa nhumbula ya heye.”<verse eid="ISA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Kwa vila nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">“Kwa moko wa heni uwele na mong'ho nandita aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">kwa luhala lwa heni, kwa vila ndina kuvizela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">Nambusa mbaka ja wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">nanyhola ng'hano ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">kota yazidahe, nandiwasumya wandewa wa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Kota munhu vyoyalingwinjiza moko kuli chimvulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">ndo hihyo moko wa heni vyouholile lufufu lwa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">kota wanhu vyowalingukungajiza mafinga galechigwe kuli chimvulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">ndo vyong'hungajize isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">haduhu ne yumwe yatowile ibawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">ama kugabula mlomo wa heye kutowa iyowe.”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">“Ndaze, iwago lyanguweza kidaya kota lina mong'ho kusinda yula yalingutumiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">ama msumeno kitogola kusinda yula yalingutumiya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Ndaze, ng'hobwa yanguweza kumdita munhu yakole mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">ama ng'hweku kumwinula yalinguitumiya?”<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Ahyo Mkulu, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">kolajiza utamwa wa kuwadita wamizi wazidahe wa heye wagande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">lutogo lwawo lwolakazwa kwa chiluli.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Nguluwi yawele ndo lumuli lwa Isilaeli, kowa kota chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">Yelile wa Isilaeli kowa ilapi lya chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">chiwele kuli zuwa limwe cholakaza chila chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">Wamizi wa Ashulu wolakazwa kota miwa na mikwangwasale.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Lutogo lwa vihulo vyake na migunda jake jinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">vyolakazwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:18">kota vila mtamwa vyoyalinguwa ng'hochele ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Migodi jiwele josigala kuli vihulo vyake jowa michefu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:19">mbaka mwana mdodo koweza kujiwaza.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli wasigale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Zuwa lyokuya liwele walelwa wa Yakobo wasigale, ena, Waisilaeli wawele wosigala hawochitumbila kahi kwa wanhu wa isi wawele nawawagaza, ila wochitumbila ng'hatu kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="ISA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Walelwa wa Yakobo wachefu wawele wosigala womhiluchila Nguluwi Mkulu. <verse eid="ISA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Hanga Waisilaeli ndo wenji kota sangalaza za mhwani, wachefu hela ndo wohiluka. Kudumya nakulajizwa kukoleche na kokoleka kwa hachi. <verse eid="ISA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Ena! Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, kokweneza choyalingugana kudita kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi koizapa Ashulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kangulonga hino, “Hemwe wanhu wa heni mlingikala muji wa Yelusalemu, mleche kuwadumba Waashulu wawele wanguwatowa hemwe kwa ng'hobwa, howokwinula nyhimbati za hewo kwa chiwalo cha hemwe kota vyowaditile Wamisili. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Kwa vila ung'hali mhela uchefu hela, ng'halazi ya heni kwa hemwe yoduma na kuzudila kwa heni kowagwila Waashulu na kuwadumya. <verse eid="ISA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho ndowazapa kota vyondiwaditile Waamidiani kuli italawe lya Olebu. Ndolajila mong'ho wa heni kuwatowa Waashulu kota vyondiwaditile Wamisili. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Mhela awo itunyo lyowawadwichile ndolyusa na ngwamo yowawawichile msingo mwa hemwe yobenigwa, kwa vila singo za hemwe zowa ng'hulu ng'hatu.”<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wang'honyo wa habehi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Wamizi wa Ashulu nawafika mujini Ayati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:28">Nawakolela ako Migiloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:28">mhomolo za hewo nawazileka Mikimashi.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Nawaloka honhu ha kulochela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">nechilo ayi wanguwasa Geba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Wanhu wa Lama wangukakama kwa lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">wanyeng'haye wa Gibeya, muji wa Sauli, nawabilima.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Mtowe iyowe hemwe wanhu wa Galimu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">Muwiche goya ikutu hemwe wanhu wa Laisha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">Mochona hemwe wenyeng'haye wa Anatoti!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Wanhu wa Medimena wangubilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:31">wenyeng'haye wa Gebimu wangivisa.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Lehano wang'honyo wowika kambi ako Nobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">wotigasa ngumi zawo kwa chiwalo cha chidunda cha Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">ena, kwa chiwalo cha muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kozitema nhagala zake kwa ng'halazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">migodi jiwele ng'wemang'wema ng'hatu jogwiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">wawele kuchanya wobasigwa soni.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Kovitema visosolo vya kuchihulo kwa iwago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:34">Lebanoni na mielezi jake mikulu jogwa.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Undewa wa kikala goya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Kota nhagala inyale kuli chibichi cha igodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">kolawila mlelwa wa mndewa Daudi yawele kowa mndewa.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Muhe wa Mkulu Nguluwi wochikala mchanya mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">muhe wa luhala na kuvizela ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">muhe wa ulonzi unojile na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">muhe wa uwanzi na kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Kusangalala kwa heye kowa kuli kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">Hotagusa kwa kuwinza gala hoyogona kwa meho ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">ne kwamula kwa kugawinza gala goyohulika kwa makutu ga heye,<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />ila kwa kutanganika kowapa hachi wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">kowahulichiza na kokwamula goya hali walingunyenyetela muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">Kwa ulonzi wa heye, koizapa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">kwa lweselo lwa mlomo wa heye, kowakopola wehile.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Hachi yowa kota isali lya kiwoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:5">kugoloka kochikala naye kota isali mchuno mwa heye.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Libwa lya kisolo lyochikala hamwe na ing'holo lyana kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">iduma lyowasa hamwe na chinyehe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">Milogota na lyana isimba jolya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">mwana mdodo kojilongoza.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Isenga na idubu jolya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">milogota na myana ja idubu jowasa hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">na isimba lyolya misolo jikalile kota isenga.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Chali chodawala kuli isimo lya izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:8">mwana koweza kwinjiza moko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:8">kuli isimo lya izoka liwele na dunga.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Hawoweza kuwalumiza ne kuwadumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">mchanya mwa chidunda cha heni cheng'ha chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">kwa vila isi yomema wanhu walingumzela Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">kota vila mazi vyogalingumemeza bahali.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawele nawahilikwa kuli isi za chijenzi wohiluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Zuwa alyo, mlelwa wa mndewa Daudi kowa kota bendela kwa wanhu wa isi. Wanhu wa isi wompala na haluga hake howa na lutogo. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Zuwa alyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kogolola moko wa heye leka kuwahilula kahi wanhu wa heye wawele nawasigala ako Ashulu na Misili na Patilosi na Kushi na Elamu na Shinali na Hamati na honhu ha mhwani.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi kolavya ulajilo kwa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">kuwakungajiza Waisilaeli wawele kuli isi za chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">kowakungajiza wanhu wa Yuda wasambaluche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">kulawa kuli banzi zeng'ha za isi.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Fihi ya Isilaeli kwa Yuda yoduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">kowa haduhu ung'honyo hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Isilaeli howeza kumwonela fihi Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">ne Yuda howeza kuwa mng'honyo wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Weng'ha hamwe wowavaba Wafilisti wawele kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">hamwe wowasukula wanhu walingikala kolilawilaga isanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Wowasumya Waedomu na Wamoabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Waamoni wowahulichiza hewo.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Mkulu Nguluwi koikaza guba ya bahali ya shamu iwele Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">kwa lweselo lwake lulingulakaza, kokaza lwanda lwa Eyufulate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">nawo wogawanuka kuli vikolola saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">leka wanhu waloche amo ne kudoda magulu.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Kowa na nzila ng'hulu kulawa Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heye wasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">kota vyoiwele kwa Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">mhela vyowalawile kuli isi ya Misili.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Kulonga malumbo na kutogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Kuli zuwa alyo hegwe kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">“Ndokutogola, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">hanga aho hamwande nakunzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">ila sambi ng'halazi ya hegwe ya kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">nagwe nakunyhembuliza.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Ndikomya Nguluwi ndo ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">ndochitumbila kwa heye ne kudumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mong'ho wa heni na lwimbo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">nakawa ulohozi wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Mosangalala kwa chiwalo cha ulohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:3">kota munhu yawele na ng'halu kudeha mazi kulawa kuli mideho.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Kuli zuwa alyo hegwe kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">“Ulonje malumbo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ulicheme itagwa lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">uzelese kwa wanhu wa isi gala goyagaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">uwikule itagwa lyake kota ndo likulu.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Umwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa vila nakadita mbuli ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:5">ali lizeleche kuli isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Utowe iyowe, wimbe kwa usangalalo, hegwe munhu wa muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">kwa vila mkulu hali hegwe, ndo Nguluwi, yawele Yelile wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala Babuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Usenga kuwala Babuloni uwele Isaya, mwana wa Amosi nakalajilwa na Nguluwi kuli uloli ndo awu.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">“Muwiche bendela mchanya mwa chidunda chilihela migodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">muwatowele iyowe wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">muwalajile wanhu moko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">leka wenjile kuli lwizi lwa muji lwa wakulu.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Nandiwalajiza wawele chiuyeng'ha wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">nandiwachema wazidahe wa heni, leka weneze ng'halazi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">wala walingusangalala kwa chiwalo cha kusumya kwa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Mhulichize iyowe mchanya mwa chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">kota lila lya lung'hongola lukulu lwa wanhu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Mhulichize iyowe hagati ha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">kota wanhu wa isi walingikungajiza hamwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">kangukungajiza wamizi kwa chiwalo cha ngondo.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Wanguya kulawa kuli isi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">kulawa kuli isi za kutali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">Mkulu Nguluwi yawele na vinhu vya kitowela ngondo vya ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">kanguya kuidumya isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Mlombocheze, kwa vila zuwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi lya habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">lyokuya kota kuwifya kulawa kwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Kwa chiwalo acho, moko ga chila munhu gokwisilwa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:7">chila munhu kotweguka nhumbula.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Wanhu wotigaswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">wowa na lunhwinhwi na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">wowa na usungu kota mdala yawele habehi kuponda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">Wochilola kwa lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">kumeho kwa hewo kolajila kudumba.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Mlole, zuwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi lyanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">zuwa lihile liwele na kuzudila na ng'halazi ing'hang'hale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">Zuwa alyo lyoidita isi iwe uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">lyowadumya wanhu wawele na gehile wawele mgati mwake.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Nhondwe za kilanga na vilundo vya nhondwe havilavya lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">Isanya holilawa lyotiligwa jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">na nyelezi hailavya lumuli lwake.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">“Ndomzapa chila munhu kuli isi kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa heye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">na wehile kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">Ndokusa kidaya kwa mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">ndodulisa ujuvi wa wanhu wawele na nhumbula zihile.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Wanhu wasulupuche ndowadita wawe wachefu kusinda zahabu inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">wowa wopaligwa ng'hatu kusinda zahabu ya Ofili.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Ahyo ndoudita ulanga ukakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">isi nayo yotigasika kuli misisi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">kwa chiwalo cha kuzudila kwa heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">kuli zuwa lya ng'halazi ya heni ilingwaka.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />“Kota ibala lilingupelembwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">kota ming'holo jilihela mdimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">chila yumwe kochilumba na wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">chila yumwe kobilimila kuli isi ya heye.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Yoneche hoyobatigwa kotuligwa lida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">weng'ha howobatigwa wokopoligwa kwa ipanga.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Vyali vya hewo vyohondangwa hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:16">ng'handa za hewo zoholigwa na wowasa na wache wa hewo kwa lupichi.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />“Ulole, ndowambuza Wamediya kuwatowa Wababuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">Wamediya wawele wahela maya ga sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">ne kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha zahabu.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Misale jawo jowakopola wasongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">hawowa na isungu kwa vyali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">ne kuwalola wana kwa isungu.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Muji wa Babuloni, ukulu wa undewa weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">na kuzeleka kwa ujuvi wa Wakalidayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">wowa kota miji ja Sodoma na Gomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">mhela heni, Mkulu Nguluwi londijidumile.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Haduhu yawele kochikala Babuloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">Haduhu Mwalabu yawele kowika ihema lyake ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">ne mdimi yawele kodima vilundo vya migongolo jake ako.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Ila vilumbigwe vya kuchiwala vyowasa ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">mibwa ja kisolo jomema kuli mahame ago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">mituwe jochikala amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">nazo mhelele zodawala amo.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Mibwa ja kisolo jolila mgati mwa ngome zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">mikanhu jowa mgati mwa ng'handa za sendi nyinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">Mhela wake naufika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">mazuwa gake hagokonjezwa.”<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Yuda wanguhiluka kulawa kuli isi ya chijenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kowonela isungu kahi wanhu wa Yakobo, ena, kowahagula kahi Waisilaeli. Kowahilula kuli isi ya hewo wawo na wajenzi wokuya kikala hamwe na wanhu wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Wanhu wa isi wowatanza Waisilaeli kuhiluka kuli isi yowapegwe na Mkulu Nguluwi, aho wanhu wa isi wowakolela mijito Waisilaeli. Wala wawele nawawadita Waisilaeli wawe wakola mijito, nawo woditigwa wawe wakola mijito kwa Waisilaeli, kahi Waisilaeli wowalongoza wala wawele nawawabunza.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa wa Babuloni kangukopoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, zuwa limwe Mkulu Nguluwi kowosela magazo na kudumba na kuditigwa wapogozi, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />mokwimba lwimbo alu lwa kumbeza mndewa wa Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">“Mlole, walinguwabunza wanhu vyowadumigwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">Ujuvi wa hewo naudumigwa!<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakaibena nyhimbati ya wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:5">nakabena ng'hweku ya chiundewa ya vilongozi,<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />iwele nawawatowela wanhu wa isi kwa ng'halazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">nawawatowa ne kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">nawawalongoza kwa nhumbula yihile ne isungu.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Lelo isi yeng'ha naisindamala na ina kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:7">chila munhu kangwimba kwa kusangalala.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Misonobali jangusangalala kugwa kwa mndewa wa Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">mielezi ja Lebanoni najo jilonje hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">‘Kwa vila nakuduliswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">haduhu yalingutema migodi yawele kokuya kwa hetwe!’<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />“Kuli isi ya wabagame nako nakusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">leka kukubochela mhela houkuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">Kwangujililimla mihoka juye kukulamsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">jiwele ndo wakulu kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">kwangujililimla kulawa kuli vigoda vyawo vya undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">jeng'ha jiwele najali ndo wandewa wa wanhu wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Weng'ha wokulonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">‘Hegwe nagwe nakuwa ng'hochele kota hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">hegwe ndo kota hetwe!<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Kidaya kwa hegwe kweng'ha nakuduliswa mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">hamwe na iyowe lya ving'hweleng'hwele vya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">mhiko ndo chinanda cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">na fukuzi ndo igolole lya hegwe!’<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />“Ulole ndaze vyougwile kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">hegwe nhondwe ilingupulika mitondo, mwana wa kubwemwenzuka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">Ndaze vyoutozigwe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">hegwe uwele nakuwasumya wanhu wa isi!”<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Nakulonga mnhumbula mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">“Ndokwina mbaka kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">ndochinula chigoda cha heni cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">mchanya ng'hatu kupuluta nhondwe za Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">ndochikalisa mchanya mwa chidunda cha nhing'hano za milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">kuli banzi za kasikazini.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Ndoguluka mzidi wa hoiwele ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:14">ndochiwhaniza na heye Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya Ng'hatu.”<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Ila nakuduliswa mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:15">mbaka hasi ng'hatu mwa ikulubila.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Wala wawele wokona wokunhogolela meho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">wobubuwala kuwala hegwe, wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">“Ndaze, ayu ndo yula yawele nakaitigasa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">na kuudita undewa ukakame,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />yula yaiditile isi kuwa kota chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">yawele nakajidumya miji jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">hawalechile wapogozi wa ngondo wa heye walute kaye?”<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Wandewa weng'ha wa wanhu wa isi nawatiligwa kwa lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:18">chila yumwe kuli chilaga cha heye.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Ila hegwe nakutozigwa kunze mwa chilaga cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">kota nhagala iwele nailemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">mtufi wa hegwe naubigangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">nakuwichigwa hamwe na wala wawele nawakopoligwa kwa kuhomigwa kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">wala wawele nawatozigwa kuli ikulubila liwele na maganga.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Ila hegwe hauweza kilumba nawo kuli kutiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">kwa vila nakuiwifya isi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">na nakuwakopola wanhu wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">Lulelo lwa mwihe lusemwigwe mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Hawiche goya honhu ha kuwadumulila singo wana wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga wasekulu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">waleche kwinuka leka kuihalila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">na kumemeza isi kwa miji jawo.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kowadumya wanhu wa Babuloni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">“Ndoutowa muji wa Babuloni na kuudumya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">ndowifya chila chinhu, chiwele ndo muji weng'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">na wana na yoneche yawele nakasigala mkomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />Ndohadita hawe honhu ha mituwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">na isi ya milamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">ndohafyajila kwa isuyo lya kudumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi mbele na Mong'ho, ndangulonga.”<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uloli kuwala wanhu wa Ashulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">“Ndikomya, kota vila vyombichile goya, ndo vyoiwa hamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">nani kota vyonuwile, ndo vyoikwenela.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Ndobena ludali lwa Waashulu kuli isi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">mchanya mwa chidunda cha heni ndowabiga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">Ngwamo za hewo zokusigwa kwa wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">mhomholo zolavigwa kulawa kuli mayega ga hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Aku ndo kwamula kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">awu ndo moko uwele kougolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">mchanya mwa wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Wone Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakanuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">whaani yoweza kumlemeza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">Wone nakamula kutowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">whaani yoweza kumlemeza?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kowadumya Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Mwaka uwele mndewa Ahasi nakabagama, Mkulu Nguluwi nakalavya ulonzi awu,<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />“Mleche kusangalala hemwe Wafilisti weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">kwa vila ng'hobwa iwele naiwatowa hemwe naibeneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">kwa vila izoka lyolela izoka ling'ang'ale kusinda lilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">nalyo lyoweza kuguluka.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Wazunwa kusinda wazunwa weng'ha wowa na honhu ha kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">walihela chinhu wowa na kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">Ila msisi wa hegwe, gwa Filistiya, ndoudumya kwa lufemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">na yoneche yawele kosigala, kokopoligwa na lufemba alo.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />“Utowe iyowe, gwa lwizi! Ulile gwa muji!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Msungulumuche hemwe Wafilisti mweng'ha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Ng'hungugu ya iyosi yanguya kulawa kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">haduhu yawele kokawila kuli misitali ja wamizi wake.”<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Wasenga wa wanhu wa isi ayo wokwidichilwa ndaze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">Wolonjelwa hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakaidita Yelusalemu iwe nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">na mgati mwake, wanhu wa heye wawele nawatunyigwa wowa na honhu ha kubilimila.”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi koidumya isi ya Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Usenga kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">Muji wa Ali uwele kuli isi ya Moabu naudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">nauwifigwa kuli nechilo imwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">Muji wa Kili uwele ako Moabu naudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">nauwifigwa kuli nechilo imwe!<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Wanhu wa muji wa Diboni wanguluta kuli ng'handa ya mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">mbaka kuli honhu ha kufugamila leka walombocheze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">Wamoabu wangulila kwa chiwalo cha miji ja Nebo na Medeba jiwele kusini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">Wangulila na kubeya mnvili za hewo na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">walume wangubeya lulevu lwa hewo kulajila masinzo.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Wangukola mnzila kuno wavalile mivalo ja migunila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">wa mchanya mwa vinduwiko na kuli vyalanza vya nhing'hano vya muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">weng'ha wangulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">wanguwasa chifunama kuno wangulila.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Wanhu wa miji ja Heshiboni na Eleale wangulila kwa lizi likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">lizi lya hewo lyanguhulikwa mbaka kuli muji wa Yahasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">Wamizi wa Moabu wangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">kwa vila kitumbila kwa hewo kwangusigwa.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Nhumbula ya heni yanguwalilila wanhu wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">wanhu wake wangubilimila kuli muji wa Soali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">mbaka kuli muji wa Egilati-shelishiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">Wangukola kuli nzila ilinguluta kuli muji wa Luhiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">wanguluta kuno wangulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">kuli nzila ilinguluta Holonaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">wangulombocheza kudumigwa kwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Mazi ga Nimulimu nagakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">na misolo najiswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">mizuchila najikala, haduhu chinhu choneche chidodi chiwele nachisigala.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Wanhu wa Moabu wokuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">woloka kuli ibindi lya Mielebi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:7">kuno waholile lufufu lwa hewo luwele nawewichila ng'hano.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Chila honhu ha mbaka ja isi ya Moabu chililo cha hewo chohulikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">kulombocheza kwa hewo kofika mbaka kuli muji wa Egilaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">ena, mbaka kuli muji wa Beeli-elimu.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Mazi ga muji wa Dimoni gomema danda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">kahi Nguluwi kokwambuza magazo ganji ako kuli muji wa Dimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">isimba lyowabata wanhu weng'ha wawele wojeza kuibilima isi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">na kuwebata wanhu wawele wosigala kuli isi.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Moabu wangulanda utanzi kulawa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Mhiliche ming'holo myana kota ushulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">kwa mndewa wa isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">kulawa Sela kukolela kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">mbaka kuli chidunda cha Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Kota videje vyovilingusumajila na kugulukaguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">viwele naviwinjigwa kuli vimvulila vyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">ndo vyowawele wadala wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">kuli honhu ha kulochela ha Alinoni.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Wanhu wa Moabu wanguwalonjela wanhu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">“Mlongoze na kwamula kuwala hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Mhela wa nemisi mtwamile kota igodi vyolilinguwika isisila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Kota vila nechilo vyoilingweneza chisisila chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">mtuvise kwa vila natubilima kuli isi ya hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">mleche kutulema tuwele natuwinjigwa.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Muwaleche wanhu wa Moabu wawele nawasulupuka wekale hali hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">muwe honhu ha hewo ha kubilimila leka kumbilima yalingudumya.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">Kudumya komala wone yalingugaza kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">yalingigala ngondo kokwajilila kuli isi.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Kwa igano lya kwimilila, chigoda cha undewa chowichigwa nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">munhu kochikalisa mchanya mwake na kulongoza kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">heye yalingulawa kuli ivyazi lya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">heye yawele kuli kutagusa kangupalaga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">na kukudita kutanganika kulutilile.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Wanhu wa Yuda wangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">“Natuhulika mbuli za ujuvi wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">ujuvi wake wa kidaya na uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">ila kidaya kwake hakulingutanza chinhu.”<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Wanhu wa Moabu wangulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">kwa chiwalo cha magazo galinguwafika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">Weng'ha wangulila kuno wokumbuchila chilyo chinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">chiwele nawali wolya kuli muji wa Kili-heleseti.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Migunda jiwele habehi na Heshiboni na migunda ja mizabibu ja Sibuma janguwifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">vilongozi wa wanhu wa isi nawajibiga jila mizabibu jinojile lukami.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">Katali mizabibu najenela mbaka kuli muji wa Yaseli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">na mbaka kolilawilaga isanya kulutila kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">na mbaka kolizinjilaga isanya, ubanzi uyage wa Bahali ya Mwino.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">Najifika mbaka kumwambu mwa bahali.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Lelo ndangulila hamwe na muji wa Yaseli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">kwa chiwalo cha mizabibu ja Sibuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">Mahozi gangulagala kwa chiwalo cha miji ja Heshiboni na Eleale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">Kwa vila kwa haduhu mbena zilinguwadita wanhu wasangalale.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Haduhu yoneche yalingusangalala kuli migunda jiwele na mboto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Haduhu yoneche yalingutowa iyowe ama kwimba kuli migunda ja mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Haduhu yoneche yalingukama zabibu kuli honhu ha kukamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">kwa vila Nguluwi nakawadita wanyamalile.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Muhe wa heni wangulombocheza kwa chiwalo cha Moabu, kota ching'hweleng'hwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">na kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha, kwa chiwalo cha Kili-heleseti.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Hailingutanza chinhu kwa wanhu wa Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">kitunya kwa kuluta kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">kwa chiwalo cha kulanda na kufugamila.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Awu ndo ulonzi uwele Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga kuwala Moabu. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, “Kuli mhela wa miyaka jidatu, ne kupuluta ama kupungula, lufufu lukulu lwa Moabu lokwajilila. Hanga wanhu wake ndo wenji, wosigala wachefu na wowa ng'hochele.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kowagaza wanhu wa isi ya Ashulu na wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Awu ndo usenga kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">“Damasiko hailutilila kuwa muji kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">yowa chilundo cha mahame.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Miji ja Aloeli jolechigwa mahame mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">jowa ndo honhu ha kulya na kuwasa migongolo ja kufujigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">haduhu chinhu chiwele chojidita jiwe na lunhwinhwi.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Ngome za kiyamila za Efulaimu, zokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">undewa wa Damasiko womala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Waalamu wawele wosigala wodeuzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">kota vyowaditilwe walelwa wa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho, nandonga.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />Zuwa alyo, ukulu wa Isilaeli woduliswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:4">na lufufu lwake lopungula.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli yowa kota mgunda uwele walingubeta wangubetaga nyhule zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">haduhu chiwele nachali chilechigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">kowa kota vyojilinguwaga migunda ja kuli ibindi lya Lefaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">nyhule zeng'ha hozibetigwa.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Waisilaeli wachefu wosigala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">kota zeituni zimwenga ziwele nazisigala kuli chinhembenhembe cha igodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">mhela wakola mijito lowazilagaze zeituni ziyage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">Kuli nhagala za kuchanya ng'hatu zosigala zeituni mbili ama zidatu hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Kuli zuwa alyo, Waisilaeli wochitumbila kwa yawalumbile na meho ga hewo gomlola Yelile wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Hanga nawazenga honhu ha hewo ha kulavila nhambiko na honhu ha kufunyizila ubani kwa mlungu Ashela na kuzenga mizengo ja kumfugamila, ila sambi hawochitumbila kuli honhu aho. <verse eid="ISA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Zuwa alyo miji jeng'ha jiwele ngome jolechigwa mahame. Jowa kota miji jiwele Waamoli na Wahiti nawajileka mhela Waisilaeli lowafichile kuli isi. Isi yeng'ha yowa mahame kahi.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Kwa vila hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli namumsemwa Nguluwi yawalohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">hamlikumbuchile italawe lya kiyamila kwa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">Namnyala mizabibu jinojile ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha kumfugamila mlungu wa chijenzi,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />hanga mojidita jikule kuli zuwa lilyo lyomnyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">na kujidita jibahule mitondo yiyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">mbeta za hemwe zokwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">kuli zuwa lilyo lya magazo na usungu uwele hausindamala.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Mhulichize! Wamizi wa isi nyinji wobuma kota bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">Wangubogoma kota lizi lya nhigu ng'hulu.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Hanga wanhu wa isi wangubuma kota kubogoma kwa mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kogang'hanhuchila, nago gobilimila kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">Gowinjigwa na mbeho kota mahamba gakalile kuli chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">kota nhimbwisi vyoilinguwembeluswa na chivuluvumbi.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Hanga hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli modumbizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">mitondo, wang'honyo wa hemwe wobagama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Mbuli ayo ndo yowafika weng'ha walinguihola isi ya hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">na kuhiza lufufu lwa hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi koitowa isi ya Kushi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Yochona, isi imemile lizi lya mabawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:1">isi iwele kumwambu mwa nzanda za Kushi!<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />Ilinguwalajiza wasenga walingujenda kwa mitumbwi kuli lwanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Mlute hemwe wasenga wabewe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">kwa wanhu wa isi wawele wenji na wazidahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">wanhu wawele ng'wemang'wema na ngozi idedemche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">Wanhu awo wangudumbigwa chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">wanhu wa isi wawele na ivuche na ndonga ya chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">wawele isi ya hewo naigawanuligwa na nzanda.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Hemwe wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">hemwe mlingikala muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">mhela bendela hozikwinuligwa kuli vidunda, mozona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">nazo mhalamhanda hozipembigwa, mozihulika.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Ali ndo Mkulu Nguluwi lyoyandonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">“Ndosindamala na kulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">kulawa haluga hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">kota ivuche kuli lumuli lwa isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">kota ng'hungugu ya nungwi mhela wa mbeta.<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Mhela uwele wamizi wang'hali kuwavaba kota vila mhela wa kubeta louwa ung'hali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">mhela wa kubahula louwa umalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">uluwa louwa ung'hali kugaluka kuwa zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">Nguluwi kowatowa kota vyoyalinguzitema nhagala zizuchile, kwa sengo ya kutemela nhagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">na kusa nhagala zonjezeche.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Mitufi jawo jeng'ha jolechigwa kwa chiwalo cha videje vilingupelemba kuli chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">na migongolo jinji ja kisolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">Videje vya kisolo vyolya miwunde ja mitufi ajo kuli mhela wa chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">migongolo ja kisolo jodakula kuli mhela wa chipute.”<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Mhela awo, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kogalilwa nhambiko kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi wawele ng'wemang'wema, wawele na ngozi idedemche, kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi walingudumbigwa wa habehi na wa kutali, kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi wawele na ndonga ya chijenzi, wawele isi ya hewo naigawanuligwa kwa nzanda. Nhambiko azo kogalilwa kuli chidunda cha Siyoni, hoyofugamilwa heye Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala kuwifigwa kwa isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Awu ndo usenga wa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Mkulu Nguluwi nakakwina mchanya mwa ng'hungugu ilinguluta himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">nakaluta mbaka kuli isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Jimalukolo ja milungu ja Misili jokakama hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">na wanhu wa isi ya Misili wokwajiliza kitumbila kwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">“Ndokwambuza kilewa hali Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">msongolo kochitowa na mkulugwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">ivyazi limwe lyochitowa na ivyazi linji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">goloko kochitowa na goloko wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">wanhu wa muji umwe wochitowa na wanhu wa muji wunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">wanhu kulawa kuli mkowa umwe wochitowa na wanhu kulawa kuli mkowa wunji.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Wamisili wotweguka nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">ndogawifya majesa ga hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">Wopala utanzi kuli jimalukolo na kwa mihoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">kwa walaguzi na kwa walingulonga na mihoka.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Ndowawika Wamisili mmoko mwa mkulu yawele na nhumbula yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">mndewa yang'hang'hale kowalongoza hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho, nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Mazi ga lwanda lwa Naili gokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:5">lwanda lokala ng'hatu kwa isanya.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Nzanda zokala ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">Vikolola vya Misili vyonung'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">kwa chiwalo cha kuswinha kwa migugu na misolo mikulu.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Mizuchila jeng'ha jiwele najinyaligwa hafungo ha lwanda lwa Naili jokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">hamba jowembeluswa na kwajilila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">Mbena za chila mgunda uwele hafungo ha lwanda lwa Naili zokala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">zowembeluswa na kwajilila.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Walingulowa somba wolila na kulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:8">wala weng'ha walingutoza ndowano kuli lwanda lwa Naili.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Walingutawa nguwo za kitani wogozola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:9">kwa vila wowahela nyuzi kwa chiwalo cha kutawa,<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />nawo walingutanza mijito ajo wowa na masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:10">ahyo weng'ha wotweguka nhumbula.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Vilongozi wa Soani ndo wapoka ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">walingumlonjela mbuli za luhala Falao, mndewa wa Misili wangulavya ulonzi wa chipoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">Mwanguweza ndaze kumlonjela Falao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">“Heni nda yumwe wa wanhu wawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">mlanguswa wa wandewa wa katali?”<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Falao, wakohi lelo wanhu wa hegwe wawele na luhala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">Walonjele lelo wakulajile na kukuzelesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">chiwele Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">choyalingugana kuwaditila wanhu wa Misili.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Vilongozi wa Soani nawawa wapoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">wakulu wa Memufisi nawahadigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Wala wawele ndo msisi wa nhanzi za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">nawawajiliza wanhu wa isi ya Misili.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakazitigula nyhala za vilongozi wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">ahyo nawawalongoza wanhu wa hewo kwa kuwajiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">nawawadita wawe wozebeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">kota wagalile walinguwasa kuli wavu waudechile.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Haduhu munhu yoneche kuli isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">hawele chilongozi ne munhu wa hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">yalinguzeleka lukami ne mzunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:15">yalinguweza kudita mbuli yoneche inojile.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamisili womfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Kuli zuwa alyo Wamisili wodumba kota wadala. Wokakama kwa lunhwinhwi howomona Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakagolola moko wa heye kwa hewo. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Wanhu wa isi ya Yuda wowadita Wamisili wawe na lunhwinhwi, chila yumwe yawele kohulika kuwala wanhu wa isi ya Yuda, kodumba kwa chiwalo cha mbuli iwele Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakanuwila kuwaditila. <verse eid="ISA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Kuli zuwa alyo miji jihano ja Misili jolonga ndonga ya Kanaani na kilaha kumfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho. Muji umwenga wochemigwa Muji wa Isanya. <verse eid="ISA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Kuli zuwa alyo kowa na honhu ha kulavila nhambiko kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi hagati ha Misili na ilingo lya kukumbuchila lya Mkulu Nguluwi kuli mbaka wa Misili. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Honhu aho ha kulavila nhambiko howa ulajilo na ulolezi wa kusumya kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kuli isi ya Misili. Wanhu howomlilila Mkulu Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha walinguwabunza, Nguluwi kowegalila mlohozi yawele kowalewela. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kochizelesa yuye kwa Wamisili na kuli zuwa alyo womkunda Mkulu Nguluwi. Womfugamila kwa kumlavila nhambiko za nyhule na nhambiko za kulakazwa, wolaha hali Mkulu Nguluwi na kweneza kilaha ako.<verse eid="ISA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Mkulu Nguluwi kowagaza wanhu wa isi ya Misili kwa utamwa. Womgalamchila Mkulu Nguluwi, naye kohulika kulanda kwa hewo na kowalohola. <verse eid="ISA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Kuli zuwa alyo kowa na nzila ng'hulu kulawa kuli isi ya Misili mbaka kuli isi ya Ashulu. Waashulu wowajendela Wamisili na Wamisili wowajendela Waashulu. Wamisili na Waashulu womfugamila Nguluwi hamwe. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Kuli zuwa alyo kahi Isilaeli yowazigwa hamwe na Misili na Ashulu, wanhu wa isi azi zidatu wowa utambichizo kuli isi. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kowatambichiza, yolonga, “Utambichizo uwe kwa Wamisili, wawele ndo wanhu wa heni na kwa Waashulu, wawele ndo mijito ja moko ga heni na kwa Waisilaeli, wawele ndo wanhu wa heni ndiwahagule.”<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala isi za Misili na Kushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Saligoni, mndewa wa Ashulu, nakamlajiza chilongozi wa wamizi wa heye kuuvaba muji wa Ashidodi. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Mhela wula Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga kwa kukolela Isaya, mwana wa Amosi, nakamlonjela, “Uvule nguwo ya igunila na makwamba ga hegwe.” Naye nakadita hihyo, nakajenda kuno na kula mwanzi ne nguwo ne makwamba. <verse eid="ISA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga, “Kota vila chitumagwa wa heni Isaya vyoyajendile mwanzi ne nguwo ne makwamba kwa miyaka jidatu, kota ndo ulajilo wihile kwa isi za Misili na Kushi, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />hihyo du, mndewa wa Ashulu kowalongoza wapogozi wa ngondo wa Wamisili na Wakushi, wawele mwanzi ne makwamba, wasongolo na wasekulu, wawele mabadi mwanzi kwa soni ya Wamisili. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Hamba, wala wawele nawali wochitumbila kuli isi ya Kushi na kidayila isi ya Misili, wodumba na kudeula. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Kuli zuwa alyo wanhu walingikala kuli mwhani yino wolonga, ‘Ulole mbuli iwafichile wala wawele natwali tuchitumbila kwa hewo, wala wawele natwali tuwabilimila kwa kuwalanda utanzi leka watulohole kulawa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu! Lelo toweza ndaze kusulupuka?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala kudumigwa kwa Babuloni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Awu ndo usenga kuwala kuchiwala hawele hafungo ha bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">kota chivuluvumbi chilingukola kuli isi ya kusini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">walinguvaba wanguya kulawa kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">kulawa kuli isi ilingukabusa.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Nandajilwa kulota kwa kukabusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">yalingubelenhuka kangubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">yalinguhola vinhu vya kuli ngondo kanguhola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Mlute kuchanya kuli ngondo hemwe Waelamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">mitowe na wang'honyo hemwe Wamediya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Nguluwi kogadita magazo geng'ha gawele nagagaligwa na Babuloni, gamale.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayo lukuli lwa heni nalumema usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">usungu kota wa mamo yalinguponda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">Lonyhuliche na kona kuwala mbuli ziwele Nguluwi kozidita, nandali ndikakama.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Kwa lunhwinhwi meho ga heni gangulola chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">nanditumbila matinazo uwele mhela unojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">ila nauwa chinhu cha kukabusa.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Vilongozi wakulu wa muji wa Babuloni nawali na mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">nawali wolya na kunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">ila munhu yumwe nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">“Hemwe vilongozi, mwinuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">mviwiche goya vinhu vya hemwe vya kitowela ngondo!”<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Hamba Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">“Ulute, uwiche mwamizi kuli lukanzi lwa muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">na umlonjele yatowe iyowe kuwala chinhu choneche choyalinguchona.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Hoyojona mituka ja ngondo jilingukwejigwa na falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">ama walingukwina midogowi ama walingukwina ngamiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">yewiche goya, yelolele ng'hatu!”<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Mwamizi nakalandula lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">“Mkulu, nandali kuli mijito ja heni mchanya mwa ilingo lya kwamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">chila zuwa, nemisi na nechilo!<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Ulole, chilundo changuya, wakwina falasi weliweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">wangulonga, ‘Babuloni nakugwa! Nakugwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">Jimalukolo jeng'ha ja milungu ja hegwe najitozigwa hanyi na kubenangwa!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Hemwe wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli, muwele nampululwa kota ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">ila lelo nandiwalonjela mbuli inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">iwele nandiihulika kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Awu ndo usenga wa Nguluwi kumuwala Edomu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Ndanguhulika munhu kangunyhema kulawa Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">“Mwamizi, nechilo yomala nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Mwamizi, nechilo yomala nili?”<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Mwamizi nakedichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">“Mitondo yanguya, na nechilo hihyo du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">wone kwangugana kuuza, hegwe uuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">ulute na uhiluche kahi.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala Alabiya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Awu ndo usenga wa Nguluwi kuwala Alabiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">Hemwe Wadedani muwele kuli majendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">mlinguwika kambi kuli viwala vya Alabiya,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />muwape mazi awo wawele na ng'halu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">Namwe wenyeng'haye wa isi ya Tema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">muwagalile chilyo awo wawele nawabilima kulawa kuli isi ya hewo,<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />kwa vila nawabilima mipanga jiwichigwe goya kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">na mipinde jiwele najikwejigwa, jiwichigwe goya kwa ngondo.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela hino, “Kuli mhela wa mwaka umwe, ne kupuluta ama kupungula, ukulu weng'ha wa Kedali womala. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Wawele wosigala hali watoza misale na wazidahe wa wanhu wa Kedali wowa wachefu hela. Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Nguluwi kuwala Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Awu ndo usenga wa Nguluwi kuwala Ibindi lya Uloli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">Lekachoni mna lunhwinhwi hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">Lekachoni namkwinha mchanya mwa vinduwiko vya ng'handa?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Gwa muji umemile iyowe likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">muji wa iyowe na mnvina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">Wanhu wa hemwe wabagame hawakopoligwe kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">ne kubagama kuli ngondo.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Vilongozi wa hemwe weng'ha nawabilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">ila hamba nawabatigwa na wang'honyo wa hewo ne kutoza msale ne umwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">kwa chiwalo cha kiyamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">Wamizi wa hemwe nawajeza kubilima mhela wang'honyo wa hemwe lowawele kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">ila nawo kahi nawabatigwa.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Ndo mina nandiwalonjela hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">“Mleche kijesa choneche kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">mndeche ndilile kwa usungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">Mleche kujeza kunyhembuliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">kwa chiwalo cha kubagama kuwafichile wanhu wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">nakahagula mhela uwele kowa na kilewa kukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Kuli Ibindi lya Kulota kowa na vilundo vya wamizi walingujenda kwa magulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">na wanhu kudumbizwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Wowa ndo mhela uwele ng'hanzi za muji wa hetwe zobomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">na vililo vya wanhu kwa chiwalo cha kulanda utanzi vyohulikwa kuli vidunda.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Wamizi wa Elamu nawahola mipinde na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">nawoya kuno wakwinile falasi na mituka ja ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">nawo wamizi wa Kili wanguwika goya ngawo za hewo.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Mibindi ja hegwe jinojile gwa Yelusalemu najimema mituka ja ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:7">na wakwina falasi nawawichigwa goya kuli lwizi ja muji wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Kiyamila kweng'ha kwa Yuda nakusigwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 22:8">Zuwa alyo namitumbila vinhu vya kitowela ngondo viwele naviwichigwa kuli ng'handa ya chiundewa ya Chihulo cha Lebanoni, <verse eid="ISA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />hemwe namona kota ng'hanzi za muji wa Daudi nazitulika lukami. Nammemeza mazi kuli ilamba lya hasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ilamba lya hasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ali nalyali lizenjigwe na mndewa Ahasi leka kuwika mazi kuli mhela wa kutowigwa na wang'honyo.</char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Namziwaza ng'handa za muji wa Yelusalemu, nambomola ng'handa ziyage leka kupata maganga kwa chiwalo cha kuziwika nzinzili ng'hanzi za muji. <verse eid="ISA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Hagati ha ng'hanzi azo namzenga ilamba kwa chiwalo cha mazi galinguchililika kulawa kuli ilamba lya katali, ila hamumpalile Nguluwi yawele nakambuza mbuli azi zeng'ha, hamumdumbile heye yawele nakazidita kulawa aho katali.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Zuwa alyo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">nakagana hemwe mlile na kulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">mbeye mnvili za hemwe na kuvala mivalo ja migunila.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Ila hemwe namsangalala na kutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">namjidumula singo misenga na ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">namlya miwunde na kunwa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">Namlonga, “Tunwe na kulya kwa vila hamitondo tobagama.”<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakangubulila aga yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">“Ndikomya hawolechelwa kwa nongwa ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">wobagama ne kulechelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Nguluwi kwa Shebuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho nakandonjela ndute kwa Shebuna, mlolezi wa ng'handa ya chiundewa, ndikamlonjele hino, <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />“Kuna hachi yachi hegwe kuwa kuno? Ndaze, hana mng'holozo yoneche aha mbaka nakibawila chilaga kuli mhalika mchanya mwa chidunda? <verse eid="ISA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Hegwe kuna mong'ho, ila hima hela Mkulu Nguluwi kokutoza kutali. <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Kokubina na kokutoza mbaka kuli isi ngazi kota mpila. Kobagama na kutiligwa kuko, mituka ja ngondo ja hegwe joujiganile josigala kwa wang'honyo. Hegwe nakuwa soni kuli ng'handa ya mkulu wa hegwe. <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Ndokusa kuli mijito ja hegwe na kukudulisa kulawa kuli ulongozi wa hegwe. <verse eid="ISA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />Zuwa alyo ndomigala chitumagwa wa heni yalinguchemigwa Eliyakimu mwana wa Hilikiya. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Ndomvaliza ivalo lya hegwe na ndomuwoha isali lya hegwe na ndomha ulongozi wa hegwe. Heye kowa mhaza kwa wanhu wa Yelusalemu na ivyazi lya Yuda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Ndomuwichila chichumulilo cha ng'handa ya Daudi kuli mayega ga heye. Chila choyochichumula, haduhu yoweza kuchihinda na choyochihinda, haduhu yoweza kuchichumula. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Ndomwimiza nzinzili Eliyakimu kota chigingi chiwele nachitowelelwa goya, naye kopata lutogo na ludali kuli ivyazi lya wasekulu wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />“Ukulu weng'ha wa ivyazi lya heye wochitumbila kwa heye. Wadodo na wakulu wa ivyazi alyo wochiwika kwa heye kota visaye na vizombe viwele vyanguninila kuli ngwamo imwe hela. <verse eid="ISA 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Ila zuwa limwe, kota vila chigingi chiwele nachitowelelwa goya chokwisilwa mong'ho kwa chiwalo cha itunyo, naye Eliyakimu kolavigwa kuli ulongozi wa heye na ivyazi lya heye lyeng'ha lyowa lilihela utanzi. Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Usenga ulinguwala kudumigwa kwa miji ja Tilo na Sidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Awu ndo usenga wa Nguluwi ulinguwala muji wa Tilo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Mlombocheze, hemwe meli za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">kwa vila muji wa Tilo nauwifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">naulechigwa ne ng'handa ne bandali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Usenga awu mouhulika kwaluchila kuli isi ya Kitimu.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Mnyamalile, hemwe mlingikala mhwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">ena, mlombocheze hemwe mlingugula na kuguza vinhu ako Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">walingudaha kojelela wa hemwe nawaumemeza muji kwa lufufu.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Walingugula na kuguza vinhu wa hemwe nawali mmajendo kwa kukolela kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">wopala lufufu lwa hewo kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi zinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Nawegala nyhule iwele naibetigwa hafungo ha lwanda lwa Naili.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Ubasigwe soni gwa Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">muji uwele hafungo ha bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">kwa vila bahali naiwalema hemwe kwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">“Siwahiche kuwa na usungu wa kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">ahyo wano hawawele wana wa heni!”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Mbuli ayi hoifika kuli isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:5">kota muji wa Tilo naudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:5">Wamisili wowa na masinzo ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Mlombocheze hemwe wenyeng'haye wa mhwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:6">mjeze kubilimila Talishishi.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Ndaze, awu ndo muji wa hemwe wa Tilo uwele naumema kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">muji uwele nauzenjigwa katali ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">uwele meli zake naziwahola walingudaha kojelela na walingugula na kuguza vinhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">na kuwahilika kuli isi za kutali kwa chiwalo cha kikala ako?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Whaani yanuwile kuuditila muji wa Tilo mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">muji wa chiundewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">uwele walingugula na kuguza vinhu wake ndo wakulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">wawele na lutogo kuli isi yeng'ha?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho ndo nakanuwila mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">leka kuwifya kidaya kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">na kuwabasa soni wala weng'ha walinguzeleka lukami muisi.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Wanhu wa muji wa Tilo, bandali za hemwe nazidumigwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">Lelo mwanguganigwa muwe walimi kota wanhu wa Misili.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakagolola moko wa heye mchanya mwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">nakazidita isi zinji zikakame.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">Nakalavya ilajizo kuwala isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">kota ngome zake zidumigwe.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Nakalonga, “Gwa mhinza Sidoni hauweza kahi kudita mnvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">hanga kobilimila Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">ako kahi haupata kwesela!”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Ulole kuli isi ya Wakalidayo, wanhu wano wawele sambi hawalingoneka kota wabaha. Waashulu nawaidita isi ayo iwe kota honhu ha vilumbigwe vya kuchiwala. Nawagongomanya milingo kwa chiwalo cha wamizi leka waloche lukanzi lwa muji wa Babuloni leka kuutowa, nawazihola ngome na kuzileka zilihela chinhu na kuudita muji uwe mahame.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Mlombocheze hemwe meli za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:14">kwa vila bandali ya hemwe naidumigwa.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Aho muji wa Tilo wosemigwa kwa mhela wa miyaka makumi saba, uwele ndo mhela wa ukomu wa mndewa. Ila kuli kuduma kwa miyaka ajo makumi saba, muji wa Tilo wozenjigwa kahi. Achi ndo cholawila, wowa kota mng'hondwa kuli lwimbo lulinguhulikwa hino,<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />“Uhole ching'hweleng'hwele cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">ujendejende kuli muji weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">gwa mng'hondwa usemwigwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">Wimbe zimbo zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">wimbe zimbo nyinji leka ukumbuchilwe kahi.”<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Hojimala miyaka ajo makumi saba, Mkulu Nguluwi kowonela isungu muji wa Tilo kota hamwande. Walingugula na kuguza vinhu wake wopegwa kahi sendi nyinji kwa chiwalo cha kugula vinhu vinji, wovihola na kuvihilika vinhu avyo kwa wanhu wanji wa isi zinji. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Mzidi wa sendi zowopata zolavigwa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. Hawoweza kuzihola sendi azo kwa chiwalo cha hewo, ila watambika wa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo wotumiya kwa kugulila chilyo cha kuhega na kugula mivalo jinojile.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi koigaza isi yeng'ha</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Lole, Mkulu Nguluwi koidumya isi na kuileka uchiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">Koiwifya na kwambuza iwe chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">na kuwasambalula wenyeng'haye wake.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Chila munhu kofichigwa na mbuli zizila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">Munhu wa hihi hela na mtambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">chitumagwa mlume na mkulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">chitumagwa mdala na mkulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">yalingugula na yalinguguza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">yalingwazika na yalingwazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">yalingudayi na yalingudayigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Isi yowifigwa ng'hatu na kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga ago.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Isi yangukala na kuswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">isi yeng'ha yanguwa ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">ulanga na isi vyeng'ha vyangola.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Wanhu nawaidita isi iwe ikokomoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">nawaleka kuhulichiza malajizo ga Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">nawajilema mizilo ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">nawalibena ilagano lya heye lya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Kwa chiwalo acho kupanjila kwanguidumya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">wenyeng'haye wake wangugazika kwa chiwalo cha nongwa za hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">Ahyo, walingikala kuli isi nawadumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">ndo wanhu wachefu hela wasigale.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Mizabibu jangukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">divai yangumala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">Weng'ha wawele nawali na usangalalo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">sambi wangung'ung'uta kwa masinzo.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Kusangalala kwa matowazi nakuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">luchenze lwa ching'hweleng'hwele nalunyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">na iyowe lya wawele na usangalalo naliduma.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Haduhu wanhu walingwimba kuli mhela wa kunwa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:9">ujimbi nauwa wausungu kwa walingunwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Muji uwifigwe nauwa uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:10">chila ng'handa lwizi naluhindigwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Mnzila wanhu wangulila kwa chiwalo cha kuwahela divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">usangalalo weng'ha naumala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">nauwa haduhu muisi.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Miji jeng'ha najali ndo mahame hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:12">na lwizi jake najibenangwa vihande vihande.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Ndo vyoiwa kuli isi zeng'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">na hali wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">kota vila zeituni vyozilingusigala nyindo hela hala mhela wa kubeta houmala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">ama kota vila mhela zabibu nyindo vyozilingusigala hala mhela wa kubeta houmala.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Wawele wosigala wokwimba kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">kulawa kolizinjilaga isanya wowikula ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Lelo wenyeng'haye wa kolilawilaga isanya walingikala mhwani wamtogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">wanhu wa isi zinji walitogole itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Twanguhulika nzimbo za lutogo kulawa kuli kuduma kwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">nzimbo za kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi yawele yatanganiche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Ila sambi ndina masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">ena, ndanguganda na ndanguwa ng'hochele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Ndochona heni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Walingubelenhuka wangulutilila kubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">kubelenhuka kwa hewo kwangulutilila ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Kukabusa na misimo na midiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:17">avi ndo vilinguwabeteza hemwe wenyeng'haye wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Chila yalingubilima kukabusa kofunhuchila kuli isimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">na yalingulawa kuli isimo kogwilizwa kuli idiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Lwizi ja mazi tendema ja kilanga najichumulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">misisi ja isi jangutigasika.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Isi yobenekanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:19">yodaduka na kutigaswa ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Isi yanguzebeduka kota yagalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">kota chibumuli kuli mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">yangutunyigwa na itunyo lya gehile gake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">yogwa na haiweza kwinuka kahi.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Kuli zuwa alyo Mkulu Nguluwi kojizapa milungu ja kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:21">na wandewa wa kuli isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Weng'ha wokungajizwa hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">kota wanweng'hwa wawele mchinhweng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">wowichigwa amo hamwe kwa mhela winji hamba kowazapa.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Hamba lumuli lwa nyelezi lwobasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">nalwo lumuli lwa isanya lyokoneka kota nalubilabila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kolongoza ako Yelusalemu kuli chidunda cha Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">lumuli lwa ukulu wa heye lwolangaza hali wasekulu wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa lutogo kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">ndokutogola hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">kwa vila nakudita mbuli za kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">kwangulutilila kuzidita kwa kukomya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">mbuli zouziwichile goya kulawa aho katali.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Nakuudita muji kuwa chilundo cha maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">na kuzidumya ngome zake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">Ngome ya wajenzi iwele nzinzili haiwa muji kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">na muji awo hauzenjigwa kahi.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Ahyo wanhu wa isi wawele na mong'ho, wokutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:3">miji ja wanhu wa isi wawele na nhumbula zihile, wokudumba.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Nakuwa ngome ya wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">honhu ha kubilimila, kwa walihela chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">Hegwe ndo honhu ha kubilimila mhela wa chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">lubehelo mhela wa ivuche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">Wawele na nhumbula zihile wangututowa kota chivuluvumbi chilingutowa lukanzi,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />ndo kota ivuche kugunuche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">Kwangulidita iyowe lya wang'honyo lidume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">kota ng'hungugu vyoilingulidita ivuche lya isanya lisindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">ndo hihyo du lwimbo lwa wawele na nhumbula zihile lwoditigwa lusindamale.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnvina iwichigwe goya na Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Mchanya mwa chidunda cha Siyoni ako Yelusalemu, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kowaditila mnvina ya vinhu vinojile wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. Kowa na miwunde jinonile na mafuta hamwe na divai inojile. <verse eid="ISA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Kuli chidunda acho, Mkulu Nguluwi koyusa ng'hungugu ya masinzo iwele naiwagubika wanhu wa isi zeng'ha, chigubiko cha usungu mchanya mwa wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. <verse eid="ISA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Mazuwa gose Mkulu Nguluwi kokudumya kubagama! Kobagusa mahozi kumeho kwa wanhu weng'ha na kokusa soni kwa wanhu wa heye kuli isi yeng'ha. Mkulu Nguluwi yuye nakalonga ahyo. <verse eid="ISA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Zuwa alyo wanhu weng'ha wolonga, “Ayu ndo Nguluwi wa hetwe! Natuwika kitumbila kwa hetwe kwa heye. Ayu ndo Mkulu Nguluwi yawele natwali tumbeteza. Muye tusangalale na kutowa luchenze kwa vila nakatulohola.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi koizapa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi kochamila chidunda cha Siyoni, ila wanhu wa Moabu wobigangwa kota misolo kuli honhu ha kuwichila mboto. <verse eid="ISA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Wogolola moko ga hewo kota munhu yalingujeza kojelela, ila Mkulu Nguluwi kokudulisa kidaya kwa hewo. <verse eid="ISA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />Kobomola ngome za muji wa Moabu ziwele ng'wemang'wema na kuzidita zigwe hasi kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kusumya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Zuwa lyanguya liwele wanhu wokwimba lwimbo alu kuli isi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">“Muji wa nzinzili!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">Mkulu Nguluwi yuye ndo yalingwamila ng'hanzi zake!<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Mchumule lwizi ja muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">leka wanhu watanganiche wenjile.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, kwanguwawika hali kikala goya wawele na nhumbula ziwele nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:3">kwa vila wangitumbila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Mitumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi mazuwa geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">kwa vila heye ndo italawe lya kikala goya mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Kanguwadulisaga walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">kanguudumyaga muji wa hewo uwele kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">na kuzigwisa ng'hanzi zake kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Walingubunzigwa wojenda amo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:6">na kubiganga kwa magulu gawo.”<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Nzila ya wanhu watanganiche naigoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:7">gwa Nguluwi wa hachi, kwanguiwikaga goya nzila ya hewo.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, natujenda kuli nzila za hegwe, ahyo twangukubeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">kulikumbuchila itagwa lya hegwe na lutogo lwa hegwe ndo maya ga nhumbula za hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Mhela wa nechilo nhumbula ya heni yangukugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">mhela wa mitondo ndagugana kulutilila kuwa na hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">Nhaguso za hegwe hozikuya muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wochilangusa hachi.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Hanga wehile howolajilwa uganililo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">hawalingilangusa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">mbaka kuli isi ya wagoloche wolutilila kudita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">hawochijesa kuwala ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakwinula moko leka kuwazapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">ila wang'honyo wa hegwe hawalinguwona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Uwalajile ndaze vyoulinguwonela fihi wanhu wa hegwe, nawo wobasigwa soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">Chiluli cha ng'halazi ya hegwe, chiwalakaze wang'honyo wa hegwe!<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakutupa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:12">gala geng'ha gotweneze, hegwe ndo ugaditile kwa chiwalo cha hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">wakulu wanji nawatulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">ila hegwe uliyeka ndo tulingukuhulichiza.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Wanhu awo nawabagama, hawochikala kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">Hegwe nakuwatowa na kuwadumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">nakusa kukumbuchilwa kwa hewo kweng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuwonjeza wanhu wa isi ya hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">ena, nakuwadita wanhu wa isi ya hetwe wonjezeche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">Nakipatila ukulu kwa chiwalo cha gwegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">nakonjeza mbaka jeng'ha ja isi.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, natukupala lotuwele kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:16">loutuzapile, natukulanda kwa kupwepwa hela.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Kota vila mamo yawele na himila yawele habehi kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:17">vyoyalingusanzalima na kulila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:17">ndo vyotuwele hali hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Natufichigwa na usungu wa kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">natusanzalima kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">ila natuponda mbeho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">Hatuwezile kigala ulohozi muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">hatuwezile konjeza wanhu kuli isi ayi.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Wabagame wa hegwe wochikala kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">ng'huli za hewo zozilipuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Hemwe mlingikala kuli nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">mwinuche mtowe iyowe kwa kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Kota lungwi lwa mitondo lulingupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">kowapa wabagame ukomu unyale.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Mlute wanhu wa heni, mwinjile kuli ng'handa za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">mihindile kuli ng'handa za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">mivise kwa mhela uchefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">mbaka kuzudila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kukole.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Mkulu Nguluwi kanguya kulawa haluga ha heye kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">leka kuwatowa wenyeng'haye wa isi kwa gehile ga hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">Isi yowika hazelu danda iwele naibohoka mchanya mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">hailutilila kuwavisa wanhu wa heye wakopoligwe.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Kugomboligwa kwa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Kuli zuwa alyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kolihola ipanga lya heye likulu linoligwe na liwele nzinzili na kulitema lila izoka Lewiyatani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">izoka Lewiyatani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Izoka lya kukabusa kuli ndano za katali, hano lyanguwhanizwa na wanhu wa isi wawagazile Waisilaeli.</char></note> lilingusulupuka na lilinguhada. Mkulu Nguluwi kolikopola izoka alyo lilingikala kuli bahali.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Kuli zuwa alyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kolonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:2">“Hemwe Waisilaeli, muwele kota mgunda unojile wa mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:2">mwanguganigwa kwimba!<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Ndowalolela kota mlimi yalinguboholela goya mizuchila ja mgunda wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">leka jikule goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">Ndowamila hemwe nemisi na nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">leka munhu yoneche yaleche kuwalumiza hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Sizudila kahi kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">wone wang'honyo wa hemwe wojeza kuwalumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">kota miwa ama mikwangwasale vyojilingudita kuli migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">ndowavaba na kuwalakaza hewo,<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />ama ndiwaleche woye kwa heni kwa chiwalo cha kuwamila hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">ndowaleka woye leka kihanyisa na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">ena, wadite kikala goya na heni.”<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Mhela wokuya uwele walelwa wa Yakobo wokwima nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">ena, mhela wa wanhu wa Isilaeli kuzuchila na kubahula kota igodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">na kuimemeza isi yeng'ha kwa mafuza.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Nguluwi hawagazile ng'hatu Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">kota vyoyawagazile wang'honyo wa Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">Waisilaeli wawele nawakopoligwa kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">ndo wachefu kusinda wala wang'honyo wawo.<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Nakawagaza wanhu wa heye kwa kuwahilika kuli isi za chijenzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">Mhela wa chivuluvumbi chikulu cha kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:8">nakawalavya kwa kuwatowa ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Hoyohawifya honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">na maganga gake gobalaswa na kuwa kota chokaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">izengo lya Ashela na honhu ha kufunyizila ubani kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko vyowifigwa ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">Kwa kudita ahyo nongwa za walelwa wa Yakobo vyozilechelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">gehile ga hewo vyogokusigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Muji wula uwele na ngome lelo nauwa uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">wanhu nawoka na kuuleka kota kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">wangudimila milogota na kwesela amo.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Waisilaeli ndo kota nhagala za migodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">wamamo wanguzibena na kuzilokota kwa chiwalo cha kubwinila chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Waisilaeli walihela nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">ahyo, Nguluwi, yawele nakawalumba hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">howonela isungu ama kuwalajila igano.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Kuli mhela awo uwele Mkulu Nguluwi koipulula isi hagati ha lwanda lwa Eyufulate na mbaka wa isi ya Misili, kowakungajiza wanhu wa heye weng'ha. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Mhela awo mhalamhanda yopembigwa kwa lizi likulu na wanhu weng'ha wa Isilaeli wawele nawahilikwa kuli isi za chijenzi ako Ashulu na Misili wohiluka na kumfugamila Mkulu Nguluwi mchanya mwa chidunda chelile cha Siyoni, ako Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa undewa wa kasikazini</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Mbuli yihile youfika muji wa Samaliya, muji ukulu wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">uwele mchanya mwa chigongo chiwele hagati ha ibindi liwele na mboto.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">Wanhu walingikala mgati mwa muji awo wangugala lukami na walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">ndo muji unojile lukami na uwele na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">ila mhela umwenga wokwajilila kota uluwa ulinguswinha na kukala!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yazidahe na kana mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">kota nhonya ya maganga na nhigu ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">kota nhonya ilingutowa lukami na kigala mazi tendema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">Kwa moko wa heye kowataga wanhu awo kuli misanga.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Kidaya kwa vilongozi walingugala wa Efulaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:3">kobigangwa kuli misanga.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Lutogo lwa hewo lokuka kota uluwa ulinguswinha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">Ukulu uwele naulongoza kuli ibindi liwele na mboto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">wowa kota tini zipile ung'hali mhela wa chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">wone munhu yazone kangukwanyulaga na kulya mhela wuwo.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Kuli mhela awo Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:5">kowa ndo itaji lya ukulu kwa wanhu wa heye wawele wosigala wakomu.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Kowalongoza walingwamula kuli chitala leka wadite hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">kowapa mong'ho walingwamila muji.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Vilongozi awo wanguzebeduka na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">kwa chiwalo cha kunwa lukami divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Watambika na waloli kahi wanguzebeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">kwa chiwalo cha kunwa lukami divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Hawalingijesa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">wangulota ila hawalinguvizela mana yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">kuli kulavya utaguso hawalingudita hachi.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Visaga vyeng'ha navimema vyowadechile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:8">haduhu honhu honeche halihela wavu.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Hewo wangumbeza heni na kumbuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">“Ayu mloli kangugana kumlangusa whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Kangumlonjela whaani usenga wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">Ndaze, hetwe twa wana wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">walechezwe kong'ha kuli mazuwa aga ga habehi?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Kangutulangusa kota wana wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">malajizo aga na malajizo gayage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">msitali awu na msitali uyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:10">chino na chila!”<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Lelo! Mkulu Nguluwi kolonga na wanhu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:11">kwa nzila ya wanhu wa ndonga ilivinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:11">walingulonga ndonga za chijenzi.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Ila heye nayali yawalonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">“Ndowalajila honhu ha kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">ndowadita mwesele hano hemwe mtochile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Hano ndo honhu ha kwesela.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Ila hewo hawaganile kuhulichiza.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Lelo, ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa hewo wowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">malajizo aga na malajizo gayage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">msitali awu na msitali uyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">chino na chila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">Wojeza kubilima ila wogwa kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">wobeneka na kugwilizwa.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Lelo, mhulichize ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">hemwe mlingubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">mlinguwalongoza wanhu wa Yelusalemu,<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Hemwe mlingidaya namdita ilagano na kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">namdita ilagano na isi ya wabagame!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">Mwangulonga kota magazo hogokuya hagowafika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">kwa vila namuudita udesi kota ndo kitumbila kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">uhadi ndo ngawo ya hemwe!<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Lelo, Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">“Ndanguliwika iganga lya msisi kuli muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">iganga liwele nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">iganga lya mwaluko kuli msisi lya sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">kwa chiwalo cha msisi uwele nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">yalingulitumbila hodita himahima.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Ndotumiya hachi kota chipimilo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">ndotumiya kutanganika kupimila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">Nhonya ya maganga yofajilila kutali udesi womlingitumbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">mazi tendema gowifya honhu ha hemwe ha kivisa.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Aho ilagano lya hemwe lyomliditile na kubagama lyokusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">na ilagano lya hemwe na isi ya wabagame lyokusigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">Magazo makulu hogokuya, gowagwisa.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Chila hogokolela kwa hemwe gowavaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">nago gokola chila mitondo na chila nemisi na chila nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">gowavaba kulawa mwaluko mbaka kuduma.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 28:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">Kuhulika hela usenga awu kowa ndo kukabusa.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Kwa hemwe yowa kota yalingigolola mchanya mwa chinhanda chidodo ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:20">ama kigubika igolole lidodo ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Mkulu Nguluwi kokuya na kukwambuza usumigwe kota vyoyawaditile Wafilisti kuli chidunda cha Pelasimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">kowa na ng'halazi ing'hang'hale, kota vyoyaditile kuli ibindi lya Gibeoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">Hoyochidita chowa cha kububuwaza lukami, hachiwele cha hihi hela.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Lelo, mleche kubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">leka minyololo ja hemwe jileche kuwa itunyo ikulu ng'hatu kwa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">nakanuwila kuidumya isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Muwiche goya makutu ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:23">mhulichize goya ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Ndaze, yalingulima kangunyalaga mazuwa geng'ha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">Ndaze, kangulutilila kulima na kuselega mgunda wa heye mazuwa geng'ha?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Hebu! Hoyosinda kuselega mgunda wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">kangunyalaga nyhule za bizali na jila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">konyala ngano na shayili kuli misitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">na kuli mbaka ja mgunda konyala mizuchila jinji.<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Munhu ayo kanguvizela choni cha kudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:26">kwa vila Nguluwi wa heye kangumlangusa.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Bizali hambe ipululwe kwa chuma ne jila kwa mutuka wa misenga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">Ila bizali yangupululwa kwa ngoda na jila kwa nyhimbati.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Nyhule yanguganigwa ibalaswe leka kugongomanya ibumunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">ahyo, munhu halingulutilila kupulula mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">Kanguvizela ndaze vyoyopulula kwa guludumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">ne kuwifya ng'hatu nyhule za ngano.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Uwanzi awu wangulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">Kiwika goya kwa Nguluwi ndo kwa kububuwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">luhala lwa heye nalwenela ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">Usenga kuwala Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Kochona hegwe Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">muji uwele mndewa Daudi nakekala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">Wanhu wa hegwe wangulutilila kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha mnvina za chila mwaka.<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Ila heni Nguluwi, ndougalila magazo muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">wanhu wa hegwe wolila na kulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">kwa heni muji awo wowa kota honhu ha kubwinila chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Heni ndokuzunguluta banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:3">ndozenga milingo ja kukwinila kuli ng'hanzi na kukutowa.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Kogwiswa mgati ng'hatu mwa misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">kulawa ako kutali kolavya lizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">Ulonzi wa hegwe wolawa ako kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">kota vila lizi lya ihoka.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Baho du wang'honyo wa hegwe wenji wowa kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">wawele na nhumbula zihile wowa kota mhumba ilinguwembeluswa.<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho kokuya kukutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">kokuya kota kubuma na kota limachinyhina likulu na kwa lizi ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">kota chivuluvumbi na kota chiluli chilingulakaza.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Vilundo vya wanhu wa isi zeng'ha walinguutowa muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">weng'ha walinguitowa ngome yake na kuuzunguluta kwa wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">wokwajilila kota kulota kwa nechilo.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Kota vila munhu yawele na nzala vyoyalingulota kangulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">ila kangwinukaga yang'hali kangutamika nzala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">Ama kota vila munhu yawele na ng'halu vyoyalingulota kangunwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">ila kangwinukaga yawele ng'hochele kwa chiwalo cha ng'halu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">Ahyo ndo vyoiwa kwa vilundo vyeng'ha vya wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">vilinguchivaba chidunda cha Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">mlutilile kububuwazwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Midite wohambe walole na mleche kona!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Mgale ila ileche kuwa kwa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">mzebeduche ila ileche kuwa kwa ujimbi.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakawegalila usinjizi ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">nakadinya meho ga hemwe waloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">nakagubika vitwi vya hemwe mlingulola.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Lelo uloli wa hemwe weng'ha ndo kota usenga wandichigwe kuli chitabu chihindigwe kwa muhuli. Wone mumhilichile munhu yoneche yalinguvizela kusoma na kumlonjela, “Dedede, usome chandichigwe kuli chitabu chino,” kolonga, “Siweza kusoma kwa vila nachihindigwa kwa muhuli.” <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Ama wone mumhe munhu yoneche yohambe yadahile kusoma na kumlonjela, “Usome chandichigwe kuli chitabu chino,” kowedichila hemwe, “Sidahile kusoma.”<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">“Wanhu awa wanguya kufugamila heni kwa ulonzi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">ila nhumbula za hewo za kutali na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">Mhela howofugamila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">wanguwinza malajizo hela gawele wanhu nawagawika na gawele wangugalonga mhela winji.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Ahyo ndowaditila kahi vinduzanduza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">viwele vyowakabusa na kuwabubuwaza wanhu awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">na kuwifya luhala lwa walingulonga wana luhala na kuvizela.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitumbila kuli mazuwa galinguya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Mochona hemwe mlingijesa mwangumvisa Mkulu Nguluwi majesa ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">mlingukola madito ga hemwe kuli jiza na kulonga, “Haduhu yawele yotona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">whaani yoweza kuvizela chotulingudita?”<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Hemwe mlingugalusa mbuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Mwangijesa kota ilongo lya kulumbila vinhu lyangiwhana na yalingulumba vinhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Chinhu chilumbigwe hachiweza kumlonjela munhu yawele nakachilumba chinhu acho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">“Hegwe haunditile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Chiya hachiweza kumlonjela yachilumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">“Hegwe hauvizelele choneche.”<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Ung'hali mhela uchefu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">chihulo cha Lebanoni choditigwa kuwa mgunda uwele na mboto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">na mgunda uwele na mboto woditigwa kuwa chihulo.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Kuli zuwa alyo wohambe wahuliche wohulika usenga ulingusomigwa kuli chitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">na kuli jiza, wohambe walole wokwaluka kona.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Walingunyenyetela wosangalala kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:19">ng'hochele wotowa luchenze kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:19">kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ziwele naziditigwa na Nguluwi Yelile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Wawele na nhumbula zihile wodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">walingumbeza Nguluwi womala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">weng'ha walingulewela wihe wokwajilizwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Nguluwi kowadumya wala walinguwalonga vibi wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">wala wanhu walingulemeza kugazigwa kwa wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:21">na wala walingulonga udesi leka kuwabunza hachi walihela nongwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi yawele nakamgombola Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">nakalonga hino kuwala walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">“Walelwa wa Yakobo hawobasigwa soni ne kudeuzwa kahi.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Howowona wana wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">wana wondiwapele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">wolitogola itagwa lya heni Yelile wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">wondumba heni Nguluwi wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Mhela awo houfika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">wapoka wochilangusa kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">na wala walingung'ung'uta wokunda kulanguswa.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Awu ndo usenga wa Mkulu Nguluwi kuwala wanhu walingumbelenhuka heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">“Mwanguwinza majesa ga hemwe, hagawele ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">mwangulanda kwamilwa na wanhu wa isi zinji, ila hamlingulanda kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">na mwangulutilila kudita gehile.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Namluta Misili kuwalanda utanzi vilongozi wa isi ayo ne kumbuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">namitumbila kuli wamizi wa mndewa wa Misili, Falao, kuwamila hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">kota wanhu wawele nawekalisa kuli lubehelo lwa igodi kiyamila na ivuche.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Ila kwamilwa na Falao kowa soni kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:3">lubehelo lwa isi ya Misili lowadita hemwe mdeule.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Hanga vilongozi wa hewo nawafika Soani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:4">na wasenga wa hewo kahi nawafika ako Hanesi,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />weng'ha wobasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi wohambe watanze chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">wawele hawalingigala utanzi ne chinhu cha mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">ila kuwegalila soni na kudeula hela.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Nguluwi kangulonga hino kuwala migongolo ja Negebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">“Wasenga wangukola kuli isi ya magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">kuli honhu hawele misimba jangikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">hawele na mizoka jiwele na dunga na mizoka jilingunyonzoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">Wasenga awo wangukola na lufufu lwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">mchanya mwa migongo ja midogowi na ngamiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">kuwahilichila wanhu wa isi wawele hawalingutanza chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Utanzi kulawa Misili haulingutanza chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">ahyo Misili nandiichema hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">‘Izoka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Izoka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwa chiebulaniya ndo Lahabu.</char></note> lilihela mong'ho!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wohambe wahulichize</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Nguluwi nakandonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">“Lelo, wandiche usenga awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">leka ukale kwa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Wanhu awa nawabelenhuka, ndo kota wana wahadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">wana wawele hawalingugana kuhulichiza malanguso ga Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Wanguwalonjela wasenga wa Nguluwi na waloli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">‘Mleche kutulonjela kahi choyawalajile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">na mleche kudamla kukomya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">Mtulonjele mbuli zotulingugana kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">hanga zowa ndo mbuli za udesi.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Mgalamche na muileche nzila ya kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:11">mleche kutulonjela kahi kuwala Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Ahyo Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">“Namuulema usenga wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">namnuwila kubunza na uhadi.<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />Lelo gehile aga gowegalila hemwe kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">kota lukanzi luwele ng'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">luwele na ufa ukulu luwele logwa baho du.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Kugwa kwa lukanzi alo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">ndo kota kubeneka kwa vinhu vya ilongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">vilingubeneka vibi ng'hatu ne kusigala chihande cha kuholela chiluli kuchiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">ama kudehela mazi kuli ideho.”<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">“Wone mwahangalamchile na kusindamala mwahaloholigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">kwa kusindamala na kwa kitumbila kwa heni, mwahawele na mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Ila hemwe hamganile.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Namlonga, ‘Hebu! Tobilima kwa falasi walingubilima lukami.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Goya, mobilima na falasi walingubilima lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">ila falasi wa wang'honyo wa hemwe, wangubilima ng'hatu kusinda falasi wa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Wanhu wa hemwe elufu imwe wombilima mwamizi yumwe wa wang'honyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">na wamizi wahano wa wang'honyo wohega kuwabilimisa hemwe mweng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">Hemwe mweng'ha mobilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">ila wachefu hela hali hemwe ndo wosigala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">kota izengo lya bendela vyolilinguwa liliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">mchanya mwa chinhembenhembe cha chidunda.”<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kowatanza wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangubeteza kuwalajila hemwe isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">nakewika goya kuwalechela kwa vila mazuwa gose kanguditaga gawele ga hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">Nawatambichizwa wala weng'ha walingitumbila kwa heye.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Hemwe wanhu mlingikala Yelusalemu, hamlila kahi. Mkulu Nguluwi kowonela isungu hemwe, homumlanda utanzi wake, naye kowedichila. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Hanga Mkulu Nguluwi kowapa hemwe magazo na usungu kota ndo chilyo na mazi, ila lelo momona kahi Mkulu, mlangusa wa hemwe, naye kowalongoza. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Mohulika lizi kumbele kwa hemwe lilingulonga, “Nzila ndo ayi, muiwinze.” <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Hamba mojidita jimalukolo ja milungu ja hemwe jibakalizwe sendi na jimalukolo ja hemwe jibakalizwe zahabu jiwe jikokomoche. Mojitoza kutali kota vinhu vikokomoche kuno mlonga, “Mwajilile ng'hatu!”<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Homnyala nyhadikwa za hemwe, Mkulu Nguluwi kowegalila hemwe nhonya kwa mhela wa heye, nazo zokota na kuwapa mbena nyinji ng'hatu. Migongolo ja hemwe ja kufujigwa najo jopata honhu hakulu ha kudimilwa. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Mibuguma na midogowi ja hemwe milume ja kulimila jolya misolo jinojile na chilyo chigongomanyigwe goya. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Kuli zuwa alyo liwele ngome za wang'honyo wa hegwe hoziholigwa na wanhu wake kukopoligwa, nzanda za mazi zolavya mazi kulawa kuli chila chidunda na kulawa kuli chila chigongo. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Nyelezi yokwaka kota isanya, nalo lumuli lwa isanya lopulika mala saba mzidi wa lumuli lwake lwa chila zuwa, kota vila lumuli lwa mazuwa saba, mhela Mkulu Nguluwi hoyoviwopa vilonda vya wanhu wa heye viwele heye yuye nakambuza.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi koitowa isi ya Ashulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Mlole, mong'ho na ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi wangoneka kulawa kutali!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">Chiluli na iyosi vyangulajila ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">mlomo wa heye wangulajila kuzudila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">kangulonga na ulonzi wa heye wangulakaza kota chiluli.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Kangulajiza chivuluvumbi kumwando kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">kota mazi tendema galinguhola chila chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">Kanguwika lijamu ya falasi kuli mizeze ja wanhu wa isi iwele yanguwalongoza kuli kwajilila.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Ila hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu mosangalala na kwimba kota vyomlingudita kuli mhela wa nechilo ya mnvina yelile. Mosangalala kota wanhu walingujenda kuno wovina muzichi wa mluli kuluta kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi, Italawe lya Isilaeli. <verse eid="ISA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Mkulu Nguluwi kowadita wanhu weng'ha walihuliche lizi lya heye likulu na kuwona mong'ho wa ng'halazi ya heye. Kowa na milapi ja chiluli ching'hang'hale na kubuma na nhigu na nhonya ya maganga. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Waashulu howohulika lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi womema lunhwinhwi na kwa nyhimbati ya heye kowatowa. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />Chila mhela nyhimbati ya Mkulu Nguluwi hoiwa iwatowa Waashulu, wanhu wa heye wowa wovina muzichi wa ngoma na igombogombo. Nguluwi yuye kochitowa na Waashulu. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Ena, honhu ha kumdumya mndewa wa Ashulu nahawichigwa goya kwa mhela winji ukolile. Honhu aho ndo ikulubila likulu na ligazi liwele na chiluli na ngodi nyinji. Mkulu Nguluwi kochibwina chiluli kwa lweselo lwa heye kota maganga ga chikwatilo.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kuwala wanhu walingitumbila kuli isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Wochona hewo walinguluta Misili kulanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wala walingitumbila falasi na winji wa mituka ja hewo ja ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">na mong'ho wa wamizi wakwina falasi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wohambe wetumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">ne kupala utanzi kwa Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Nguluwi kana luhala na ndo yalingigala kudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">halingugalula ulonzi wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">Ka goya kitowa na wehile na walinguwatanza walingudita gehile.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Wamisili ndo wanhu hela, hawawele Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">falasi wa hewo ndo migongolo hela, hajiwele muhe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Mkulu Nguluwi hoyogolola moko wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">wanhu wa isi walingulavya utanzi wochikwang'hwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">na wala walingutanzigwa wogwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">weng'ha wodumigwa hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kowamila muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakandonjela hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">“Kota vila isimba ama isimba lyana vyolilingubuma kuli kupelemba kwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">wone chichemigwe chilundo cha wadimi kulitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">halilingudumba iyowe lya hewo ne kutinhuka kwa chiwalo cha lizi lya hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">Ahyo ndo heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho vyondidulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">kitowa mchanya mwa chidunda cha Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Kota chideje vyochilingugulukaguluka mchanya mwa chimvulila chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">kuchamila chibofu chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">ndo heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho vyondikwamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">na kuulewela muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Hemwe Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:6">mngalamchile heni kwa vila hemwe nambelenhuka heni.<verse eid="ISA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Mhela wofika uwele hemwe mweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:7">mojitajila kutali jimalukolo ja hemwe jibakalizwe sendi na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:7">jiwele namjigongomanya kwa moko ga hemwe gawele gehile.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Waashulu wokopoligwa kwa ipanga, ila haliwele ipanga lya munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">wasongolo wa hewo wojeza kusulupuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">ila wobatigwa na kuditigwa wakole mijito ja upogozi kwa lupichi.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Ngome za hewo zogwa kwa chiwalo cha lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">wang'hangala wa hewo wozileka bendela za hewo na kubilima kwa chiwalo cha kukabuswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">Ena, heni Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo kota chiluli kuli chidunda cha Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">ndo kota itanulu lilingwaka kuli muji wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa yatanganiche</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Kokuya mndewa yawele kolongoza kwa kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:1">nawo vilongozi wa heye womtanza kwa kudita hachi.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Chila chilongozi kowa kota honhu ha kiyamila na mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">kota honhu ha kivisa mhela wa chivuluvumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">Wowa kota nzanda za mazi kuli isi iwele kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">kota isisila lya italawe likulu kuli ivuche lya isanya.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Hamba, wala wawele na meho wogubula meho leka kona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:3">na wala wawele na makutu wogawika goya makutu ga hewo kuhulika.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Walinguditaga mbuli ne kijesa wokwamula kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:4">wawele na chisembe wolonga goya.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Wapoka hawochemigwa wanojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:5">ne wehile kutogoligwa.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Wapoka wangulongaga upoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">na majesa ga hewo ndo kiwika goya kudita mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">kulonga mbuli za kumliga Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">Wanguwalekaga wawele na nzala ne chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">na wawele na ng'halu ne mazi.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Wajuvi ndo wanhu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">wangijesaga mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">leka kuwadumya wazunwa kwa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">hanga ulonzi wa wazunwa ndo wa kukomya.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Ila vilongozi awo wangijesaga mbuli zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:8">kwa madito ga hewo ganojile, mbuli za hewo zangulutililaga goya.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa wadala wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Mhulichize hemwe wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">muwele kuli usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">hemwe mlingiwona kota mwa hali kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">mhulichize chondilingugana kuwalonjela hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Kuli mwaka umwe ulinguya mokakama hemwe muwele namiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">kwa vila hampata mbena za zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">ne mbena za mafuza ganji.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Mkakame hemwe wadala mlingusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">mkakame kwa lunhwinhwi hemwe wahinza mlingiwona kota mwa kuli kikala goya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">Mvule mivalo ja hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">mvale mivalo ja migunila kuli vyuno vya hemwe, kwa chiwalo cha masinzo.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Mtowe mhambaga za hemwe kwa masinzo kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ziwele zolawila kuli migunda jinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:12">kwa chiwalo cha mizabibu jilelile goya,<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />kwa vila miwa na mikwangwasale hela ndo jozuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">ena, mlombocheze kwa chiwalo cha ng'handa zeng'ha ziwele na usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">na kwa chiwalo cha muji awu ulingudita mnvina.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Ng'handa za mndewa zolechigwa mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">muji awo uwele na wanhu wenji wolechigwa uliyeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">Chidunda na ilingo lya kwamila vyowa hela wanhu mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">midogowi ja kisolo jokolakola amo kwa usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">ming'holo jopata honhu ha kudila amo.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />Kolutilila kuwa ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">mbaka tupegwe muhe wa Nguluwi kulawa kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">Aho kugunuche kowa mgunda uwele na mboto kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">na mgunda uwele na mboto wowa kota chihulo.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Hachi yochikala kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:16">kutanganika kosigala kuli migunda jiwele na mboto.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Mafuza ga kutanganika ako ndo wanhu kuwa na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:17">na kusindamala na kikala goya vyochikala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Wanhu wa heni wochikala haluga hawele na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:18">honhu halingwamilwa goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:18">kuli ng'handa ziwele kuli honhu hasindamale.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Hanga nhonya ya maganga yochidumya chihulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:19">na muji weng'ha kugwa,<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />ila hemwe motambichizwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">Monyala nyhule honeche hali mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">misenga na midogowi ja hemwe jojendajenda vyojilingugana.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kowalohola wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Kochona hegwe gwa ulingudumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">ulingudumya ne hegwe kudumigwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Kochona hegwe ulingubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">uwele haduhu yakubelenhuche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Houleka kudumya nagwe kodumigwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Housinda kuwabelenhuka wanhu, nawo wokubelenhuka.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, tonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">kwa vila twangitumbila kwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">Uwe mong'ho wa hetwe chila mitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">na ulohozi wa hetwe kuli mhela wa magazo.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Kwa kubuma kwa lizi lya hegwe, wang'honyo wangubilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">houkwinuka, wanhu wa isi zinji wangusambalukaga.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Wang'honyo wa hetwe howosumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">tohola vinhu vya hewo vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">kota ikugusi lya nzije vyolilingulya mahamba ga mizuchila.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakatogoligwa, kwa vila kangikala kuchanya kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">koumemeza muji wa Yelusalemu kwa hachi na kutanganika.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Mbuli ayo hoikoleka, heye kowadita hemwe mikale kuli kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">na kowadita hemwe muwe na luhala na kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi kowa ndo mwaluko wa ng'hano ayi.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Ulole lelo, wazidahe wa hetwe wangulila kwa lizi likulu mbalabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:7">wasenga wa hetwe nawaluta kuli isi ziyage leka kikundiza kuwala kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:7">ila wolila kwa usungu ng'hatu kwa vila hawoweza kudita ahyo.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Haduhu yoneche yalingukola kuli nzila za hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">kikundiza kuwala kikala goya nakumala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">nawawabeza wanhu wawele nawekundiza kuwala kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">na hawalinguwahulichiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">Haduhu yoneche yalinguhulichizwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Isi yangukala na yanguwa mhende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">mielezi ja Lebanoni jangukala na kola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">ibindi linojile lya Shaloni lyanguwa kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">ako Bashani na kuli chidunda cha Kalimeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">migodi jangulagaza mahamba gake.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwakanya wang'honyo wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">“Lelo ndokwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">lelo ndotogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:10">lelo ndokwinuligwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Namwali na himila ya mhumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">namlela mabeleje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">lweselo lwa hemwe ndo chiluli chilinguwalakaza hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Wanhu wa isi wolakazwa mbaka mizeje jawo jeng'ha jiwe chokaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:12">wolakala himahima kota miwa na visosolo vikalile.<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Mhulichize mbuli zonditile, hemwe muwele kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">namwe muwele habehi muuzele ukulu wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Wawele na gehile kuli muji wa Yelusalemu wana lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">kukakama nakuwafika wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi, wangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">“Whaani hali hetwe koweza kikala na chiluli achi ching'hang'hale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">Whaani hali hetwe koweza kikala na chiluli chilingwaka mazuwa gose?”<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Yalingikala kwa kutanganika na kulonga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">munhu yalingulema chinhu cha mzidi chilinguya kwa kubunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">yalingulemeza ng'hatu moko ga heye kubochela chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">yalingulemeza makutu ga heye kuhulichiza ulonzi wa kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">na yalingudinya meho ga heye leka yaleche kona wihe,<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />ayo ndo munhu yawele kochikala honhu ha kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">yawele honhu ha heye ha kubilimila howa ngome ya kuchidunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">Kopegwa ibumunda lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">na mazi gake ga kunwa hagoweza kumala.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhela unojile ulinguya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Meho ga hemwe gomona mndewa kuli kunoga kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:17">na kuyona isi yoyalinguilongoza, isi ng'hulu na ngazi.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Kuli majesa ga hemwe mowa mchijesa kuwala kudumba kukolile na kiwuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">“Wa kohi wala wejesile na kuwika kodi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">Wa kohi wala vilongozi waholile ushulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">Wa kohi wala wakulu walingulolela ilingo?”<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Hamuweza kuwona kahi wala wanhu wawele na ujuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:19">wawele na ndonga ya chijenzi, yohambe izeleche.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Mlole Siyoni, muji wa mnvina za hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">meho ga hemwe goulola muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">honhu ha kikala goya ha kikala, ihema liwele haliweza kusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">vigingi vyake haviweza kung'humbuligwa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">haduhu ng'weso yake iwele yoweza kudumuka.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Amo Mkulu Nguluwi kotulajila ukulu wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">Tochikala habehi na nzanda ng'hulu na nzanda ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">kuwele meli za ngondo haziweza kukola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">ne meli ng'hulu kwinjila.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mtagusa wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">heye ndo chilongozi wa wamizi wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo mndewa wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">heye ndo yalingutulohola.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Gwa Siyoni, ng'weso za meli za hemwe nazilejela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">Izengo lyake halimile nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">na tanga lyake haligonzoligwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">Ila winji wa vinhu vilawile kuli ngondo wopegwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">mbaka vyete woweza kuhola vinhu vyawo.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Haduhu yoneche yalingikala Siyoni yolonga, “Heni nda mtamwa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:24">na gehile ga hewo walingikala amo golechigwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kowagaza wang'honyo wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Hemwe wanhu wa isi zinji, mhejele habehi leka mhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">muwiche goya makutu ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">ndangugana isi na chila chinhu chiwele amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">vihuliche ulonzi wondilonga.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakawazudila wanhu weng'ha wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">kuzudila kwa heye nakwambuzwa na wamizi wa hewo weng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">Nakamula kuwakopola kwa kuwawika mmoko mwa walingudumula singo.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Wanhu wawele nawakopoligwa, wotozigwa kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">ng'huli za hewo zonhung'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">na danda ya hewo yochililika kulawa kuli vidunda.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Nhondwe zeng'ha za kilanga zowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">ulanga wochibina kota kalatasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">Nhondwe za heye zeng'ha zoswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">kota mahamba ga mzabibu vyogalingukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">ena, kota ifuza lya mtini vyolilingukala.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Nguluwi nakaliwika goya ipanga lya heye ako kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">nalyo lyowatema Waedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">wanhu wawele heye nakamula kuwadumya.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Ipanga lya heye lyododa danda na mafuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">kota danda na mafuta ga ing'holo ilume na ipongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">mafuta kulawa kuli figo za ming'holo milume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">jiwele najilavigwa nhambiko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">Mkulu Nguluwi kolavya nhambiko azo kuli muji wa Bosila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">kokudita kukopola ako kukulu kuli isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Mibogo ja kisolo jodumigwa hamwe na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">milogota milume na mibuguma kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">Isi yododa kwa danda na misanga jogubikwa na mafuta ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakehagulila mwaka na zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:8">kwa chiwalo cha kuhilula chibida kwa wang'honyo wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Lami yochililika kuli vikolola vya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">ilongo lyake lyogaluka na kuwa maganga ga chikwatilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:9">misanga jake jowa lami ilingwaka.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Vyokwaka nemisi na nechilo ne kuzimya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">iyosi lyofung'ha mhela weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">Isi yowa chiwala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">haduhu yawele yokola ako kahi.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Kowa haluga ha kozi na nungunungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">mituwe mikulu na mibondwa jochikala amo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">Mkulu Nguluwi kowegalila ivuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">na isi yowa ilihela chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Edomu yochemigwa “Isi ilihela mndewa,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:12">vilongozi wake weng'ha nawajilila.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Miwa jokota kuli ngome zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">migodi ja miwa na mikwangwasale jowa kuli mahame ga hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">Yowa haluga ha mibwa ja kisolo na mituwe.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Migongolo ja kugunuche joting'hana na idula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">mipongo ja kisolo jolila kwa kuchemeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">vilumbigwe vya nechilo vyosindamala amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:14">na kipalila honhu ha kwesela.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Mituwe jowika vimvulila na kulagaza mafinga amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">jokong'osola na kulolela mibofu jawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">hanyi kuli lubehelo lwa mabawa gawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">Vilutema vyoting'hana amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">chila chimwe na chiyage.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Msome kuli chitabu cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">“Haduhu chilumbigwe ne chimwe chiwele chowa haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">chila chimwe chowa na chiyage.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi yuye nakalonga ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">muhe wa heye wowakungajiza weng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakahawika goya honhu ha vilumbigwe avyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">nakatumiya vipimilo kuipimila isi ya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">yowa yawo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">lulelo lumwe mbaka lulelo luyage lochikala amo.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Kusangalala kwa wanhu wawele nawagomboligwa ako Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Chiwala na isi ng'havu vyosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:1">kugunuche kosangalala na kubahula uluwa.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Kobahula uluwa kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">kotowa luchenze na kwimba kwa kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Nguluwi kokupa lufufu lwa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">na kunoga kwa chidunda cha Kalimeli na ibindi lya Shaloni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Wanhu wowona ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi hala kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">wovyona vinduzanduza vya Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Mgadite moko ga hemwe gawele ng'hochele gawe nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:3">mgadite mafugamilo ga hemwe galihela mong'ho gawe nzinzili.<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Muwalonjele watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">“Mikangaze nhumbula, mleche kudumba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">Mlole, Nguluwi wa hemwe kokuya kuhilula chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">kokuya kuwatowa wang'honyo wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">kokuya heye yuye kuwalohola hemwe.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Aho meho ga wohambe walole gogubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:5">na makutu ga wohambe wahuliche gohulika kahi.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Vyete wonyozokanyozoka kota ibala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">na myango za wohambe walonje zokwimba kwa kusangalala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">Mazi gochililika himahima kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">na kuli nzanda za mazi kuli kugunuche.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Sangalaza zilingulakaza zowa ilamba lya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">isi ikalile yolavya nzasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">Haluga ha mikanhu hojiwasile aho hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">misolo jozuka na kukula kota mikuluwili.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Ako kowa na nzila ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">nayo yochemigwa “Nzila Yelile.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Wanhu wakokomoche hawokola amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">yowa ya wala walingujenda kuli nzila ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">wapoka hawojeza kubiga nzila ayo.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Ako hakuweza kuwa na isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">ne igongolo lyoneche ling'hang'hale holikola amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">ne koneka amo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:9">Ila wala wawele nawagomboligwa hela ndo wokola amo.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Wagomboligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi wohiluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">wokuya Yelusalemu kuno wokwimba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">Wowa wawele na usangalalo wa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">wopegwa usangalalo na luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">masinzo na chililo vyokwajilila ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Senakelibu kanguukabusa muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2 Wandewa 18:13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2 Mihela 32:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Kuli mwaka wa kumi na zine wa ulongozi wa mndewa Hesekiya, Senakelibu, mndewa wa Ashulu, nakajitowa miji jeng'ha ja Yuda jiwele na ngome na kujihola. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Hamba mndewa wa Ashulu nakamlajiza chilongozi wa wamizi kulawa Lakishi kuluta kwa mndewa Hesekiya ako Yelusalemu hamwe na wamizi wenji. Chilongozi wa wamizi nakema habehi na chikolola cha ilamba lya kuchanya, lizenjigwe kuli nzila ng'hulu ilinguluta kuli Chalanza cha Dobi. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Vilongozi wadatu hali ulongozi wa Hesekiya nawaluta kumhulichiza chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi wa Ashulu, vilongozi awo ndo Eliyakimu, mwana wa Hilikiya, yawele nayali yoilolela ng'handa ya mndewa na Shebuna, yawele nayali yalingwandika, hamwe na Yowa, mwana wa Asafu, yalingwandika kukumbuchila. <verse eid="ISA 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi nakawalonjela, “Mumlonjele Hesekiya, ahi ndo vyoyalingulonga mndewa mkulu, mndewa wa Ashulu, ‘Kwangitumbila choni? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Kwangulonga kuna majesa ganojile na mong'ho wa wamizi, ila kwangulonga hela. Kwangitumbila kwa whaani mbaka nakumbelenhuka heni? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Ulole! Kwangitumbila ako Misili, ng'hweku yila ya idenje ituliche iwele yanguuhomaga na kuulumiza moko wa munhu yalinguyegamila. Ahyo ndo vyoyawele Falao, mndewa wa Misili, kwa weng'ha walingitumbila kwa heye.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Chilongozi wa wamizi wa Ashulu nakalutilila kulonga, “Wone mondonjela kota mwangitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe, ndaze, hawele yuyo Nguluwi yawele Hesekiya nakahawifya honhu hake ha kufugamila na honhu hake ha kufunyizila ubani na kuwalonjela wanhu wa Yuda na wanhu wa Yelusalemu wafugame hali honhu hamwe hela ha kulavila nhambiko hawele ndo Yelusalemu? <verse eid="ISA 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />Lelo, muye kudita ilagano na mkulu wa heni, mndewa wa Ashulu, nani ndowapa hemwe falasi elufu mbili (2,000), wone moweza kuwa na wakwina falasi wa kuhega. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Moweza ndaze kumsumya chilongozi ne yumwe yawele mdodo hali vilongozi wa mkulu wa heni, kuno mwangitumbila kuli isi ya Misili kwa mituka ja ngondo na wakwina falasi? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Mzidi wa ago, ndaze, mwangijesa kota nambuya kuitowa isi ayi ne kulajizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi? Mkulu Nguluwi yuye ndo yandajize kuitowa na kuidumya isi ayi.”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Hamba Eliyakimu na Shebuna na Yowa nawamlonjela ayo chilongozi wa wamizi, “Dedede, ulongase na hetwe vitumagwa wa hegwe kwa ndonga ya Chialamu, kwa vila twanguizela. Uleche kulongasa na hetwe kwa Chiebulaniya, kwa vila wanhu wawele kuli lukanzi wanguhulichiza.” <verse eid="ISA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Ila yula chilongozi wa wamizi nakalonga, “Ndaze, mkulu wa heni nakandajiza kulavya usenga awu kwa mkulu wa hemwe na kwa hemwe hela? Nakandajiza kahi kwa wanhu walingikalisa kuli lukanzi, wawele woganigwa kulya midohe ja hewo wawo na kunwa mitunzi ja hewo wawo, kwa vila kowa haduhu chinhu choneche cha kulya na kunwa.”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Hamba ayo chilongozi wa wamizi nakema na kulonga kwa Chiebulaniya kwa lizi likulu, “Mhulichize ulonzi wa mndewa mkulu, mndewa wa Ashulu! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Kangulonga kota mleche kukunda Hesekiya yawahade hemwe, kwa vila howeza kuwalohola. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Mleche kukunda Hesekiya yawahade hemwe leka mitumbile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa kuwalonjela, ‘Mkulu Nguluwi kotulohola. Muji awu hauwichigwa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu.’ <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Mleche kumhulichiza Hesekiya, kwa vila mndewa wa Ashulu kangulonga kota mihanyise na heye na mlawe kuli muji wa hemwe. Hamba chila yumwe wa hemwe kolya kulawa kuli mzabibu wa heye yuye na mtini wa heye yuye na kunwa mazi kulawa kuli ideho lya heye yuye, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />mbaka aho hamba hoyowahilika kutali kuli isi kota ayi ya hemwe, isi iwele na mizabibu na divai na nyhule na mibumunda. <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Lelo mlolele leka Hesekiya yaleche kuwahada hoyolonga kota Mkulu Nguluwi kowalohola hemwe. Ndaze, kabaho mlungu wa wanhu wa isi yoneche yawele nakawalohola kulawa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Jakohi milungu ja Hamati na Alipadi? Jakohi milungu ja Sefalivaimu? Ndaze, milungu joneche najiulohola muji wa Samaliya kulawa mmoko mwa heye? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Mlungu wachi hali milungu ja isi azi yawele nakailohola isi ya heye mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu? Ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi howeza kuulohola muji wa Yelusalemu kulawa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu.”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Ila wanhu nawenyamalila, hawedichile chinhu choneche, kwa vila mndewa Hesekiya nayali yawalonjele, “Mleche kumwidichila.” <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Hamba Eliyakimu na Shebuna na Yowa nawaluta kwa Hesekiya kuno mivalo ja hewo jidaduligwe kwa kulajila masinzo na kumlonjela ulonzi uwele chilongozi mkulu wa wamizi woyaulonjile.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Hesekiya kangulanda yalonjelwe mbuli za luhala na mloli Isaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2 Wandewa 19:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Mndewa Hesekiya loyahuliche mbuli azo, nakadadula mivalo ja heye na kuvala mivalo ja igunila kwa kulajila masinzo, nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Nakawalajiza Eliyakimu, yawele nayali yoilolela ng'handa ya mndewa na Shebuna, yalingwandika na vilongozi wa watambika, weng'ha wawele wavalile mivalo ja migunila, walute kwa mloli Isaya, mwana wa Amosi. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Nawamlonjela, “Awu ndo usenga kulawa kwa Hesekiya, ‘Lehano ndo zuwa lya magazo na lya kung'hanuchilwa na lya soni, kota vila mhela wana vyowowa habehi kupondigwa na haduhu mong'ho wa kuwaponda. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Hanji Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe nakauhulika ulonzi wa chilongozi wa wamizi, yawele mkulu wa heye, mndewa wa Ashulu, nakamlajiza kumbeza Nguluwi yawele mkomu. Hanji Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe komng'hanuchila. Ahyo ulande kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wasigale.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Lelo vitumagwa wa mndewa Hesekiya lowafichile kwa Isaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Isaya nakawalonjela wamlonjele mkulu wa heye, “Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga, ‘Uleche kudumba kwa ulonzi wouuhuliche, wula ulonzi uwele vitumagwa wa mndewa wa Ashulu waulonjile kundiga heni. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Ulole! Ndomuwichila mndewa muhe umwenga mgati mwake leka hoyohulika usenga umwenga, kohiluka kuli isi ya heye yuye, nani ndomdita yakopoligwe hala kwa ipanga.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waashulu wanguwakabusa wanhu wa Yelusalemu kahi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:8-19">2 Wandewa 19:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Chilongozi wa wamizi loyahuliche kota mndewa wa Ashulu nakoka Lakishi, nakahiluka na kumfika mndewa youtowa muji wa Libuna. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Lelo mndewa Senakelibu nakahulika kota Tilihaka, Mkushi, mndewa wa Misili nayali yoluta kitowa na heye, ahyo nakawalajiza wasenga kwa Hesekiya yolonga, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Mumlonjele Hesekiya, mndewa wa Yuda, ‘Uleche kuhadigwa na Nguluwi wa hegwe youlingitumbila hoyolonga kota Yelusalemu haiwichigwa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Ndikomya hegwe nakuhulika zila mbuli zowaziditile wandewa wa Ashulu kuli isi zeng'ha, wowadumya ng'hatu. Ndaze, hegwe koloholigwa? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Ndaze, ajo milungu ja wanhu wa isi wawele nawadumigwa na wasekulu wa heni, milungu ja Gosani na Halani na Lesefu na ja wanhu wa Edeni wawele nawali wochikala ako Telasali, najiweza kuwalohola? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Wakohi wandewa wa miji ja Hamati na Alipadi na Sefalivaimu na Hena na wa Iva?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa Hesekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Mndewa Hesekiya nakabochela baluwa kulawa kwa wasenga na kuisoma. Hamba nakaluta na kwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi, naye nakaiwika hali Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Hamba Hesekiya nakalanda kwa Mkulu Nguluwi yolonga, <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi Uwele na Mong'ho, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, ulingikalisa kuli chigoda cha undewa hagati ha vilumbigwe viwele na mabawa, hegwe uliyeka ndo Nguluwi mchanya mwa undewa weng'ha wa kuli isi. Hegwe nakulumba isi na ulanga. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uwiche goya ikutu lya hegwe leka uhulichize, ugubule meho ga hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi leka wone, uhulichize ulonzi weng'ha uwele Senakelibu nakalajiza kukuliga hegwe Nguluwi uwele mkomu. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndikomya kota wandewa wa Ashulu nawawadumya wanhu wa isi zeng'ha na isi za hewo. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Nawajitoza milungu ja hewo kuli chiluli na kujidumya, kwa vila hajiwele milungu ja kukomya, ila najali jimalukolo ja migodi na maganga jihongoligwe na moko ga wanhu. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Lelo, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hetwe, utulohole kulawa mmoko mwa Senakelibu, leka undewa wa isi zeng'ha uvizele kota hegwe uliyeka, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaya kangulavya uloli kuwala kugwa kwa mndewa Senakelibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:20-37">2 Wandewa 19:20-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Hamba Isaya, mwana wa Amosi, nakahilika usenga kwa Hesekiya, yolonga, “Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Isilaeli kangulonga kota kwa vila nakundanda kuwala Senakelibu, mndewa wa Ashulu, <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />lelo awu ndo ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi woyalonjile kuwala Senakelibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">“ ‘Mhinza Siyoni, kangukuseka na kukubeza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">Mhinza Yelusalemu kangutigasa mutwi wa heye houbilima.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Whaani umbezile na kumliga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">Whaani youmng'hanuchile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">na kumnogolela meho kwa kidaya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">Ndo yula yawele Yelile wa Isilaeli!<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Kwa kukolela vitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nakumliga ng'hatu Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nagwe nakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">“Kwa mituka ja heni minji ja kitowa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">nang'wina kuli vinhembenhembe vya vidunda, mbaka kuli vinhembenhembe vya kuchanya ng'hatu vya Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">Nandijigwisa mielezi jake jiwele ng'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">na mibeloshi jake jinojile ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">Nafika mbaka kuli vinhembenhembe vyake na vihulo vyake vinojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Nambawa mideho kuli isi za chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">na kunwa mazi gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">nang'haza nzanda zeng'ha za Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">kwa nzayo za magulu ga heni.”<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />“ ‘Ndaze, huhuliche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">Nanyamula kuwala mbuli ayi kulawa katali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">Mazuwa ga katali nandiiwika goya mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">lelo nandiidita ilawile kwa kukupa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">wa kugalula miji jiwele na ngome kuwa mahame.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Wanhu wa miji ajo nawesilwa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">nawatweguka nhumbula na kubasigwa soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">Hewo nawali kota mizuchila kuli mgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">kota misolo jilihela mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">jilinguzuka mchanya mwa chinduwiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">na kukala jing'hali kukula.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Ila ndanguvizela vyoulingikalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">vyoulingulawa na vyoulingwinjila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">na kuzudila kwa hegwe kuwala heni.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Kwa chiwalo cha kuzudila kwa hegwe kuwala heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">na kidaya kwa hegwe nakufika kuli makutu ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">ndowika ndowano ya heni kuli mhenyelo ya hegwe leka kukulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">na lijamu lya heni kuli mlomo wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">Ndokuhilusa kwa nzila yiyila yowuyile nayo.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Isaya nakalutilila kumlonjela mndewa Hesekiya, “Awu wowa ndo ulajilo kwa hegwe, gwa Hesekiya. Mwaka awu na mwaka awo ulinguya kolya chinhu chotile chiliyeka. Ila kuli mwaka wa kadatu monyala na kubeta mbena, monyala mizabibu na kulya mafuza gake. <verse eid="ISA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Wala wasigale kuli nhanzi ya Yuda wokonjezeka na kuwa wenji kota vila igodi vyolilinguwika mizabi jake kuli misanga na kulela mafuza mchanya. <verse eid="ISA 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Kwa vila kulawa Yelusalemu wokuya wasigale, ena ako kuli chidunda cha Siyoni kowa wanhu wasigale. Fihi ya Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho ndo yokweneza mbuli ayi.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />“Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino kuwala mndewa wa Ashulu, ‘Hokwinjila kuli muji awu ne kuutowa msale ne kuwuyila kwa ngawo ne kuuzunguluta. <verse eid="ISA 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Kohiluka kwa nzila yiyila yoyuyile na hokwinjila kuli muji awu. <verse eid="ISA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />Ndowamila muji awu na kuulohola, kwa chiwalo cha nene baha na kwa chiwalo cha Daudi, chitumagwa wa heni.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Lelo, mhela wa nechilo mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakaluta kuli kambi ya Ashulu na kuwakopola wanhu lachi imwe na elufu makumi nane na wahano (185,000). Wayawo lowenuche hamitondo, nawajifika mitufi chila honhu. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Lelo Senakelibu, mndewa wa Ashulu, nakabena kambi na kuka. Nakahiluka Ninawi na kikala ako. <verse eid="ISA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Zuwa limwe Senakelibu loyawele yomfugamila mlungu wa heye Nisiloki, wana wa heye wawele ndo Adilameleki na Shaleseli, nawamkopola kwa ipanga, hamba nawabilimila kuli isi ya Alalati, naye Esalihadoni, mwanage, nakawa mndewa honhu ha heye.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Kutamika na kusilwa utamwa kwa Mndewa Hesekiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2 Wandewa 20:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2 Mihela 32:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Kuli mazuwa ago, Hesekiya nakatamika ng'hatu mbaka nayali habehi kubagama. Mloli Isaya, mwana wa Amosi, nakaluta kwa heye na kumlonjela, “Ahi ndo vyoyalingulonga Mkulu Nguluwi, ‘Uwiche goya mbuli za hegwe kuli ng'handa ya hegwe, kwa vila kobagama.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Hesekiya nakagalamchila ubanzi wa kuli lukanzi, nakamlanda Mkulu Nguluwi, yolonga, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />“Dedede, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ukumbuchile vyondikukolele mijito kwa kukundigwa na kwa nhumbula ya heni yeng'ha na kudita ganojile hali hegwe.” Hesekiya nakalila kwa usungu ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Hamba ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi naumuyila Isaya, naulonga, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />“Uhiluche ukamlonjele Hesekiya, ‘Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa sekulu wa hegwe Daudi, nanyhulika kulanda kwa hegwe na kugona mahozi ga hegwe. Lelo ndokonjezela miyaka kumi na jihano kuli kikala kwa hegwe. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Ndokulohola hegwe hamwe na muji awu, kulawa mmoko mwa mndewa wa Ashulu na kuwamila muji awu.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Hamba Isaya nakamlonjela Hesekiya, “Awu ndo ulajilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi kwa hegwe kota Mkulu Nguluwi kodita chila choyalagane. <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Kuli ngazi ziwele nazizenjigwa na mndewa Ahasi, Mkulu Nguluwi koludita lubehelo luhiluche kumbele magulu kumi.” Ahyo lubehelo naluhiluka kumbele magulu kumi. <verse eid="ISA 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Hamba Hesekiya mndewa wa Yuda loyaponile utamwa wa heye, nakandika lwimbo alu lwa malumbo,<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Nandijesa kota kulutilila goya kuli ukomu wa kikala kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">ndaze, nanganigwa kukola kuli lwizi lwa kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">na kusukuligwa ukomu wa heni usigale?<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Nandonga kota siweza kumona kahi Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">kuli isi ya wawele wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">ne siweza kumona munhu yoneche kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">hali wenyeng'haye wa kuli isi.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Kota ihema lya yalingudima migongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">ng'handa ya heni naibomoligwa na kuholigwa kulawa kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Nandiubinabina ukomu wa heni, kota yalingutawa nguwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">naye nakandumula na kunhaga kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Nguluwi nakaudumya ukomu wa heni nemisi na nechilo.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Nechilo yeng'ha nandali ndilila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">kota isimba, nakabenanga mizeje ja heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">Nandijesa kota Nguluwi nakaudita ukomu wa heni umale.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Nandali ndilila kota chideje chilinguchemigwa mbayuwayu ama kolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">nang'ung'uta kota ng'hunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">Meho ga heni nagabilabila kwa kulola kuchanya kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndangugazika, uye unhanze!<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Ila ndonje choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">Mkulu Nguluwi nakagadita aga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">Lelo, ndojenda kwa kunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">kuli ukomu wa heni weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">kwa chiwalo cha awu usungu ung'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">kuli nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wanhu wangikala kwa kiwhana na geng'ha gouditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">nayo nhumbula ya heni yangupataga ukomu kuli mbuli azo kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">Nakundohola na kundita ndikale.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Namhata magazo gang'hang'hale kwa chiwalo cha mzidi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">ila nakuulohola ukomu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">kulawa kuli ikulubila lya kuwifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">kwa vila nakugataga gehile ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">kumbele kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Kwa vila kuli isi ya wabagame hakuweza kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">yabagame halinguweza kwimba lutogo lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">ne wala walingudulika kuli chilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">hawalingitumbila kuli kukundigwa kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Wawele wakomu ndo walingukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">kota vyondilingudita lehano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">Wahaza wanguwalonjelaga wana wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">mbuli za kugoloka kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Mkulu Nguluwi kondohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">natwe tomtogola kwa nzimbo na ving'hweleng'hwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">mazuwa geng'ha ga ukomu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Isaya nayali yalonjile, “Mgongomanye mikwandi ja tini, hamba mjiwiche kuli lipu, naye kopona.”<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hesekiya nayali yauzile, “Kowa na ulajilo wachi kota ndoluta kuli ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa Babuloni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2 Wandewa 20:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Mhela awo Melodaki-baladani, mwana wa Baladani, mndewa wa Babuloni, nakalajiza baluwa na ndolendole vihilikwe kwa Hesekiya, kwa vila nakahulika kota nayali yotamika, ila lelo nakapona. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Lelo Hesekiya nakawabochela kwa kusangalala wala wasenga na kuwalajila vinhu vyeng'ha viwele kuli ng'hano za heye, viwele ndo sendi na zahabu na vifunyhizi na mafuta ganojile na ng'hano ya vinhu vya kitowa ngondo na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele kuli ng'hano za heye. Hakuwele na chinhu choneche chiwele kuli ng'handa yake ya chiundewa ama kuli undewa wake weng'ha chiwele Hesekiya nayali hawalajile. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Hamba mloli Isaya nakaluta kwa mndewa Hesekiya na kumuuza, “Wanhu awa nawalonga choni na wangulawa kohi?” Hesekiya nakamwidichila, “Nawoya kwa heni kulawa isi ya kutali. Nawalawa Babuloni.”<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Mloli nakauza, “Nawona choni kuli ng'handa ya hegwe?” Hesekiya nakedichila, “Nawona chila chinhu kuli ng'handa ya heni. Haduhu ne chinhu chiwele kuli ng'hano za heni chiwele siwalajile.”<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Isaya nakamlonjela Hesekiya, “Uhulichize ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho. <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Ulole, mazuwa ganguya, vinhu vyeng'ha viwele kuli ng'handa ya hegwe ya chiundewa na vinhu vyeng'ha viwele wasekulu wa hegwe nawaviwika mbaka mhela awu, vyohilikwa Babuloni. Haduhu ne chinhu chosigala. Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Wamwe wa walelwa wa hegwe, kulawa kuli lukuli lwa hegwe, wawele wopondigwa hamba, wohilikwa kutali na kubasigwa soni kwa kuwa vitumagwa kuli ng'handa ya mndewa wa Babuloni.”<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hesekiya nakamwidichila Isaya, “Ulonzi wa Mkulu Nguluwi woulonjile unoga.” Nakelonjela mnhumbula kwa vila nayali yochijesa, “Ndowa na kikala goya na kwamilwa kuli mazuwa geng'ha ga kikala kwa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Nguluwi wangukangazwa nhumbula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Nguluwi wa hemwe kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">“Muwakangaze nhumbula wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">muwahembulize.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Mlonje na wenyeng'haye wa Yelusalemu kwa uliholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">muwalonjele kota magazo ga hewo nagamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">nawalechelwa wihe wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">Mkulu Nguluwi nakawagaza ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">kwa chiwalo cha gehile geng'ha ga hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Lizi lya munhu lyanguchemeleza kulawa kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">“Muiwiche goya nzila ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">mgongomanye nzila ng'hulu kuchiwala kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi wa hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Chila ibindi lyotiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">chila chidunda choselegwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">vigongo vyowa ibalalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">honhu hawele vibi hoditigwa hawe goya.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Hamba ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi wogubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">wanhu weng'ha wowona kwa mhela umwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">Mkulu Nguluwi nakalonga ago.”<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Lizi lyangulonga, “Uwikule usenga!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">Nani nambuza, “Ndiwikule usenga wachi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">Naye nakalonga, “Uwikule usenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">kwa kulonga kota wanhu weng'ha ndo kota misolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">kota uluwa wa kisolo uwele wangikala kwa mhela uchefu.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Misolo janguswinha na uluwa wanguswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">mhela uwele mbeho ya ivuche kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi yanguputa mchanya mwa vinhu avyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">Ndikomya, wanhu ndo kota misolo.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Misolo janguswinha na uluwa lwanguswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:8">ila ulonzi wa Nguluwi wa hetwe wangikala mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Hegwe ulingigala mbuli inojile Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ulute mchanya mwa chidunda chiwele ng'wemang'wema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Hegwe ulingigala mbuli inojile Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ulandule lizi lya hegwe kwa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">ulandule lizi, uleche kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">jilonjele miji ja Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">“Nguluwi wa hemwe ka hano.”<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi kanguya na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">kwa moko wa heye uwele na mong'ho kangusumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">Kanguwegalaga wanhu kota ndolendole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">wawele nawagomboligwa wangumlongola.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Kochidima chilundo cha heye, kota mdimi wa migongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">kojikungajiza ming'holo myana kuli moko ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">na kujiwika kuli mhambaga ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">kojilongoza mholemhole jila jilingonyeza.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haduhu cha kuwhanizwa na Nguluwi wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Whaani yalinguweza kupima mazi ga bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">kwa chiganza cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">ama kupima ulanga kwa moko wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Whaani yalinguweza kuwika misanga jeng'ha ja isi kuli chizombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">ama kuvipima vidunda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">na vigongo kuli chipimilo cha mizani?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Whaani yalingugazela majesa ga Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:13">ama kumlangusa?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakagana kulanguswa ama kutanzigwa na whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Whaani yamlanguse nzila itanganiche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Whaani yamlanguse kuwa na kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">ama kumlajila vyoilinguganigwa kuwa na nyhala?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Kwa heye wanhu wa isi ndo kota idovu lya mazi kuli ndoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">ndo kota nhimbwisi mchanya mwa mzani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">Kwa heye vihilwa ndo kota nhimbwisi.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Ngodi zeng'ha za Lebanoni na migongolo jake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:16">jeng'ha haviweza kuhega kwa nhambiko ya kulakazwa hali heye.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Wanhu wa isi zeng'ha, hawawele chinhu hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:17">kwa heye ndo wa hihi hela, hawalingutanza chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Momuwhaniza Nguluwi na choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:18">ama na chinhu chachi?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Ndaze, kangiwhana na limalukolo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">Alyo, munhu kangulihongolaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">yalinguponda zahabu kangulibakalizaga zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">na kuligongomanyila migasi ja sendi!<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Munhu yawele mzunwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">yohambe yaweze kulavya nhambiko kota ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">kanguhagulaga igodi lyohambe lyole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">Kangumpalaga yalinguhongola vinhu yazidahe ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">leka yamhongolele limalukolo liwele nzinzili!<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Ndaze, hemwe mng'hali kuvizela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Ndaze, hamhuliche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Ndaze, hamlonjelwe kulawa mwaluko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Ndaze, hamvizele kulawa mwaluko wa isi?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yekalise mchanya mwa duala ya isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">na wanhu walingikala mgati mwake ndo wadodo kota nzije.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">Kangwanzanza ulanga kota ipaziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">na kuugolola kota ihema lya kikala.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Yuye kanguwadulisaga wakulu wawele na mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:23">vilongozi wa isi kanguwaditaga kuwa walihela utanzi.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Hala du howonyaligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">hala du howotiligwa kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">hala howowika mizabi ja hewo kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">ndo Mkulu Nguluwi hoyowaputila, nawo woswinha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">nacho chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">chowawembelusa kota mhumba.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Nguluwi Yelile kanguuza hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">“Mowhaniza heni na whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">Ndaze, hana munhu yawele kota heni?”<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Mwinule meho ga hemwe, mlole kilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Whaani yalumbile avi vyeng'ha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Ndo heye yalinguchigala kunze chilundo cha nhondwe imwe mbaka iyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">na kuzichema chila imwe na itagwa lyake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Kwa chiwalo cha ludali lwake lukulu na mong'ho wake ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">haduhu ne imwe ilinguwa haduhu.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">lekachoni mwangung'ung'uta na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">“Mkulu Nguluwi hambe yatutanze!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">Nguluwi wa hetwe halingijesa kuwala hachi za hetwe!”<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Ndaze, hemwe mng'hali kuvizela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Ndaze, hamhuliche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi wa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">heye ndo yalumbile chila chinhu muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Halingutoka ne kuwa ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">haduhu ne yumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">yawele yoweza kupugajiza kuvizela kwa heye.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Heye kanguwapaga ludali wala watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:29">ng'hochele kanguwapaga mong'ho.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Mbaka wasongolo wangutokaga na kutweguka nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:30">ena, wangikwang'hwala na kugwa,<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />ila weng'ha walingitumbila kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">wopata mong'ho unyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">Woguluka kwa mabawa kota ikungule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">wobilima ne kutoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">wojenda ne kutweguka nhumbula.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangulagana kota koitanza Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">“Hemwe mlingikala mhwani mnyamalile mnyhulichize!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Hemwe wanhu wa isi muwe na mong'ho kahi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Milajile, mlongase na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">tuting'hane hamwe honhu ha utaguso.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />Whaani yawele nakamhagula mndewa yumwe kulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">munhu yawele kangusumya honeche hoyoluta?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Nguluwi kanguwawikaga wanhu wa isi na wandewa kuli moko ga heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Kwa ipanga lya heye kanguwatemanga wawe kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">kwa ipinde lya heye kanguwasambalulaga kota mhumba.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Heye kanguwawinzaga na kulutilila ne kulumizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:3">kangulutaga himahima kota magulu ga heye hagalingudoliza hanyi.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Whaani yaiditile mbuli ayi na kweneza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">Whaani yawichile mhela wa chila chilingulawila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndo nditile ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">heni ndo wa mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">na wa kuduma.<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />“Walingikala mhwani nawagona gonditile, nawadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">isi yeng'ha yangukakama kwa lunhwinhwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">Wanhu weng'ha nawekungajiza na kuya.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Chila yumwe kangumtanzaga myage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:6">na kumlonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:6">‘Gwa, wikangaze nhumbula!’<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Yalinguponda chuma kangumkangazaga nhumbula yalinguponda zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">naye yalingulihonda limalukolo kwa nyundo, kangumkangazaga nhumbula yalingulilumba kwa msumali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">weng'ha wangulongaga, ‘Ndo mijito jinojile ng'hatu!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">Hamba wangulitowelela kwa misumali leka lileche kutigasika.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />“Mhulichize hemwe Waisilaeli, vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo wondiwahagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">hemwe walelwa wa Abulahamu goloko wa heni,<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />hemwe wondiwahagule kulawa kuli kuduma kwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">hemwe wondiwalonjele, ‘Hemwe mwa vitumagwa wa heni,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">siwatajile, ila nandiwahagula.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Lelo, mleche kudumba, kwa vila nda hamwe na hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Mleche kukabuswa, kwa vila heni nda Nguluwi wa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Ndowadita muwe nzinzili na kuwatanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">ndowamila na moko wa heni utanganiche.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />“Ena! Weng'ha wawele na ng'halazi kuwala hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">wobasigwa soni na kudeuzwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">Weng'ha walingitwanza na hemwe wodumigwa.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Hanga mowapala wang'honyo wa hemwe, hamuwona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">wala walingitwanza na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">hawowa chinhu kwa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Kwa vila heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">heni ndo ndilingibata moko ga hemwe ga kudilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">na kuwalonjela, ‘Mleche kudumba, ndowatanza.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">“Hemwe wanhu wa Yakobo, mwa ng'hochele kota linhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">hemwe Waisilaeli, mleche kudumba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga kota ndowatanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Heni nda mgombozi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Yelile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Ndowadita muwe kota chinhu cha kupululila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">chiwele na mizino minji jinyale na jing'hang'hale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">Movipulula vidunda na kuvihondanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">vigongo movibalasa viwe kota mhumba.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Movibeta, mbeho yoviwembelusila kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">Namwe mosangalala kwa chiwalo cha heni, Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">mowona ukulu kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">Nguluwi Yelile wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />“Wazunwa na walihela chinhu wangupala mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">ila ga haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">myango za hewo nazikala kwa ng'halu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Ila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndowedichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">heni Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, siwaleka.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Ndozidita nzanda zilavye mazi kulawa mchanya mwa vidunda vikalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">na kuli nzasa za kuli mibindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">Ndokugalula kugunuche kuwe ilamba lya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">isi ng'havu kuwa nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Ndonyala migodi ako kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">migodi ja mielezi na mihadasi na mizeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">kahi ndowika migodi ja mibeloshi na misonobali,<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />leka wanhu wayone mbuli ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">nawo wovizela kota</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandiidita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">heni Yelile wa Isilaeli nandiidita mbuli ayo.”<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangujibeza milungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Mkulu Nguluwi, mndewa wa Isilaeli kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">“Hemwe milungu ja wanhu wa isi migale ulonjelezi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">mlonje utawizo wa hemwe!<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Migale jimalukolo ja hemwe leka jitulonjele chiwele cholawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">mtulonjele mbuli za katali nazali ndaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">leka tijese na kuvizela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Ama muwikule mbuli zilinguya,<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />mtulonjele chiwele cholawila hamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">natwe tuvizele kota hemwe ndo milungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">Mdite chinhu choneche, chinojile ama chihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">leka tukabuswe na kudumba.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Ndikomya ng'hatu, hemwe hamuwele chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">hamlinguweza kudita chinhu choneche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">Yalinguhagula kufugama hali hemwe ka izudizo ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />“Nandimhagula munhu kulawa kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">ena, nandimhagula yumwe yawele kokuya Isilaeli kulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">naye kolichema itagwa lya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">Heye kowabiga wandewa kota nhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">kota yalingulumba vinhu vya ilongo vyoyalinguhonda ilongo.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Whaani yalonjile aga kulawa mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">leka hetwe tuvizele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Whaani yalongole kugawikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">leka lelo tulonje nakulonga kukomya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Haduhu ne yumwe wa hemwe yagalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">ne haduhu yawele nakahulika ulonzi wa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Nandali wa mwaluko kukulonjela Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">‘Ulole, wa hano!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">Nandimha Yelusalemu msenga wa mbuli inojile.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Nandola goya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">ila silingumona yoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">haduhu yoneche hali milungu yalinguweza kutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">hondiuza haduhu yalinguweza kunyidichila.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Ulole, milungu ajo jeng'ha ndo uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">hajilinguweza kudita choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">jimalukolo jawo ja kuponda ndo upoka.”<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">“Mumlole chitumagwa wa heni yondilingumuwika nzinzili, yondimhagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">yawele nanojezwa na heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">Nandiuwika muhe wa heni mchanya mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">naye kowegalila hachi wanhu wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Hochemeleza ne kutowa iyowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:2">ama kulandula lizi mbalabala.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Idenje likubuche holibena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">na utambi ulingufung'ha iyosi houzimya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">koigala hachi kwa kukundigwa.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Heye hokwisilwa mong'ho ne kutweguka nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">mbaka hoyoidita hachi iwe nzinzili muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">Wanhu wa mhwani wangubeteza malanguso ga heye.”<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Nguluwi, Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">yawele nakaulumba ulanga na kuutandazula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">Heye nakailumba isi na vyeng'ha viwele amo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">Nakawapa lweselo wanhu weng'ha wawele amo na kuwadita wekale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">Ndo heye yumwe yawele kangulonga na chitumagwa wa heye,<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />“Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, nandikuchema leka udite hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">nandikubata moko na kukwamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">Kwa kukolela hegwe ndodita ilagano na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">na kigala lumuli kwa wanhu wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />Hegwe kogagubula meho ga walingulemwela kona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">kowalavya wanweng'hwa mchinweng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">na kuwadita welejehe wawele kuli jiza lya mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />Itagwa lya heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">Simha yunji ukulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">ne lutogo lwa heni kwa jimalukolo ja milungu.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Ulole, mbuli zondonjile hamwande nazilawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">lelo ndanguwikula mbuli zinyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">ndangukulonjela aga kung'hali haganalawila.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa kumtogola Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Mumwimbile Mkulu Nguluwi lwimbo lunyale!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">Isi yeng'ha yimbe lutogo lwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">Wanhu weng'ha walingukola mijito kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">na vilumbigwe vyeng'ha viwele kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">hemwe mhwani na wenyeng'haye wake, mwimbe!<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Kuchiwala na miji jake jeng'ha jikwinize lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">wanhu wa Kedali watowe luchenze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">Wanhu wa Sela wembe kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">na walandule lizi kulawa mchanya mwa vidunda.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Weng'ha walingikala mhwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:12">wamtogole na kumha ukulu Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Mkulu Nguluwi koluta kuli ngondo kota yazidahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">kota mwamizi yawele na maya ga kitowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">Kangutowa iyowe lya ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">kangilajila kota kana mong'ho hali wang'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangunuwila kuwatanza wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">“Kwa mhela winji nanyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">nasindamala na kilemeza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">Ila lelo ndolila kota mamo yalinguponda.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Ndoviwifya vidunda na vigongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">misolo jeng'ha ndojidita jikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">Nzanda ndozigalula kuwa isi ng'havu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">na milamba ndojikaza.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Ndowalongoza wohambe walole kuli nzila yohawaizelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">kuli nzila ziwele hawanawahika kukola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">Ndoligalula jiza liwe lumuli hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">honhu hehile kuwa hanojile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">Azi ndo mbuli ziwele ndozidita, siwaleka.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Weng'ha walingitumbila kuli jimalukolo ja milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">na kujilonjela, ‘Hemwe ndo milungu ja hetwe,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">wokona soni na kudeula.”<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli nawalemwela kuhulichiza</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />“Muhulichize hemwe mohambe mhuliche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:18">Mlole, hemwe mohambe mlole, leka mone!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Whaani yawele yohambe yalole kota chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">na yohambe yahuliche kota msenga yondilingumlajiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Whaani yawele yohambe yalole kota ayu yondimuwichile chiuyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">ama yohambe yalole kota chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Hemwe namona mbuli nyinji, ila hamlinguvizela choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">makutu ga hemwe ga mwanzi, ila hamlinguhulika chinhu!”<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Naimnojeza Mkulu Nguluwi, kwa chiwalo cha hachi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:21">kugadita malajizo ga heye gahulichizwe kwa ukulu.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Ila wano ndo wanhu wahizilwe lufufu kwa kubokwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">weng'ha nawagwilizwa kuli mikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">na kuvisigwa mchinweng'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">Nawawa kota upelembi ne munhu wa kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">nawawa wanhu waholigwe kuli ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">haduhu yalingulonga, “Waloholigwe!”<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Whaani hali hemwe yawele kolihulichiza ali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:23">Whaani yawele goya na kuhulichiza kulawila sambi?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Whaani yawawichile Waisilaeli kuli moko ga wang'honyo awo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Whaani yawele nakalechela wasukuligwe lufufu lwa hewo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Ndo Mkulu Nguluwi yawele natumditila gehile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Wasekulu wa hetwe nawalema kuwinza nzila za heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">ne kubatilila malajizo ga heye.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Ahyo nakawaboholela ng'halazi ya heye ing'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">nakawaleka wating'hane na ngondo ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">Ng'halazi ya heye naiwafika chila ubanzi kota chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">ila hawavizelele choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">milapi ja chiluli najiwalakaza, ila hawagawichile mnhumbula.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangulagana kuwalohola wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi yawele nakawalumba hemwe wanhu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">heye yawaditile hemwe wanhu wa Isilaeli, kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">“Mleche kudumba, kwa vila nandiwagombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">nandiwachema hemwe kwa matagwa ga hemwe, namwe ndo wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Homkola kuli mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">ndowa hamwe na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">homkola kuli nzanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">haziwasumya kwa mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">Homjenda kuli chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">hamlakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">milapi ja chiluli hajiwadumya.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Kwa vila heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Yelile wa Isilaeli, Mlohozi wa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Ndoilavya isi ya Misili kota fidiya ya hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">ndoilavya Kushi na Seba leka muwe milejehe.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Kwa vila hemwe mna lutogo na kuhulichizwa hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">nandiwapa uganililo na igano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">nani ndanguwaleka wanhu wanji leka ndiwe na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">ndanguwaleka wanhu wa isi zinji honhu ha kikala kwa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Mleche kudumba kwa vila nda hamwe na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">ndowegala walelwa wa hemwe kulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">ndowakungajiza hemwe kulawa kolizinjilaga isanya.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Ndoilonjela kasikazini, ‘Waleche woche,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">na kusini, ‘Uleche kuwalemeza’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">Muwahilule wana wa heni kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">kulawa chila honhu muisi,<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />chila yumwe yawele nakachemigwa kwa itagwa lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">yondimlumbile na kumdita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">kwa chiwalo cha ukulu wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli ndo walolezi wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Muwegale kumwando wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">wawele wana meho ila hawalingona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">wana makutu ila hawalinguhulika.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Wanhu weng'ha wa isi zeng'ha wekungajize hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">nhanzi zeng'ha ziting'hane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Whaani hali milungu ja hewo yalinguweza kuwikula gawele nagalawila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Whaani yalinguweza kutulajila gawele golawila sambi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Wawegale walolezi wa hewo leka kutawiza kota nawadita ahyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">leka wanji wahuliche na kulonga, “Wangukomya.”<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">“Hemwe Waisilaeli ndo walolezi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">nandiwahagula leka muwe vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">leka mnzele na kung'hunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">kota ndiliyeka ndo Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">Haduhu mlungu yawele nakawahika kuwabaho, ila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">ne haduhu yawele kochikala kwa mhela winji kusinda heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Heni ndiliyeka ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">haduhu mlohozi yunji, ila heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Nambika hazelu na kulohola na kuwikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">heni, siwele mlungu mjenzi hali hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Hemwe mwa walolezi wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Heni ndo Nguluwi na ndowa Nguluwi mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">Haduhu yalinguweza kusulupuka kulawa kuli moko wa heni uwele na mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">Hondidita, whaani yoweza kulemeza?”<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangulagana kuwagombola wanhu wa heye kulawa Babuloni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Mlohozi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Yelile wa Isilaeli, kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">“Kwa chiwalo cha hemwe ndowalajiza wamizi kuluta Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">na kuwegala hano Wababuloni kota wapogozi wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">kuli meli ziwele nawazona kota ndo lutogo kwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">ndiilumbile Isilaeli, Mndewa wa hemwe.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Mkulu Nguluwi ndo nakawika nzila kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:16">nzila hagati ha nhigu ng'hulu,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />nakawakopola wamizi wawele na mituka na falasi wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">chilundo cha wamizi na wamizi wazidahe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">Nakawagwisa, hawoweza kwinuka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">nakawadumya na kuwazimya kota utambi wa chenje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">Ayu ndo Mkulu Nguluwi yalingulonga,<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />“Mleche kukumbuchila mbuli zikolile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:18">ne kijesa kuwala mbuli za katali.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Mlole, ndodita mbuli inyale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">Yokoleka sambi baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">namwe moweza kuyona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">Ndodita nzila kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">na kuwika nzanda zilinguchililika mazi kugunuche.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Migongolo ja kisolo jonyhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">mikanhu na mituwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">kwa vila ndowika mazi kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">na nzanda kuli chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">leka kuwanweza mazi wanhu wa heni wondiwahagule,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />wanhu wondiwalumbile kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:21">leka wawikule lutogo lwa heni!”<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kanguwang'hanuchila wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />“Hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo, kukomya namnhoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">hamlingulutilila kundanda heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Hamngalile ming'holo ja hemwe kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko za kulakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">ne kunyhulichiza kwa nhambiko za hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">Siwaditile mkole mijito kwa kugana ndolendole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">ne kuwatunya kwa kugana ubani.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Hamgulile ubani woneche uwele na unhunyhililo kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">ne kumha heni kwa igano mafuta ga migongolo ja nhambiko za hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">Ila gehile ga hemwe nagawa mhomholo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">na kunhunya ng'hatu kwa nongwa za hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />Ndo nene hela ndilingusa gehile ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">kwa chiwalo cha nene baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">silingugakumbuchila kahi gehile ga hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />“Mndonjele kota mna nongwa na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">muye tiwuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">mlavye ulonjelezi wa hemwe leka mpegwe hachi ya hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Mhaza wa hemwe wa mwaluko nakadita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:27">vilongozi wa hemwe nawambelenhuka heni.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Ahyo nandiwadita watambika wa hemwe wawe wakokomoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">nandiwalavya wanhu wa Yakobo leka wadumigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">ena, nandiwaleka Waisilaeli wabezigwe.”<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi ndo Nguluwi yaliyeka</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />“Mhulichize hemwe Waisilaeli, vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">mhulichize hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo, wondiwahagule.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Heni, Mkulu Nguluwi, ndiwalumbile hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">kulawila mhela lompondigwe nandiwatanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">Mleche kudumba vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">mhaguligwe wa heni, Yeshuluni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yeshuluni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itagwa ali kwa chiebulaniya lina mana ya Yatanganiche.</char></note>.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />“Ndoiboholela mazi isi iwele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">na kulavya nzanda kuli isi ikalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">Ndowagalila muhe wa heni walelwa wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">ndowatambichiza wana wa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Wozuchila kota misolo hali nzasa za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:4">kota migodi hafungo ha nzanda.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Wamwe wa hewo wolonga, ‘Heni ndo wa Mkulu Nguluwi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">wanji wochichema kwa itagwa lya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">wanji wokwandika kuli moko ga hewo, ‘Wa Mkulu Nguluwi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">na wanji wochizelesa kwa itagwa lya ‘Isilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Mkulu Nguluwi, mndewa na mlohozi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">ena, Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">“Heni ndo wa mwaluko na kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">haduhu Nguluwi yunji ila heni.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Whaani yawele kota heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Yawikule na kulonga hazelu hali heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Whaani nakawikula aho katali kuwala mbuli ziwele zolawila hamba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Watulonjele gala gawele gang'hali kulawila.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Hemwe wanhu wa heni, mleche kudumba ne kuwa na lunhwinhwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ndaze, siwalonjele aho katali kuwala mbuli ziwele zolawila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Hemwe ndo walolezi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ndaze, hana mlungu yunji?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Haduhu italawe linji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">simzelele ne yumwe.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Upoka wa kujifugamila jimalukolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Wanhu weng'ha walingugongomanya jimalukolo ja milungu hawawele chinhu na vinhu viwele wangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha avyo havilinguwatanza chinhu. Walingufugamila milungu ajo ndo wohambe walole na ndo wapoka, ahyo wobasigwa soni! <verse eid="ISA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Mbuli ayo yangububuwaza kwa munhu kugongomanya limalukolo lya mlungu liwele halilingumtanza chinhu. <verse eid="ISA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Ndikomya, heye hamwe na wayage walingulifugamila wobasigwa soni, nawo walingugongomanya jimalukolo ajo ndo wanhu hela. Lelo weting'hane weng'ha, wokabuswa na kubasigwa soni. <verse eid="ISA 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Yalingugongomanya vinhu vya chuma kanguholaga chihande cha chuma, kangulubusaga mchiluli na kuponda limalukolo. Kanguhondaga kwa nyundo na moko ga heye gawele na mong'ho. Mhela awo heye kanguwaga na nzala na kutoka, kahi kanguwaga na ng'halu na kwisilwa na mong'ho. <verse eid="ISA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Hihyo naye yalingugongomanya vinhu vya kuhongola kangupimaga chihande cha mbawo kwa ng'weso, kanguchiwikaga ulajilo kwa kalamu ya heye, hamba kwa vinhu vya heye kanguhongolaga kwa kuliwhaniza na munhu yawele na kumeho kunojile na kuliwika limalukolo alyo lya mlungu honhu hake. <verse eid="ISA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Munhu ayo kangutemaga igodi lya mwelezi leka yatumiye ama kanguhagulaga mbeloshi ama mwaloni. Kanguulekaga ukule hali migodi ja kumhulo ama kangunyalaga msonobali na nhonya yanguuditaga ukule. <verse eid="ISA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Honhu ha igodi alyo howa kota ngodi, munhu kangotaga chiluli kwa chiwalo cha kusa chipute mlukuli na kubanika mibumunda mchanya mwake. Honhu hanji ha igodi lilyo, munhu kangigongomanyila limalukolo lya mlungu, hamba kangulifugamila. <verse eid="ISA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Hamba kanguholaga honhu ha ngodi na kuziwika mchiluli, kangubanikaga miwunde mchanya mwake, kangulyaga na kiguta. Kangotaga chiluli na kulonga, “Ena! Ndikomya namhata ivuche! Acho ndo chiluli!”<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Honhu hasigale ha igodi lilyo kangigongomanyila limalukolo lyake lya mlungu, hamba kangulifugamila na kulilanda yolonga, “Hegwe ndo Nguluwi wa heni, undohole!” <verse eid="ISA 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Wanhu awo hawavizelele chinhu choneche. Nawadinyigwa meho, hawalingona na nyhala za hewo nazidinyigwa haziweza kuvizela. <verse eid="ISA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Haduhu yalingijesa ama yawele na kuvizela na kulonga, “Nusu ya igodi ali nambwinila chiluli na kubanika mibumunda mchanya mwa makala gake na kubanika miwunde na kulya. Ndaze, honhu hasigale ndogongomanya limalukolo liwele ndo izudizo na kuchifugamila acho chihande cha igodi?” <verse eid="ISA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Hebu! Majesa ga heye nagelumba na acho chiwele ndo mivu hela! Munhu ayo nakajilila na howeza kilohola yuye na kulonga, “Ndikomya chondilingibata mmoko ndo uhadi hela!”<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi howasemwa Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">“Hemwe wanhu wa Yakobo, mzikumbuchile mbuli azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">ena, mkumbuchile hemwe Waisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Hemwe ndo vitumagwa wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Nandiwalumba leka muwe vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">mazuwa gose heni siwasemwa.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Nandizilechela nongwa za hemwe kota mbeho ilinguwembelusa ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">nandigosa gehile ga hemwe kota ikunguyosi vyolilinguka na ivuche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">Mnyhiluchile kwa vila nandiwagombola.<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />“Mwimbe kwa kusangalala hemwe ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yaliditile ali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Mtowe iyowe hemwe misisi ja isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">mwimbe kwa kusangalala hemwe vidunda!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Hemwe vihulo na migodi jeng'ha jiwele amo, mwimbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakawagombola walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">nakaulajila ukulu wa heye kuli Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Mkulu Nguluwi, mgombozi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">yawalumbile kulawa mmunda mwa wamai wa hemwe, kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">“Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi yavilumbile vinhu vyeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">Heni ndiliyeka nandiuhanzanza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">nandiilumba isi kwa mong'ho wa heni ndiliyeka.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Ndanguwifyaga ulajilo wa waloli wa udesi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">kuwawichila upoka walingulagula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">Ndangugalula uwanzi na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">na kuvidita viwe upoka,<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />ila ndanguutawizaga usenga wa chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">na kweneza uloli wa wasenga wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">Heni ndo ndilinguulonjela muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Hegwe Yelusalemu, wanhu wochikala kahi kwa hegwe,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">na miji ja Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">‘Hemwe mozenjingwa kahi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">na kuwala mahame, ‘Namwe ndowagongomanya kahi.’<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Heni ndo mbele ndigalajize mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:27">kwa kugalonjela, ‘Mkale.’<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Heni nandonga kuwala Koleshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">‘Hegwe kowadima wanhu honhu ha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">kokweneza majesa ga heni geng'ha.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">Heni nandonga kuwala Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">‘Hegwe Yelusalemu kozenjigwa unyale kahi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">na kuwala ng'handa ya Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">‘Msisi wa hegwe wowichigwa kahi.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangumhagula Koleshi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Awu ndo usenga uwele Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga kuwala Koleshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">“Hegwe ndo mndewa yondikuhagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">ndouwika nzinzili mong'ho wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">leka uwadumye wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">na kuusumya mong'ho wa wandewa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">Ndanguchumula lwizi lwa muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">na haduhu lwizi luwele lohindigwa.<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Ndokulongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">na kuselega vidunda hali hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">Ndobenanga lwizi ja shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">ndotemanga pingu za chuma.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Ndokupa ng'hano ivisigwe kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">na lufufu luwele honhu ha chinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">leka uvizele kota heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, ndilingukuchema kwa itagwa lyako.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Kwa chiwalo cha Yakobo, chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">ena, kwa chiwalo cha Waisilaeli wondiwahagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">nandikuchema kwa itagwa lya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">nandikupa itagwa lya lutogo, hanga hunzelele.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />“Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, haduhu yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">haduhu Nguluwi yunji ila heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">Ndokuwika uwe nzinzili, hanga hegwe hunzelele,<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />leka wanhu weng'ha kulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">mbaka kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">wavizele kota haduhu Nguluwi yunji ila heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, haduhu yunji.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Nandiludita lumuli na jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">ndangigalaga kikala goya na kwambuza kudumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, ndanguditaga vinhu avi vyeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Ndolajiza kusumya kulawa kilanga kota nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">isi yogubuka kwa chiwalo cha kubochela kusumya ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">na kilejeha na hachi vyozuchila kota uluwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndogadita ago galawile.”<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lukulu lwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />“Kochona munhu yalingitwanza na heni, mbele ndimlumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">heye ka kota igaye hela, nani ndo ndimgongomanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Ahyo halinguweza kumbuza kwa chiwalo cha kitwanza na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Ilongo halilinguweza kumuuza yalinguponda ilongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Lekachoni kwangungongomanya hino?.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Igaye haliweza kumlonjela, ‘Mijito ja hegwe hajenele!’<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Kochona mwana yalingumlonjela mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Lekachoni nakwambuza heni kuya kuli isi?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">Ama kumlonjela mayake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Lekachoni nakumhonda?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">Nguluwi, yailumbile Isilaeli, kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">“Ndaze, mwangujeza kumbuza kuwala mbuli zilinguya kwa wana wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">ama kundajiza kuwala mijito ja heni?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Heni ndiilumbile isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">na wanhu walingikala amo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">Moko ga heni ndo nagahanzanza ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">na wamizi weng'ha wa ulanga wa ako kwa ilajizo lya heni.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Heni ndo ndimwinule Koleshi kuli hachi ya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Ndogolola nzila za heye zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">kouzenga unyale muji wa heni wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">na kowapa kilejeha wanhu wa heni wawele kuli isi za chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">ne kugana kupegwa sendi ne ndolendole. Heni Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino na Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">“Lufufu lwa Misili na vinhu vya Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">hamwe na wanhu wa Sheba, wanhu wawele ng'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">vyokuya na kuwa vya hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">Wanhu awo wowakolela mijito kuno wawele wawopigwe minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">wofugama hali hemwe na kuwadedeza wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Tukomya, Nguluwi ka hamwe na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">haduhu yunji ila heye.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Ndikomya hegwe kwa Nguluwi wivisile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:15">Nguluwi wa Isilaeli, Nguluwi mlohozi.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Weng'ha walingugongomanya jimalukolo, wobasigwa soni na kudeuzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:16">weng'ha hamwe wodeula.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Ila wanhu wa isi ya Isilaeli woloholigwa na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:17">wopata ulohozi wa mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:17">Hawobasigwa soni ne kudeuzwa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi yaliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">heye ndo yaulumbile ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">ndo yalumbile isi na kuidita iwe nzinzili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">Hailumbile leka iwe ilihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">ila nakailumba leka vilumbigwe vya heye vikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">Lelo kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">“Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">haduhu yunji.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Silonjile kwa uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">kulawa honhu hamwenga kuli isi iwele na jiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">Siwalonjele walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">wamhale hihi hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">ulonzi wa heni ndo wa kutanganika.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />“Hemwe wanhu wa isi msigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">mikungajize hamwe muye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">Wala walingupika jimalukolo ja migodi ndo wanhu walihela nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">wala walingujilanda milungu johambe jilohole.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Mlonje hazelu na kuwikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">mlongase hamwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Whaani yalongole kulonga mbuli ayi kulawa katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">yalonjile mbuli azi kulawa katali ng'hatu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ndaze, siwele heni Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Haduhu Nguluwi yunji, ila heni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Heni ndo Nguluwi wa hachi na mlohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">haduhu yunji, ila heni.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />Mngalamchile leka mloholigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">honeche muwele muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">kwa vila heni ndo Nguluwi, haduhu yunji.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Nandilaha kwa nhumbula ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">mlomo wa heni naulonga kwa kugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">ulonzi uwele hauweza kugaluka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">Chila munhu kofugama hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">kwa heni chila umyango wolaha.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Wolonga kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">‘Hachi na mong'ho vya kwa Mkulu Nguluwi yaliyeka.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">Weng'ha wawele nawamzudila Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">womuyila heye na kudeula.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Ila hali Mkulu Nguluwi walelwa weng'ha wa Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:25">wopata hachi, wosangalala.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Milungu ja Babuloni hajilingutanza chinhu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beli nakagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Nebo nakaduliswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">jimalukolo ja milungu ajo jilingupapigwa na migongolo ja mhomolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Milungu ajo jomlingujihola na kuluta najo chila honhu, ndo itunyo ikulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">itunyo kwa watochile.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Milungu ajo jogwa hamwe na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">hajiweza kuwalohola wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">mweng'ha mohilikwa kuli upogozi.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">“Muhulichize hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">hemwe wanhu wa heni, Waisilaeli msigale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">Nandiwalolela kulawa mhela lompondigwe.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Heni ndo Nguluwi wa hemwe na ndowalolela hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">mbaka kuli usekulu wa hemwe, mnvili za hemwe hoziwa na mbuliza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">Nandiwalumba ahyo mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">ndowapapa ahyo kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">Ndowatanza hemwe na kuwalohola.”<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />“Mowhaniza heni na whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:5">Ndaze, kabaho yawele nakewhana na heni?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Wanhu wangulavyaga zahabu kulawa kuli vihako vya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">na kupima sendi kuli mizani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">Hamba wangumhaga mijito yalinguponda zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">leka yagongomanye limalukolo lya mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">Hamba wangulifugamila limalukolo alyo.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Wangulipikaga limalukolo alyo mmayega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">hamba wanguliwikaga honhu hake, lyangikalaga baho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">Halilinguweza kuhejela kulawa honhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">hanga wanhu wangulilililaga, halilinguwedichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">haliweza kumlohola munhu kuli magazo ga heye.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />“Muikumbuchile mbuli ayi na kijesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:8">muiwiche kuli vitwi vya hemwe, hemwe mlingubelenhuka.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Mzikumbuchile mbuli zonditile aho katali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">Heni ndo Nguluwi, haduhu yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">ena, heni ndo Nguluwi, haduhu yunji kota heni.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Nandiwikula mbuli za kuduma kulawa mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">kulawa katali nandiwikula mbuli ziwele zolawila hamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">Majesa ga heni gokwenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">heni ndokweneza kunuwila kwa heni kweng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Ndangulichema ikungule lya heni kulawa kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">ena, munhu yalingweneza kunuwila kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">Nandonga na ndogadita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">lila londilingijesa ndo ndolidita.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />“Mnyhulichize hemwe muwele na nhumbula zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:12">hemwe muwele kutali na hachi.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Ndanguiwika habehi hachi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">na ulohozi wa heni haukawila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">Ndoulohola muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">kwa chiwalo cha Isilaeli, ukulu wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">Utaguso ulinguwala Babuloni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">“Gwa Babuloni, uduliche kulawa kuli chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">wikalise hasi kuli nhimbwisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">Hegwe nawali kota yohanating'hana na mlume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">muji uwele haunawahika kusumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">ila sambi hauchemigwa kahi udedemche ama unojile.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Uhole maganga ga kubalasa, ubalase nyhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">uvule shela ya hegwe na mivalo ja hegwe ja chiundewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">kota kwangiwika goya kuloka nzanda kwa magulu.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Wanhu wowona umwanzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">ena, woyona soni ya hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">Ndohilula chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">simonela isungu yoneche.”<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Mgombozi wa hetwe ndo Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:4">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, ndo itagwa lya heye.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">“Gwa Babuloni, wikalise kuli jiza na winyamalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">kwa vila wanhu hawolonga kahi kota hegwe ndo mndewa wa chidala uwele kolongoza hali undewa wunji.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Nandiwazudila wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">na kuubasa soni uhalizi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">Nandiwawika mmoko mwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">nagwe huwonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">mbaka nakuwadwika wasekulu itunyo ikulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Nakilonjela mnhumbula, ‘Ndolutilila kuwa mndewa wa chidala mazuwa gose.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">Ila hawijesile mbuli azi zilingulawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">ne chila chiwele cholawila hamba.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />“Ahyo lelo, uhuliche gwa ulinguhulichiza maya geng'ha ga lukuli lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">hegwe ulingijesa kota kuna kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">na kilonjela, ‘Ndo heni ndiliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">haduhu yunji ila heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">Mazuwa gose siweza kufililwa na mlume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">ne wana wa heni.’<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Aga geng'ha meli gokufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">baho du kuli zuwa limwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">Kofililwa wana wa hegwe na kofililwa na mlume wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">hanga kwa mhawi ng'hatu na kwangulagula lukami.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />“Nakijesa kota kwa kuli kikala goya kuli wihe wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">nakilonjela, ‘Haduhu munhu yalingumbona.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Luhala na uwanzi wa hegwe navikwajiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">nakilonjela mnhumbula ya hegwe, ‘Ndo heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">haduhu yunji yanojile kusinda heni.’<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Ila kubagama kokufika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">kuwele hauweza kiwika kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">Mbuli zihile zokufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">ziwele hauweza kitwanza nazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">kudumigwa kukulu kokufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">kuwele hauweza kulagula.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Lelo ulutilile na ulaguzi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">na winji wa uhawi wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">Hegwe nakunuwila ago kulawila kuli usongolo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">hanji kokweneza gounuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">ama hanji kokwambuza lunhwinhwi kwa wanhu.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Utanzi weng'ha wouubochele, naukutunya hihi hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">Walingulola nhondwe wa hegwe woye kumwando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">wala walingulola goya nhondwe na kulavya uloli kuli chila mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">wawalohole hemwe kulawa kwa lilinguya mchanya mwa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />“Ukumbuchile, hewo ndo kota mibeleje jikalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">chiluli chowalakaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Hawalinguweza kilohola hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">kulawa kuli chiluli acho ching'hang'hale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Chiluli acho hachiwele kwa chiwalo cha kulavya chipute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">hachiwele chiluli cha kotela.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Ndo vyowowa awo ulinguwatumbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">awo uwele nakitunya kwa chiwalo cha hewo kulawila usongolo wa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">Wolubaluba chila yumwe na nzila ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">haduhu ne yumwe yawele koweza kukulohola.”<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Kugagadala kwa Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">“Mhulichize hemwe walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">hemwe mlinguchemigwa kwa itagwa lya Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mlingulawa kuli nhanzi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mlingilaha kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">mlingumlanda Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">ila haiwele kwa kukomya ne hachi.<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />Hemwe mwangichema wanhu wa muji welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">na kitumbila kwa Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho ndo itagwa lya heye.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Kulawa katali nandavya uloli kuwala mbuli za mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">mlomo wa heni nauwikula na kugadita gazeleche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:3">baho du nanyaluka kugadita na nagalawila.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Ila nandiwazela vyomuwele mgagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">vitwi vya hemwe navigagadala kota chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:4">vihanga vya hemwe navyali kota iganga.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Ahyo, nandiwalonjela mbuli azi kulawila katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">zing'hali kulawila nandiziwikula kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">leka mleche kulonga, ‘Jimalukolo ja hetwe najidita ago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">jimalukolo ja hetwe ja kuhongola na ja chuma najidita.’<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />“Hemwe namzihulika na sambi mwanguzona zeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Lekachoni hamlinguzikunda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">Kulawa sambi na kulutilila, ndowazelesa mbuli zinyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">mbuli zivisigwe ziwele hamzizelele.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Kuli mhela awu hela ndo ndanguzidita mbuli azo zilawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">hamnawahika kuzihulika kung'hali zuwa lya lehano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">ahyo hamuweza kulonga, ‘Ena, natugazela ago.’<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Hamnawahika kuzihulika ne kuzizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">kulawa katali makutu ga hemwe hagazihuliche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Nandivizela kota hemwe mwa wahadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">kota mwa mlingubelenhuka kulawila lompondigwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">ndanguidita ng'halazi ya heni isindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">kwa chiwalo cha lutogo lwa heni, nandiilemeza leka ileche kuwafika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">leka ndeche kuwadumya.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Ulole, nandiweliza hanga haiwele kota sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">nandiwajeza kuli itanulu lya magazo.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Ndangudita ahyo kwa chiwalo cha nene baha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">lekachoni itagwa lya heni libezigwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">Ukulu wa heni siweza kumha yunji.”<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koleshi ndo yahaguligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">“Mnyhulichize hemwe Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">wanhu muwele nandiwachema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">Heni ndo Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">ndo wa mwaluko na wa kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">heni ndo Nguluwi ndiliyeka!<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Kwa moko ga heni nandijiwika misisi ja isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">na kuhanzanza ulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">Hondivichema ulanga na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">vyangwima himahima hali heni.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />“Mikungajize hemwe mweng'ha leka mhulichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Whaani hali limalukolo lya hemwe liwele nalilavya uloli kuwala vinhu avi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangumgana Koleshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">heye kokweneza kunuwila kwa heni kuwala Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">ena kowatowa Wababuloni.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Heni, ena, heni nandonga na kumchema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:15">nandimigala naye kolyeneza lila lyondimlajize.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />“Muye habehi na heni mhulichize mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">‘Kulawa mwaluko silonjile kwa uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">kulawila mbuli azo vyozaluche kukoleka nandali aho.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Lelo Mkulu Nguluwi nakandajiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">kwa muhe wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majesa ga Nguluwi kwa wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">Mgombozi wa hemwe, kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">“Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">ndilinguwalangusa kwa chiwalo cha mzidi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">ndilinguwalongoza kuli nzila yomlinguganigwa kukola.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Wone mwahawinzile goya mizilo ja heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">kutambichizwa kwa hemwe kulutilile kota lwanda luli kuchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">hachi ya hemwe kota nhigu za bahali zilingulawila chila mhela.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Walelwa wa hemwe wahawele wenji kota sangalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">wana wa hemwe kota vihande vya sangalaza vyohambe viwaziche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">itagwa lya hemwe lyahasigale hali heni mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Lelo muche Babuloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">mbilime kulawa kwa Wababuloni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Muiwikule mbuli ayi kwa lizi lya kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">mweneze mbuli za heye kuli chila honhu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Mlonje, “Mkulu Nguluwi nakawagombola wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">walelwa wa Yakobo.”<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Loyawalongoze kugunuche hawawele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">nakalavya mazi kulawa kuli italawe kwa chiwalo cha hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">nakalitula italawe mazi nagalawa.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:22">“Wanhu wehile siwapa kikala goya.”<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Mnyhulichize hemwe isi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">muwiche goya ikutu hemwe wanhu wa isi za kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Mkulu Nguluwi nakanyhema lombele nding'hali kupondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">nakalichema itagwa lya heni lombele kuli munda wa mayangu.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Nakaupa kung'hang'hala ulonzi wa heni kota ipanga linoleche ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">nakavisa heni kuli lubehelo lwa moko wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">nakandita ndiwe kota misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">nakavisa heni kuli podo lya heye.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Nakandonjela, “Kowakolela mijito wanhu wa heni Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:3">na kowambuza wanhu wonhogole.”<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Ila nandonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">“Nang'hola mijito ja hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">mong'ho wa heni naukoleka ne kupata chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">Ila Mkulu Nguluwi komha heni hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">chonolo cha mijito ja heni cha ako kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakanyhema kulawa mmunda mwa mayangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">leka ndiwe chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">ndiwahilule walelwa wa Yakobo kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">ndiwakungajize walelwa wa Isilaeli kwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha heni lutogo hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Nguluwi wa heni nakawa mong'ho wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />Heye kangulonga, “Ndo mbuli ndodo ng'hatu kwa hegwe kuwa chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">uyinule nhanzi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">na kuwahilula wala Waisilaeli wasigale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">Ndokudita uwe lumuli lwa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">uwegalile ulohozi wanhu wa heni weng'ha muisi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Mkulu Nguluwi, mgombozi na Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kangumlonjela yula yalingubezigwa ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">yula yalinguzudilwa na wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">na yawele chitumagwa wa vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">“Wandewa wokona hegwe na kwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">ena, wakulu wofugama hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kwa chiwalo cha heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndilingutumbilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kwa vila heni nda Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">yondikuhagule hegwe.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzenjigwa kahi kwa muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">“Kuli mhela wa heni unojile nandikwidichila kulanda kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">nandikutanza kuli mhela wa ulohozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">Ndokupa ilagano lya heni kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">leka kuiwika goya isi ya Isilaeli iwifigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">na kuwapa wanhu isi ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">na kuwagawila uhalizi,<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />kuwalonjela wanweng'hwa, ‘Mlawe amo mchinweng'ho,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">na wala wawele kuli jiza, ‘Muye kuli lumuli.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">Chila honhu howoluta wopata chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">mbaka kuli vidunda vilihela chinhu wopata honhu ha kulya.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Hawokona nzala kahi ne ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">ne mbeho ya kugunuche ama isanya kuwalakaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">Heni ndilinguwonele isungu ndowalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">na kuwahilika kuli nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Vidunda vya heni vyeng'ha ndovidita kuwa nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:11">na nzila za heni ng'hulu ndozigongomanya kahi.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Wanhu wa heni wokuya kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">wanji kulawa kasikazini na kolizinjilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">wanji kulawa isi ya Sinimu, iwele ubanzi wa kusini mwa isi ya Misili.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Wimbe kwa kusangalala, hegwe ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">utowe luchenze gwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">mtowe iyowe hemwe vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakawahembuliza wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">ena, kowa na isungu kwa wanhu wa heye walingugazika.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Hegwe muji wa Yelusalemu kwangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakandeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">ndikomya, Mkulu nakasemwa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwidichila muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">“Ndaze, mamo koweza kumsemwa mwanage yalingong'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">yaleche kumonela isungu mwana yawele nakamponda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">Hanga mamo koweza kumsemwa mwanage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">ila heni sikusemwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Lole, nanyandika itagwa lyako kuli viganza vya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:16">ndangijesa kuwala ng'hanzi za hegwe chila zuwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Wala wawele wokuzenga kahi wokola mijito himahima ng'hatu kusinda wala wawele nawakuwifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:17">na wala wawele nawakuwifya wokuka.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Winule meho ga hegwe ulole banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha wangikungajiza na kuya kwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">Ndangilaha kota vyondilingikala heni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">wanhu wa hegwe wowa kwa hegwe kota vinoligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">nagwe kowavala hewo kota yalinguhesigwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />“Hanga nakudumigwa na kuditigwa uwe mchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">na isi ya hegwe kuwifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">lelo isi ya hegwe yowa ndodo kwa chiwalo cha winji wa wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">na wala wawele nawakudita uwe mahame wowa kutali.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Wana wa hegwe wapondigwe kuli isi za chijenzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">wokung'ung'utila wolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">‘Isi ayi ndo ndodo lukami kwa chiwalo cha hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">utupe honhu hakulu ha kikala.’<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Aho ndo houchiuza gwegwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Whaani yawapondile wana weng'ha awa kwa chiwalo cha heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nafililwa na wana wa heni ne kuwa na wanji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nandechigwa na kulemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">lelo whaani yawalolele wana awa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nandechigwa ndiliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">lelo awa nawalawa kohi?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulutilila kumlonjela Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">“Ndokwinula moko ga heni kwa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">ena, ndoyinula bendela ya heni leka kuwalongoza wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">nawo wowegala wana wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">na kuwapapa wahinza wa hegwe kuli mayega ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Wandewa wowa wahaza wa wana wa hegwe wa kuwalolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">na wache wa wandewa wowa wamamo wa wana wa hegwe wa kuwalolela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Wofugama hali hegwe na kukuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">na kumyanga nhimbwisi iwele kuli magulu ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Aho ndo kovizela kota heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">weng'ha walingitumbila kwa heni, hawobasigwa soni.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Ndaze, vinhu vya yazidahe vyoweza kuholigwa kwa lupichi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">Ama wapogozi wa yawele na nhumbula ing'ang'ale, woweza kuloholigwa?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">“Ena! Wapogozi wa ngondo woweza kuholigwa kwa yazidahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">na vinhu kulawa kuli ngondo vyoholigwa kulawa kwa munhu yang'ang'ale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">Ndochitwanza na wang'honyo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">ndowalohola wana wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Ndowadita walingukutunya wedakulye hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">wogala kwa danda ya hewo kota ujimbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Aho wanhu weng'ha wovizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">kota heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, mlohozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">mgombozi wa hegwe, Mbele na Mong'ho kwa Yakobo.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Awu ndo usenga uwele Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwalonjela Waisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">“Ndaze, mwangijesa kota nangana kumha kalatasi ya luleko mayenu Yelusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Hebu! Ila kwa chiwalo cha nongwa za hemwe, mamo wa hemwe nakalechigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Ama, ndaze nangana ndiwaguze hemwe kuli upogozi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Hebu! Mkumbuchile kota namhilikwa kuli upogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Lekachoni lombuyile simfichile ne yumwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Lonyemile, lekachoni hakuwele na yoneche wa kunyhidichila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Ndaze, moko wa heni ndo ng'hochele lukami mbaka ndemwele kuwalohola hemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Ndaze, ndahela mong'ho wa kuwagombola hemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Lole! Kwa kung'hanuchila kudo hela, bahali yangukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">na nzanda ndanguzidita kuwa kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">somba zake zangufa na kunhung'ha kwa vila mazi ga haduhu.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Ndanguuvaliza ulanga jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:3">na ivalo lya kulombocheza.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha heni umyango ulangusigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">leka ndiuzele ulonzi ulinguwakangaza nhumbula watochile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">Chila lufuku kangumhaga heni maya ga kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">goyalingugana kundangusa.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakandita ndihulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">nani siwele mjuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">ne kumbelenhuka heye.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Mgongo wa heni nandiwalechela walingunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">mizeze ja heni kwa wala wang'humbule lulevu lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">wambasile soni heni na kunhemela mite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">heni sivisile leka ndiwe kutali na hewo.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">ahyo siweza kudeula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">Kumeho kwa heni nandikudita kuwe kota iganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">ndanguvizela kota sibasigwa soni.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Yalingundewela ka habehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Whaani kochitwanza na heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Yoye, twime mchitala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Mng'honyo wa heni ndo whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Lelo yalute kumwando leka yelajile.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Lole, Mkulu Nguluwi ndo yalingunhanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Whaani yalinguweza kunhagusa kota ndina nongwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Wang'honyo wa heni weng'ha wolala kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">fukuzi wowadakula.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Whaani hali hemwe yalingumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Whaani hali hemwe yalinguhulichiza ulonzi wa chitumagwa wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Wone kabaho yalingujenda kuli jiza ne kuwa na lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">yetumbile itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">na kikundiza kwa Nguluwi wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Ila hemwe mlingubwina chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">na kiditila vyenje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">mjende kwa lumuli lwa vyenje avyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">milapi ja chiluli chombwinile mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">Chompata kulawa kwa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo achi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">mowasa hanyi kwa magazo gang'hang'hale.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa kuwakangaza nhumbula wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">“Mnyhulichize hemwe mlingupala kutanganika, hemwe mlinguya kwa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">Mlijese italawe liwele namlavigwa amo kwa kuhongolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">honhu ha kutula maganga kuwele namlavigwa kwa kubawigwa.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Mlikumbuchile italawe liwele ndo wasekulu wa hemwe wawele ndo Abulahamu na Sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">wawele hemwe mweng'ha ndo walelwa wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">Mhela londimchemile Abulahamu nayali yalihela mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">ila nandimtambichiza na kumdita yawe na walelwa wenji lukami.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndowahembuliza wanhu walingikala kuli mahame ga muji wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Chiwala cha Yelusalemu ndochidita chiwe kota kagunda ka Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">ndochidita chiwe kota kagunda ka heni Mkulu Nguluwi mbele nandikagongomanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Wanhu weng'ha wa muji awo wotowa luchenze na kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">wolonga malumbo kwa heni na kwimba.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />“Mnyhulichize hemwe wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">mhulichize chondilingulonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">Malajizo na hachi vyolawa kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">navyo vyowa lumuli lwa wanhu wa isi nyinji.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Ndokuya himahima na kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">mhela wa hachi wa habehi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">Heni Nguluwi ndowalongoza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">Wanhu wa isi za kutali wangumbeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">wangubeteza kwa kitumbila kwa heni leka waloholigwe.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Muulole ulanga kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">hamba muilole isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Ulanga wokuka kota iyosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">isi yolala kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">na wenyeng'haye wake wobagama kota ng'honzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Ila ulohozi wa heni wochikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">hachi ya heni mazuwa gose haiduma.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />“Mnyhulichize hemwe mlinguzizela mbuli za hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">muwele namgawika malajizo ga heni kuli nhumbula za hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">Mleche kudumba kubeza kwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">ne kona soni kwa maligo ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Kwa vila fukuzi wowalya kota vila ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">lung'hwawa wowadakula kota vyowalingulya mivalo ja sufu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">Ila hachi ya heni yochikala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">ulohozi wa heni hauwa na kuduma.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Winuche! Winuche gwa Mkulu Nguluwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">Uvale mong'ho wa hegwe utulohole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">Winuche kota vyouditile aho katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">mhela wa lulelo lwa katali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">Ndaze, hauwele hegwe ulitemanjile izoka alyo Lahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">uwele nakulitumbula?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Hegwe ndo ukazile bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">ndo ugakazile mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">nakuzidita nzila mgati ng'hatu mwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">leka wala uwagombole waloche amo.<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, wanhu wa hegwe uwagombole wohiluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">wokuya Yelusalemu kuno wokwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">womema usangalalo wa mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">Wosangalala na kutowa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">masinzo na kulombocheza vyokuka.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">“Heni, ena heni, ndo ndilinguwahembuliza hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">Lekachoni hemwe mwanguwadumba wanhu walingubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">wanhu wawele wangwajilila kota misolo?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Hemwe namsemwa heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndiwalumbile hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">ndiuhanzanzile ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">na kujiwika misisi ja isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Mwangulutilila kudumba mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">kwa chiwalo cha kuzudila kwa yawele na nhumbula yihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">kwa vila kunuwila kwa heye ndo kudumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Ila ng'halazi ya heye yofika kohi?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Walingubunzwa wochumulilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">hawobagama na kudulika kuli ikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">ne hawokwisilwa chilyo.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">ndilinguitigula bahali leka nhigu zake zibume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">Mkulu Nguluwi Mbele na Mong'ho, ndo itagwa lya heni.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Nandiuwika ulonzi wa heni kuli milomo ja hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">nandiwavisa kuli lubehelo lwa moko wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">Nandiuwika ulanga hali honhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">nandijiwika misisi ja isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">Hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu ndanguwalonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">‘Hemwe ndo wanhu wa heni.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Kuduma kwa magazo ga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Winuche gwa Yelusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Winuche wime!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">Mkulu Nguluwi nakakunweza chizombe cha kuzudila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">nagwe nakunwa mbaka idovu lya kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">mbaka nakuzebeduka.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Hali wana weng'ha uwapondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">haduhu ne yumwe wa kukulongoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">Haduhu ne yumwe wa kukubata moko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">hali wana weng'ha uwalolele.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Mbuli azi mbili nazikufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">kuwifya na kudumigwa na lufemba na kukopola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">Whaani kokonela isungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">Whaani yokuhembuliza?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Wana wa hegwe wa habehi kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">nawawasa hafungo ha chila nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">wa kota ibala ligwilizwe kuli utandawala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">Nawafichigwa na ng'halazi ya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">na magazo ga Nguluwi wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Ahyo uhulichize hegwe Yelusalemu ulingugazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">uhulichize hegwe ugalile, ila haiwele kwa divai.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">yalinguwalewela wanhu wa heye, kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">“Nandichusa kwa hegwe chizombe cha kuzebeduka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">hunwa kahi chizombe cha ng'halazi ya heni.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Ndowanweza walingukugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">wala wakulonjele, ‘Uwase hanyi leka tukole mchanya mwako.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">Nawaudita mgongo wa hegwe kota misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">kota nzila ya hewo ya kukola.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kougombola muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Mwinuche! Mwinuche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Hemwe wanhu mlingikala kuli muji welile wa Yelusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Muwe na mong'ho kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">leka mlajile kota muji wa hemwe ndo unojile na uwele na ukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Haduhu wajenzi wohambe wamkunde Nguluwi ama wakokomoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">wawele wokwinjila kuli muji wa hemwe kahi na kuwavaba.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Mibaguse nhimbwisi mwinuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">midite kota wandewa hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">Michumule minyololo jiwele namuwopigwa kuli singo za hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, “Lomditigwe kuwa wapogozi hailavigwe sendi kwa chiwalo cha hemwe, ahyo haduhu sendi iwele yolipigwa kwa chiwalo cha kilejeha kwa hemwe. <verse eid="ISA 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Mhela winji ukolile hemwe wanhu wa heni namluta Misili na kikala ako, lelo Waashulu nawawabunza hemwe ne chiwalo. <verse eid="ISA 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Lelo ndangupata mzidi wachi kwa kuwona wanhu wa heni nawahilikwa kuli upogozi? Hewo walinguwalongoza wangidaya, ila itagwa lya heni lyangulutilila kubezigwa chila zuwa. <verse eid="ISA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Ahyo wanhu wa heni wonzela, zuwa alyo wovizela kota heni ndilingulonga, ‘Ndabaho!’ ”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Lole vyoilingunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">kumona msenga kanguya kulawa kuli chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">kuno kanguwikula mbuli inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">mbuli inojile ya kikala goya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">Kanguwikula kuwala ulohozi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">Kanguulonjela muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">“Nguluwi wa hegwe kangulongoza!”<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Wamizi wa muji wangulandula lizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">wanguchemeleza kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">kwa vila wangona kwa meho ga hewo wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">kuhiluka kwa Mkulu Nguluwi kuli muji wa Yelusalemu!<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Mtowe iyowe lya luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">hemwe mahame ga Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakawahembuliza wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">nakaugombola muji wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakaulajila mong'ho wa heye welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">Kowalohola wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">na isi yeng'ha yololela.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Muche! Muche! Muche hano.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Mleche kudoliza chinhu choneche chikokomoche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Muche kuno Babuloni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Miyelize hemwe mlingupika vinhu vya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Mhela awu hamlawa himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">ne hamkuka kwa kubilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe kowalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">na kuwamila hemwe kuli banzi zeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">“Chitumagwa wa heni kodita kwa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">kotogoligwa na kopata ukulu.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Wawele womona wotinhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">kwa vila kumeho kwa heye kowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">howa kahi na lukuli kota lwa munhu.<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Ila kowabubuwaza wanhu wa isi nyinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">Wandewa wobubuwala kwa chiwalo cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">kwa vila wokona mbuli ziwele hawanawahika kulonjelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">na wovizela mbuli ziwele hawanawahika kuhulika.”<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Whaani yawele nakakunda mbuli yotuhuliche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:1">Whaani yavizelele kota moko wa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ugaditile ago?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi nayali kota igodi lidodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">kota izabi kuli isi ikalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">Hawele na lukuli lukulu ne kumeho kunojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">hawele na kunoga kuwele wanhu woweza kulola na kutudita tumgane.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Nakabezigwa na kulemigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">munhu wa kisinza kwinji, yalingugazela magazo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">Kota munhu yawele wanhu wanguvisa kumeho kwa hewo leka waleche kumona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">nakabezigwa na natumona hawele chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Ndikomya, nakahola magazo ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">na kupika masinzo ga hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">Hetwe natijesa kota nakatowigwa na Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">nakatowigwa na kugazigwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Ila nakatubuligwa kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">nakalumizwa kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">Kwa kutowigwa kwa heye, natwenela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">kwa kulumizwa kwa heye, natupona.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Hetwe tweng'ha natwajilila na kulubaluba kota ming'holo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">chila yumwe wa hetwe nakaluta kuli nzila ya heye yuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakamdwika gehile ga hetwe geng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Nakabunzigwa na kugazigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">ila nakemilila kwa kunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">halavile lizi ne hado.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">Nakalongozwa kota lyana ing'holo lilinguhilikwa kudumuligwa singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">kota ing'holo vyolilingunyamalila mhela wa kudumuligwa milaika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">halonjile chinhu choneche.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Nakabunzigwa na kutagusigwa na kuhilikwa kukopoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">haduhu munhu yoneche yawele nakejesa kuwala gala galingumfika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">Nakawinjigwa kuli isi ya wawele wakomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">nakatowigwa kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hetwe gotuditile.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Hanga hamtowile yoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">ne kulonga ulonzi woneche wa uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">nawanuwila kumtila kota vyowalinguwatila wehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">Chilaga chake nachali hamwe na vilaga vya wawele na lufufu.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakanuwila kumlumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">na kumuwika kuli masinzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Mkulu Nguluwi nakakudita kikala kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">kuwe nhambiko ya nongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Chitumagwa wa Nguluwi kowa na walelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">kochikala miyaka minji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Heye ndo kokweneza majesa ga Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Hoyogona geng'ha galingulawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">kwa chiwalo cha magazo ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">kogutizwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">Kwa gala galawile kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">chitumagwa wa Nguluwi yawele na hachi, kowadita wenji wadite hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">naye kogahola gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi komha uhalizi kota vyoyalinguwapa wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">kowagawila wamizi vinhu viwele nawavihola kuli ngondo lowasumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">kwa vila nakalavya ukomu wa heye mbaka kubagama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">Hanga nakawazigwa hamwe na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">ila nakahola gehile ga wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">nakalanda kwa chiwalo cha wehile leka walechelwe.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Igano lya Nguluwi kwa isi ya Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">“Wimbe kwa luchenze gwa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">hegwe uwele kota mdala yawele mhende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">Utowe iyowe na kwimba lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">hegwe uwele hupondile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">kwa vila wana wa hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">wowa wenji kusinda wa mdala yawele na mlume.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Jidite mihema ja hegwe jiwe mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">ujidite jiwe migazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">Uzidite ng'weso zake ziwe ng'wemang'wema na uvidite vigingi vyake viwe nzinzili,<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />kwa vila kokonjeza ugazi wa hegwe kuli ubanzi wa kudilo na kumoso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">walelwa wa hegwe wowalongoza wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">na kikala kuli miji ja isi ya hegwe jiwele najilechigwa mahame.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Uleche kudumba, kwa vila haubasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">uleche kudumba kudeula kwa vila haubezigwa kahi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">Koisemwa soni ya uhinza wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">ne hauweza kukukumbuchila kahi kudeula kwa kulechigwa na mlume wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Heni ndikulumbile ndowa kota mlume wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">Mkulu Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho, ndo itagwa lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">mbele Yelile wa Isilaeli ndo mgombozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">heni ndanguchemigwa Nguluwi wa isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Hegwe kwa kota mdala yawele nakalechigwa na mlume wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">na kukudita uwe na masinzo mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">hegwe kwa kota mdala yahesigwe loyawele mhinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">hamba mlume ayo nakamleka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">Ila Mkulu Nguluwi nakakuchema leka uhiluche kwa heye.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />Nandikuleka kwa mhela uchefu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:7">kwa isungu likulu ndokuhilula.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Kwa ng'halazi ing'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">nandikuvisa kumeho kwa heni leka ndeche kukona kwa mhela uchefu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">ila kwa igano lya kwimilila lya mazuwa gose ndokonela isungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi mgombozi wa hegwe, nandonga.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Ndodita kota vyonditile kuli mhela wa Nuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">mhela wula nandilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">kota siigubika isi kahi kwa mazi tendema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">Lelo ndangilaha kota sikuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">ne kukung'hanhuchila kahi.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Vidunda vyoweza kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">vigongo vyoweza kusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">ila igano lya kwimilila lya heni halikuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">ilagano lya heni lya kikala goya halikusigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndilingukonela isungu nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu inyale</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />“Gwa Yelusalemu uwele nakugazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">uwele na masinzo na kulechigwa ne kuhembulizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">ndokuzenga unyale kwa maganga ga sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">misisi ja hegwe jowa ja maganga ga lanji ya buluu.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Milingo ja hegwe ndojizenga kwa maganga galinguchemigwa akiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">lwizi ja hegwe kwa maganga galingupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">ng'hanzi za hegwe kwa maganga ga sendi nyinji.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />“Wanhu wa hegwe wolanguswa na heni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:13">ndowadita walutilile goya ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Kwa hachi hegwe kotawizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">kubunza kowa kutali na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">hauweza kudumba choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">kowa kutali na lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">kwa vila haluweza kuwa habehi na hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Munhu yoneche yawele kokuvaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">kowa halajizwe na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">Yoneche yawele kochitowa na hegwe, kodumigwa.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />“Lole, heni ndo ndimlumbile yalingulumba vinhu kwa chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">yalingubwina chiluli cha makala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">na kugongomanya vinhu vya kitowela ngondo kwa chiwalo cha heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">Heni ndo ndimlumbile yalingudumya leka yadumye.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Vinhu vyeng'ha vya kitowela ngondo vilumbigwe kwa chiwalo cha kukulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">haviweza kukulumiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Wone munhu yakulonjeleze mchitala, komsumya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Awu ndo uhalizi wondiwawichile vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">kota ndowalewela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">Kwalichigwa kwa isungu lya Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">“Muye, hemwe mweng'ha muwele na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">muye kuli mazi hemwe mlihela sendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">mbochele ngano mkalye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">mbochele divai na itombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">moweza kubochela ne sendi.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Lekachoni mwangulavya sendi za hemwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">kwa chiwalo cha chinhu hachiwele cha kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">na kitunya kwa chinhu chohambe chigutize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Mnyhulichize goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">namwe molya viwele goya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">na kusangalala kwa vinonile.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />“Muwiche goya makutu hemwe wanhu wa heni, muye kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">mnyhulichize, leka mikale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">Heni ndodita ilagano lya mazuwa gose na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">ndowapa igano lya kwimilila lyondilagane na Daudi.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Ulole, nandimdita Daudi yawe mlolezi wa wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:4">chilongozi na mkulu wa wamizi wa wanhu wa isi.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Lelo hemwe mowachema wanhu wa isi wohamuwazelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">nawo wokuya kwa hemwe himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">kwa vila heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">ndo ndiwaditile hemwe mpegwe ukulu.”<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Mumpale Mkulu Nguluwi mhela yang'hali kangoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">mumlande utanzi mhela yang'hali ka habehi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Wehile waleche nzila za hewo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">wawele na gehile wagaleche majesa ga hewo gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">wamhiluchile Mkulu Nguluwi leka yawonele isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">wamlutile Nguluwi wa hetwe, kwa vila kowalechela hewo.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />Kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">“Majesa ga heni hagawele kota majesa ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">ne nzila za heni haziwele kota nzila za hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />Kota vila ulanga vyouwele kuchanya ng'hatu kusinda isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">ndo nzila za heni vyoziwele kuchanya ng'hatu kusinda nzila za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">na majesa ga heni vyogawele kuchanya ng'hatu kusinda majesa ga hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Kota vila nhonya na seluji vyovilingudulika kulawa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">havilinguhiluka ako kahi, ila vyangujidodezaga misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">na kujidita mizuchila jizuche na kukula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">vyangumhaga mlimi nyhadikwa na kuwapa wanhu chilyo.<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Hihyo du na ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">hauhiluka kwa heni kahi ne kulutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">ila wokweneza lila lyonuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">wolutilila goya kuli kunuwila kondikuwichile.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />“Molawa Babuloni kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">molongozwa leka mlute kwa kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">Vidunda na vigongo hali hemwe vyotowa iyowe na kwimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">migodi jeng'ha kuli migunda jowatowela hemwe vimbamba.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Honhu ha chisosolo cha miwa, jozuka misonobali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">na honhu ha mikwangwasale jozuka mihadasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">Ayo yowa mbuli iwele yowadita wanhu wakumbuchile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">kuwala mbuli zonditile heni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">ndo ulajilo wa mazuwa gose uwele hauwifigwa.”<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Ulohozi kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi zinji</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">“Mibatilile hachi na kudita ganojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">kwa vila ulohozi wa heni wa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">mong'ho wa heni wa ulohozi wokoneka chila honhu muisi.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Nakatambichizwa munhu yalingudita mbuli kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">yalingibatilila malajizo ga zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">na kuleka kudita wihe woneche.<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />“Mjenzi yalingilumba na heni, Mkulu Nguluwi yaleche kijesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">‘Ndikomya, Mkulu Nguluwi kombagula heni na wanhu wa heye.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">Naye mlume yohambe yaweze kuwa mhaza yaleche kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">‘Heni ndo igodi likalile hela ahyo Nguluwi kondema!’<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Kwa vila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">‘Towashi yalingubatilila malajizo ga heni ga zuwa lya Kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">yalingudita mbuli zilingunojeza heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">na kibatilila ilagano lya heni,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />kuli ng'handa ya heni na ng'hanzi zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">kokumbuchilwa kwa itagwa linojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">kusinda kuwa na wasongolo na wahinza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">Ndomha itagwa lya kukumbuchilwa mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">liwele halyusigwa.’<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />“Wajenzi wawele wong'hunda heni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">wawele wonhogola na kuligana itagwa lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">na wawele wowa vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">weng'ha wawele wolibatilila zuwa lya Kwesela ne kulidita liwe likokomoche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">wawele wolibatilila ilagano lya heni,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />ndowegala kuli chidunda cha heni chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">na kuwadita wasangalale kuli ng'handa ya heni ya kulandila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">nhambiko za hewo za kulakazwa na ndolendole za hewo zokundigwa kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">kwa vila ng'handa ya heni yochemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">‘Ng'handa ya kulanda kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.’<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />“Awu ndo ulonzi wa heni Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">ndilinguwakungajiza Waisilaeli wasambaluche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">‘Nandiwakungajiza wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">ila ndowakungajiza wanji leka welumbe hamwe na hewo.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongozi wa Isilaeli wangutagusigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Mkulu Nguluwi kanguwalonjela wanhu wa isi za chijenzi woye kota migongolo ja kisolo na kuwalya wanhu wa heye. <verse eid="ISA 56:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Kangulonga, “Vilongozi weng'ha wawele nandijesa kota wowakanya wanhu wa heni, ila ndo wohambe walole! Hawalinguvizela chinhu, wa kota mibwa jiwele hajilingubwaka, jiwele janguwasaga hela na kulota. Wangugana ng'hatu kuwasa. <verse eid="ISA 56:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Vilongozi awo ndo kota mibwa jiwele na maya ng'hatu, hajilingiguta. Vilongozi awa wahela kuvizela, chila yumwe nakagalamchila kuli nzila ya heye yuye kwa chiwalo cha kupata mzidi wa heye. <verse eid="ISA 56:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Wangilonjelaga, ‘Muye, tulute kupala divai na kunwa ng'hatu! Mitondo yowa inojile ng'hatu kusinda lehano.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli wangukanyigwa kuwala kujifugamila jimalukolo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Wawele na hachi wangubagamaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">na haduhu ne munhu yalingijesa mnhumbula kuwala alyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">wanhu walingumfugamila Nguluwi wangusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">haduhu ne yumwe yalinguvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">kota wawele na hachi nawosigwa leka waleche kufichigwa na magazo.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Wanhu walinguwinza nzila ya hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">wowa na kikala goya na kwesela kuli chilaga.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />Ila Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">“Muye hano hemwe wahawi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">hemwe wang'hondwa na wahonzolomo mnyhulichize.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Ndaze, mwangijesa kota mwangumbeza whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">Whaani mlingumseka kwa kubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">na kumlavila myango za hemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">Ndaze, hemwe hamuwele wana wa wabelenhuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">lulelo lwa wahadi?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Hemwe mna maya ga kuwasa na wadala kuli migodi ja mialoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">hasi ha chila igodi liwele na nhagala hawele mwangujifugamila milungu ja hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">Mwanguwakopola wana wa hemwe kota nhambiko kwa jimalukolo ja hemwe kuli mibindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">na kuli mitalawe jiwele na mhalika.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Mwanguhagula maganga madeche kuli mibindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">kuwa ndo milungu ja hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Mwangugaboholela nhambiko za chakunwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">na kugahilichila nhambiko za nyhule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Ndaze, ndutilile kuwa na isungu na hemwe kwa mbuli zeng'ha azi zomlingudita?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Namuwika vinhanda vya hemwe mchanya mwa vidunda vikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:7">namluta ako kuchanya kuwasa na wahonzolomo na kulavya nhambiko.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Kumbele mwa lwizi na fulemu zake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">namniniza limalukolo lya hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Mwangundeka, namviwika goya vinhanda vya hemwe na kuvidita viwe vigazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Mwangudita ilagano na hewo wawele namvigana vinhanda vya hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Amo mwangigutiza maya ga hemwe gehile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">kuno mwangulilola lukami limalukolo lya hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Mwangibakaliza vinhunyhililo kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">hamba mwanguluta kumfugamila Moleki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">Mwanguwalajiza wasenga wa hemwe walute aku na ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">kupala milungu ja kujifugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame nawafika.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Namtoka kwa majendo ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">ila hamtweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">nampata mong'ho unyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">ahyo hamuwele habehi kubagama.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />“Namumdumba na kukabuswa na whaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">mbaka namlonga udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">na kuleka kukumbuchila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">na kuleka kijesa kuwala heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">Heni siwagazile hemwe kwa mhela winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">hanji acho ndo chiwalo namleka kundumba.<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Mwangijesa kota mwangudita goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">ila ndogawika hazelu madito ga hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">najo milungu ja hemwe hajiweza kuwatanza chinhu.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Homlila kwa kuchilanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">chilundo cha jimalukolo ja hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">hachiweza kuwalohola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Mbeho yochiwembelusila kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">ena, yochitaga kutali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Ila wawele wobilimila kikala goya kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">woihalila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">chidunda cha heni chelile chowa cha hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isungu lya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">“Mzenje! Mzenje! Muiwiche goya nzila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">Muse vinhu vyeng'ha mnzila vilinguwalemeza wanhu wa heni kukola.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Ahi ndo vyoyalingulonga Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">yalingikala mazuwa gose na yawele itagwa lya heye ndo Yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">“Heni ndangikala ako kuchanya, honhu helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">nda hamwe na walingulongaga gehile ga hewo na walingunyenyetela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">Heni ndowakangaza nhumbula walingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">ndowapa mong'ho walonjile gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Silutilila kuwalonjeleza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">ne kuwazudila mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">kwa vila hewo wowa ng'hochele hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">nani ndo ndiwapele lweselo lwa heni lwa ukomu.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Nandiwazudila hewo kwa chiwalo cha gehile na maya ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">nandiwagaza hewo na kuvisa kumeho kwa heni na kuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">ila nawalutilila kuwinza nzila za hewo wawo.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Nandizona nzila za hewo, ila ndowadita wapone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">ndowalongoza na kuwahembuliza hewo walingulombocheza.<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />Ndowadita wembe lwimbo lwa lutogo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">‘Kikala goya, kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">kwa wawele kutali na wawele habehi.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">Ndowadita wapone.<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Ila wehile ndo kota bahali itiguche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">iwele haiweza kusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">nhigu zake zanguhombaga nhope na wavu.”<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />Nguluwi wa heni kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:21">“Wanhu wehile siwapa kikala goya.”<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Kufugamila kwa kukomya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">“Towa iyowe ne kilemeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">ulandule lizi lya hegwe kota mhalamanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">Uwikule nongwa za wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">walonjele walelwa wa Yakobo gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Kwa vila chila zuwa wangumhala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">wangugana kuzizela nzila za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">kota vila hewo ndo wanhu wa isi walingudita mbuli za hewo kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">wanhu wa isi wohambe wasemwe malajizo ga heni, Nguluwi wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">Wangugana nyamule kwa hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">na kugana kikala habehi na heni.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />“Mwangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">‘Twangwesela kulya ila hegwe haulingutulola!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Twangunyenyetela hali hegwe ila haulingijesa kuwala hetwe!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Ila, ndikomya kuli zuwa lya kwesela kulya kwa hemwe, mwangudita vyomlingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">na kuwabunza wakola mijito wa hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Mwangwesela kulya kahi mwangilewa na kitowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">Kwa kudita ahyo, mwangijesa kota kulanda kwa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">kofika kwa heni kilanga?<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Ndaze, aku ndo kwesela kulya kondikuhagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">zuwa limwe hela kwa munhu kunyenyetela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Ndaze, kwa kinamiza mutwi kota idete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">na kuwasa mchanya mwa migunila na mivu kwa masinzo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Ndaze, alyo ndo mwangulichema zuwa lya kwesela kulya lilingukundigwa na heni, Mkulu Nguluwi?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Hebu! Kwesela kulya kondilingukugana ndo aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">kuwadoholela wawichigwe mchinweng'ho ne hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">kusa minyololo ja upogozi kwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">kuwapa kilejeha walingukola mijito kwa lupichi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">na kubena chila ngwamo.<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Kwesela kulya kwa kukomya ndo kuwagawila chilyo cha hegwe wawele na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">kuwalalika kaye kwa hegwe wazunwa walihela honhu ha kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">kuwapa mivalo walihela na kuwatanza wang'holozo.<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />“Wone mdite ahyo mopulika kota kubwemwenzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">mopona himahima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">Madito ga hemwe ganojile gowalongola hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">na ukulu wa heni Mkulu Nguluwi, wowamila hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Aho ndo homlanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">nani, Mkulu Nguluwi ndowedichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">molila kwa lizi kulanda utanzi, nani ndowedichila, ‘Nda hano!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">Homleka kubunza hali hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">homleka kuwabeza wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">homleka kulonga wihe,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />homuwapa chilyo kwa isungu wawele na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">homkweneza galinguganigwa kupata kwa walihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">lumuli lowalangazila mhela wa jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">jiza lya hemwe lyowa kota nemisi.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndowalongoza hemwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">ndokweneza gomlingugana mhela wa magazo na mhela wa kugunuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">ndowadita muwe nzinzili kuli ng'huli za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">mowa kota kagunda kalinguboholelwaga mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">kota nzasa ya mazi iwele mazi gake mazuwa gose hagalingukala.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Mahame ga hemwe ga katali gozenjigwa kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">mozenga unyale kuli misisi jilechigwe katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">mochemigwa wanhu wagongomanyile kahi ng'hanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">waziditile nzila za muji leka wanhu wakole kahi.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />“Wone mleche kukola mijito kuli zuwa lya Kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">na kudita choneche choulingugana kuli zuwa alyo lya heni lyelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">wone mlidite zuwa lya heni liwe lya kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">wone mlihulichize zuwa lyelile lya heni, Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">wone mleche kudita vyomlingugana na kuleka kulonga upoka,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />mopata kusangalala kwa hemwe kuli heni, Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">ndowapa kusumya kuli chila kitwanza kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">ndowapa uhalizi wa Yakobo, sekulu wa hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo galinguwala gehile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Mleche kijesa kota moko wa Mkulu Nguluwi ndo ufupi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">mbaka yalemwele kuwalohola hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">ama makutu ga heye nagadinyigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">mbaka yalemwele kuwahulichiza hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Gehile ga hemwe ndo galinguwawika kutali na Nguluwi wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">gehile ga hemwe ndo gamditile heye yevise kutali na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">mbaka halinguwahulichiza hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Kwa vila moko ga hemwe nagawichigwa ukokomoche kwa kukopola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">vidole vya hemwe kwa madito gehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">Milomo ja hemwe najilonga udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">myango za hemwe zangulongaga wihe.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Homluta kuli chitala kumlonjeleza munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">hamlingulonga kukomya ne kwa hachi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Mwangitumbila uhadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">mwangulonga udesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Mwangijesa mbuli zihile na kulela wihe.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Mwanguganhula mafinga ga izoka liwele na dunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">mwangutawa utandawala wa ibui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Yalingulya mafinga ga hemwe kobagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">hogotuligwa mizoka jangulawa amo.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Utandawala wa hemwe hauwele goya kwa mivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">wanhu hawoweza kigubika chomlingutawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">Mijito ja hemwe ndo ja wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">madito ga hemwe geng'ha ndo kitowa hela.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Mwahabehi kudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">mwangudita himahima kubohola danda ilihela nongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">Majesa ga hemwe ndo ga wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">kuwifya na kudumya kwangonekaga kuli nzila za hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Hamuizelele nzila ya kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">nzila za hemwe zeng'ha ndo za kubunza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">Namiditila nzila za kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">yoneche yalingukola amo howeza kuwa na kikala goya.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangulonga gehile ga hewo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Hachi ya kutali na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">kutanganika kwa Nguluwi kung'hali kufika kwa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">Twangitumbila kupata lumuli, ila ndo jiza hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">twangubeteza lumuli, ila twangujenda kuli jiza.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Twangukwabasa lukanzi kota wohambe walole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">kota wanhu walihela meho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">Twangikwang'wala nemisi kota vila ndo nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">hetwe ndo kota wabagame hali wanji wawele na mong'ho.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Twangubuma kota midubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">twangulombocheza kota ng'hunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">Twanguubeteza utaguso wa hachi ila wa haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">twanguupala ulohozi ila wa kutali na hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Nongwa za hetwe hali hegwe ndo nyinji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">gehile ga hetwe gangutulonjeleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">Ena, twa hamwe na nongwa za hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">twanguuzela wihe wa hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Natukubelenhuka na kukulema, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">natulema kukuwinza gwa Nguluwi wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">Kubunza na kubelenhuka vya mnhumbula za hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">twangijesa na kulonga mbuli za udesi.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Hachi naiwichigwa hafungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">kutanganika kwa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">kukomya kwangubigangwa mchitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">kugoloka hakulinguweza kwinjila amo.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Kukomya kwa haduhu chila honhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">naye yalinguleka wihe kanguwaga upelembi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">Mkulu Nguluwi nakazona mbuli azo, nakazudizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">kwa vila hakuwele na hachi.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangiwika goya kuwalohola wanhu wa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Nakona kota haduhu munhu ne yumwe yalingikangaza nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">nakabubuwala kwa vila haduhu yalinguwatanza walingubunzigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Ahyo, nakatumiya mong'ho wa heye yuye kuwalohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">hachi ya heye kwa kusumya.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Nakavala kutanganika kota ivalo lya kiyamila mhambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">ulohozi kota kofiya ya chuma kumutwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">Kovala chibida kota ivalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">na kigubika ng'halazi kota ikanzu.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Kowagaza wang'honyo wa heye kwa kiwhana na madito ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">ena, kuzudila kwa heye na chibida vyowafika wang'honyo wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">kowagaza mbaka wenyeng'haye wa isi za kutali.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Kulawa kolizinjilaga isanya mbaka kolilawilaga isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">chila munhu komdumba Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">na kuuzela ukulu wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">Kwa vila kokuya kota lwanda lumemile mazi galinguluta himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">mazi galingukundujizwa na mbeho ya Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">“Ndokuya Yelusalemu kota mgombozi wa walelwa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">wawele wolonga gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Ali ndo ilagano lya heni na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">kuwala Muhe wa heni na ulonzi vyondiwapele hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">havikuka kwa hemwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">ne kwa wana na wazukulu wa hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">kulawa sambi mbaka mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu inyale</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />Winuche gwa Yelusalemu ulangaze</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">kwa vila lumuli lwangulawa kwa chiwalo cha hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi wangukulangazila.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Lole, jiza loigubika isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">jiza totolo lowagubika wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">ila Mkulu Nguluwi kokulangazila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">ukulu wa heye wokoneka kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Wanhu wa isi na wandewa wowinza lumuli lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:3">lumuli lwa hegwe lwa kubwemwenzuka.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Winule meho ga hegwe ulole banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">weng'ha wangikungajiza na kuya kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wasongolo wa hegwe wanguya kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wahinza wa hegwe wa mmoko kota vyali.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Aho ndo kokona na kumema usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">nhumbula ya hegwe yokakama kwa luchenze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">kwa vila lufufu lwa wanhu wa isi logaligwa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">kwa kukolela kuli bahali lufufu lokuya kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Vilundo vya ngamiya vyomema kuli isi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">ena, ngamiya kulawa Midiani na Efa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">Wanhu kulawa Sheba wokuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">wokugalila zahabu na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">kuno wowikula lutogo lwa heni Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Vilundo vya ming'holo ja Kedali vyokungajizwa na kugaligwa kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">koweza kujilavya ming'holo milume ja Nebayoti kwa chiwalo cha nhambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">nhambiko ilingukundigwa honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">Mkulu Nguluwi kowika ukulu kuli ng'handa ya heye yelile.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Whaani awo walinguwembeluka kota ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:8">kota ng'hunda vyozilinguguluka kuluta kuli vimvulila vyawo?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Meli zanguya kulawa kuli isi za kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kuno zilongolwe na meli za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">zanguwegala wana wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">hamwe na sendi na zahabu za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwa lutogo lwa Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwa lutogo lwa Nguluwi, Yelile wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">kwa vila nakakudita uwe na ukulu.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">“Wajenzi wozizenga unyale ng'hanzi za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">wandewa wa hewo wokukolela mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">hanga kwa ng'halazi ya heni nandikutowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">ila kwa igano lya kwimilila lya heni ndokonela isungu.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Lwizi lwa hegwe lowa mwanzi mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">nechilo na nemisi haluhindigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">leka wanhu wa isi wakugalile lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">kuno welongoze na wandewa wa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Chila undewa ama wanhu wa isi wohambe wakukolele mijito wowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:12">wodumigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />“Kogalilwa lufufu lwa chihulo cha Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">mbawo za mibeloshi na mivinje na misonobali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">leka kuinoliga Ng'handa ya heni Yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">kuidita ng'handa ya heni iwe na ukulu.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Walelwa wa wala wakubunzile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">wokuya na kufugama hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">wala weng'ha wakubezile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">wofugama hali magulu ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">Wokuchema, ‘Muji wa Mkulu Nguluwi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">‘Siyoni muji welile wa Isilaeli.’<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />“Hanga nawali ulechigwe na kuzudilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">haduhu munhu yawele kuli majendo yawele nakakola kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">lelo ndokudita uwe na lutogo mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">kowa muji wa kusangalala kwa lulelo lweng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Wanhu wa isi zinji na wandewa wokulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">kota mamo vyoyalingonyeza chali cha heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">Aho ndo kovizela kota heni Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo mlohozi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">Mbele na Mong'ho wa Yakobo, ndo mgombozi wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Ndokugalila zahabu honhu ha shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">na sendi honhu ha chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">na shaba honhu ha migodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">na chuma honhu ha maganga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">Kikala goya kokulongoza hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">kutanganika kowa ndo mndewa wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Kitowa hakuweza kuhulikwa kahi kuli isi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">ne kuwifya na kudumya kuli mbaka ja hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">Koweza kuzichema ng'hanzi za hegwe, ‘Ulohozi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">na lwizi ja hegwe, ‘Lutogo.’<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />“Hauweza kuligana kahi isanya kukulangazila nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">ne nyelezi kukulangazila nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">kwa vila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndowa lumuli lwa hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">heni Nguluwi wa hegwe ndowa ukulu wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Lumuli lwa hegwe lwa nemisi haluzinga kota isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">ne nechilo lumuli lwa hegwe halubilabila kota nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">kwa vila heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndo lumuli lwa hegwe mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">na mazuwa ga hegwe ga masinzo goduma.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Wanhu wa hegwe weng'ha wowa watanganiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">isi ayi yowa ya hewo mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">Hewo ndo izuchila lyondilinyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">mijito ja moko ga heni kwa chiwalo cha ukulu wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Yawele mdodo hali hemwe kowa nhanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">yawele mdodo kusinda weng'ha kowa wanhu wa isi wawele na mong'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">Heni ndo Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">mhela houfika ndogeneza gano himahima.”<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli inojile ya kugomboligwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamemeza heni muhe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakambakaliza heni mafuta kunyhagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">nakandajiza ndiwegalile wazunwa mbuli inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">ndiwakangaze watweguche nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">ndiwawikulile kilejeha kwa wapogozi wa ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">kudoholigwa kwa wanweng'hwa.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Nakandajiza ndiuwikule mwaka wa isungu lya heye, Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">zuwa lya heye lya kuhilula chibida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">na kuwahembuliza weng'ha walingulombocheza,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />ndiwape wala wawele na masinzo ako Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">itaji lya uluwa honhu ha mivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">mafuta ga kusangalala honhu ha kulombocheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">ivalo lya lutogo honhu ha kutweguka nhumbula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">Nawo wochemigwa mialoni ja hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">joyanyalile Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">kulajila ukulu wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Wogazenga kahi mahame ga katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">wogongomanya miji jibomoligwe aho mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">wojizenga kahi miji jiwifigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">jiwele najilechigwa uchiwa kuli lulelo lukolile.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Wajenzi wowa aho kujidima migongolo ja hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:5">wolima na kulolela mizabibu ja hemwe.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Hemwe mochemigwa, “Watambika wa Mkulu Nguluwi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">mochemigwa kahi, “Vitumagwa wa Nguluwi wa hetwe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">Molya kuli lufufu lwa wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">mopata ukulu kulawa kuli lufufu lwa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Honhu ha soni mopata mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">honhu ha kudeula mopata uhalizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">ahyo mohalila honhu hakulu kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">mosangalala mazuwa gose.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga, “Ndangugana hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">ndanguzudila kuboka na wihe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">Kwa kugoloka, ndowapa wanhu wa heni chonolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">ndodita ilagano lya mazuwa gose na hewo.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Walelwa wa hewo wozeleka hali wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">na ivyazi lya hewo lozeleka lukami kuli nhanzi za wanhu wanji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">Chila hoyowona hewo kokunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">kota hewo ndo wanhu wawele nawatambichizwa na Mkulu Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Ndosangalala lukami kwa chiwalo cha Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">nhumbula ya heni yosangalala kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">Kwa vila nakavaliza heni mivalo ja ulohozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">na kunoliga heni kwa ikanzu lya kutanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">kota vila mkasano vyoyalinginoliga kwa itaji lya uluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">kota yalinguhesigwa vyoyalinginoliga na vinhu vya sendi nyinji.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Kota vila misanga vyojilingudita mizuchila jizuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">na mgunda vyoulingudita nyhule zinyaligwe amo zizuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">ndo Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyovidita kutanganika na lutogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">vilawile hali wanhu wa isi zeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Kwa chiwalo cha hegwe Yelusalemu, siweza kinyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">kwa chiwalo cha hegwe Yelusalemu, siweza kusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">mbaka kuloholigwa kwa hegwe kulawile kota kubwemwenzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">mbaka kutanganika kwa hegwe kulawile kota chenje.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Wanhu wa isi wokona kutanganika kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">wandewa weng'ha wowona ukulu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">kochemigwa kwa itagwa linyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">itagwa liwele kokupa heye yuye Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Kowa itaji linojile kwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:3">itaji linojile lya chiundewa kwa Nguluwi wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Hauchemigwa kahi, “Yalechigwe,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">ama, “Isi ya Uchiwa.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">Itagwa lya hegwe linyale lyowa, “Yalinguganigwa na Nguluwi” na “Yalinguhesigwa na Nguluwi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">kwa vila Mkulu Nguluwi nakanojezwa na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">naye kowa kota mlume wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Wanhu wa hegwe woihola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">kota msongolo vyoyalinguhesa mdala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">Ahyo, Mkulu Nguluwi konojezwa na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">kota mlume vyoyalingunojezwa na mche wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Mchanya mwa ng'hanzi za hegwe, gwa Yelusalemu, nandiwawika wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">wawele mazuwa gose, nemisi na nechilo hawonyamalila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">Womdita Mkulu Nguluwi yakumbuchile kilagana kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">mhela weng'ha ne kuleka.<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Waleche kumha heye mhela wa kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">mbaka hoyouwika nzinzili muji weng'ha wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">na kuudita uwe lutogo lwa isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">ena, kwa ludali lwa heye nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">“Siwapa kahi wang'honyo wa hegwe nyhule za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">ne wajenzi hawonwa kahi divai ya hegwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">viwele nakugazika ng'hatu kuvipata avyo.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Ila hegwe ubetile nyhule azo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">kolya na kunhogola heni Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">Ukwanyule zabibu azo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">konwa divai kuli lugagala lwa honhu helile ha heni.”<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Wenyeng'haye wa Yelusalemu, mlawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">mlawe kwa kukolela kuli lwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">mgongomanye nzila kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa hemwe walinguhiluka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Mgongomanye kahi! Mgongomanye kahi nzila ng'hulu na kusa maganga geng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Mwinule bendela ya ulajilo kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa isi zinji.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakawikula kwa wanhu wa isi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">“Muwalonjele wanhu wa Yelusalemu kota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">mgombozi wa hewo kanguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">ndolendole ya heye ya hamwe na heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">na chonolo cha heye cha kumwando kwa heye.”<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Wanhu wa Yelusalemu wochemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">“Wanhu welile” na “Wagomboligwe na Mkulu Nguluwi.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Yelusalemu kochemigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">“Muji ulinguganigwa na Nguluwi” na “Muji uwele haulechigwe na Nguluwi.”<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Utaguso wa wang'honyo wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Whaani ayu yalinguya kulawa kuli ngondo kula Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">kulawa Bosila na mivalo jiwele na usalagwa udung'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">Whaani ayo yavalile mivalo ja sendi nyinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">yalingujenda kwa ukulu wa mong'ho wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">“Ndo heni Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">ndilinguwikula kusumya kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">mbele na mong'ho wa kulohola.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Lekachoni ivalo lya hegwe naliwa lidung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:2">kota munhu yalingukama zabibu?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />“Ena, nang'hama zabibu ndiliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi, haduhu munhu yawele nayali hamwe na heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Nandiwabiga wanhu wa isi kwa ng'halazi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">nandiwahondanga kwa ng'halazi ya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Mivalo ja heni najimema usalagwa wa danda ya hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">danda ya hewo naiwika wavu kuli nguwo za heni.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Kwa vila zuwa lya kuhilula chibida nalyali mnhumbula mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:4">mhela wa kuwagombola wanhu wa heni naufika.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Nandola ila hakuwele na munhu wa kunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">nambubuwala kwa vila hakuwele na wakunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">ila moko wa heni nausumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">ng'halazi ya heni ndo inditile ndiwe nzinzili.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Kwa ng'halazi ya heni nandiwabiga wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">kwa kuzudila kwa heni nandiwadita wagale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">danda ya hewo nandiibohola kuli misanga.”<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igano lya kwimilila lya Nguluwi kwa Waisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Ndowalonjela wanhu kuwala igano lya kwimilila lya Mkulu Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">Ndolonga madito ga heye geng'ha galinguganigwa kutogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">kwa chiwalo cha geng'ha goyatuditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">kunoga kukulu kwa heye koyawapele Waisilaeli kwa isungu lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">kwa kiwhana na winji wa igano lya kwimilila lya heye.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Nakalonga hali hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">“Ndikomya, wano ndo wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">wana wa heni wawele hawondeteleza”.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">Lelo, heye nakawa mlohozi wa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Kuli magazo ga hewo geng'ha naye nakagazika na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">hamlajize msenga yunji kuwatanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">ila heye yuye nakoya kuwalohola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">Kwa igano na isungu lya heye nakawagombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">kulawa katali nakawahola na kuwalolela.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Ila hewo nawabelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">nawamdita muhe yelile wa heye yawe na masinzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">Ahyo, Nguluwi nakagalamka, nakawa mng'honyo wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">heye yuye naketowa na hewo.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Hamba wanhu wa heye nawagakumbuchila mazuwa ga katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">mhela wa Musa chitumagwa wa Mkulu Nguluwi na wanhu wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Nawauza, “Lelo kakohi Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">yawele nakachilohola chilundo cha wanhu wa heye hamwe na wadimi wa hewo kuli bahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Kakohi yula yauwichile muhe wa heye yelile hali hewo,<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />yawele kwa moko wa heye uwele na mong'ho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">nakadita vinduzanduza kwa kukolela Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">nakaigawanula bahali na kuwalongoza wanhu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">na kipatila itagwa lya mazuwa gose?<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Whaani yawele nakawalongoza hagati ha mazi menji ga bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">mbaka nawakola amo himahima kota falasi ne kikwang'hwala?<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Kota vila misenga vyojilinguhilikwa kuli ibindi, honhu ha kudila migongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">ndo muhe wa Nguluwi vyouwaditile wanhu wa heye wesele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ahyo ndo vyouwalongoze wanhu wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">nagwe nakipatila itagwa lyelile.”<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Utulole kulawa kilanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Gwa Nguluwi, ulole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">utulole kulawa haluga ha hegwe helile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Vyakohi fihi ya hegwe na mong'ho wa hegwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">Ulutilile kutulajila igano lya kwimilila lya hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Kwa vila hegwe ndo mhaza wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">hanga Abulahamu, sekulu wa hetwe hatuzelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">naye Isilaeli halingutuzela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">ila hegwe, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, ndo mhaza wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">mgombozi wa hetwe kulawa katali ng'hatu ndo itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, lekachoni kwangutuleka tulute kutali na nzila za hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">na kuzidita nhumbula za hetwe ziwe zigagadale mbaka hatulingukuhulichiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uhiluche kwa chiwalo cha vitumagwa wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">nhanzi ziwele ndo uhalizi wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Kwa mhela uchefu hela, hetwe wanhu wa hegwe welile natuhahola honhu ha hegwe helile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:18">ila wang'honyo wa hetwe nawoya na kuhawifya haluga ha hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Natuwa kota wanhu wawele hawalongozigwe na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">kota wanhu wawele hawazeleche kwa itagwa lya hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Wone wahatulile ulanga na kudulika hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">vidunda vyahakakame hali hegwe!<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Uwe kota ilapi lya chiluli vyolilingwaluchiza chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">na kwambuza mazi kuhemla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">ahyo wang'honyo wa hegwe wokuzela hegwe kwa whaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">na wanhu wa isi zeng'ha wokakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">kwa chiwalo cha hegwe kuwa habehi.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Mhela louditile mbuli za kukabusa ziwele hatujesile kuzona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">nakudulika, navyo vidunda navikakama hali hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Kulawa katali haduhu yoneche yawele nakawahika kumona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">haduhu ikutu liwele nalihulika mbuli za Nguluwi yunji, ila hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">ulingudita mbuli kwa chiwalo cha wala walingitumbila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Kwanguwatanza wala walinguhulichiza kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">na kudita vyoulingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">ila gehile gangukudita uzudile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Kwa utanzi wa hegwe hela ndo toweza kuloholigwa.<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Tweng'ha twa wakokomoche, hatulinguganigwa kukufugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">madito ga hetwe geng'ha ganojile ndo kota ivalo liwele na wavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">Kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">twanguswinha kota mahamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">na kuwembeluswa na mbeho.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Haduhu ne yumwe yalinguya kukulanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">ne yalingitunya kukupala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">Kwangukuvisa kumeho kwa hegwe kutali na hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">nakutuleka tuwe ng'hochele, leka tulemwele kuleka gehile ga hetwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Ila, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, hegwe ndo mhaza wa hetwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">Hetwe ndo ilongo na hegwe ndo yalingulumba vinhu vya ilongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">Hetwe tweng'ha ndo mijito ja moko ga hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Gwa Mkulu Nguluwi, uleche kutuzudila lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">ne kukumbuchila gehile ga hetwe mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Twangukulanda ukumbuchile kota hetwe tweng'ha ndo wanhu wa hegwe.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Miji ja hegwe jelile najiwa chiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">muji wa Yelusalemu nauwifigwa na kuwa mahame.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Ng'handa ya Nguluwi wa hetwe inojile na yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">honhu hawele wasekulu wa hetwe nawakutogola hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">nahalakazwa kwa chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">Vinhu vya hetwe vyeng'ha vinojile naviwifigwa.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />Ndaze, kwa aga geng'ha, kochilemeza uleche kudita chinhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:12">Kolutilila kunyamalila hela, gwa Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:12">na kutugaza lukami?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Utaguso na ulohozi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">“Nandiwika goya kuhulika mbaka kwa wanhu wawele hawalinguuza mbuli za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">na kuwabochela wanhu wawele hawamhalile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">Kwa wanhu wa isi wawele hawalichemile itagwa lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">nandonga, ‘Nda hano! Nda hano.’<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Nemisi yeng'ha nangolola moko ga heni kuwabochela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">wala wawele nawambelenhuka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">walingujenda kuli nzila zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">wawele walinguwinzaga majesa ga hewo wawo,<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />wanhu wa isi walingunzudizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">wangujilavilaga nhambiko milungu ja hewo kuli kagunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">na kujifunyizila ubani kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Walingikalisaga kuli vilaga leka kulongasa na mihoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">na kuli honhu ha kivisa mhela wa nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">wangulyaga miwunde ja migubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">na viya vya hewo vina mhuzi wa miwunde jikokomoche,<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />wanguwalonjelaga wala walingiting'hana nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">‘Mikale kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">mleche kuwa habehi na heni kwa vila heni ndo yelile kusinda hegwe!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">Wanhu kota awo wangunzudiza ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">ng'halazi ya heni ndo kota chiluli chohambe chizimye.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />“Nanyamula kuwagaza hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">na utaguso wa hewo nawandichigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">Siweza kunyamalila kuwala chowaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">ila ndowadita wahilule kwa kiwhana na gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />Heni Mkulu Nguluwi, ndowahilulila chibida kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">na gehile ga wasekulu wa hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">Nawandiga kwa kujifunyizila ubani milungu ja hewo kuli vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">aho, ndowadita walipe kwa winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">kwa kiwhana na madito ga hewo.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">“Wone munhu yachifiche chizabala cha zabibu zinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">wanhu wangulongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">‘Tuleche kuchiwifya, china utambichizo.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">Ahyo ndo vyondidita kwa chiwalo cha vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">kwa vila hana wanhu wamwenga kuli Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">walingung'holela mijito kwa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">siwadumya weng'ha.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Ndowahagula wanhu wa Isilaeli na Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">na ndowatambichiza leka wawe na walelwa wenji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">Wochikala hano kuli isi ya vidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">nayo yowa ya hewo.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Hamba ibindi lya Shaloni lyowa honhu ha kudila ming'holo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">Ibindi lya Akoli lyowa honhu ha kwesela ha misenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">Avi vyeng'ha vyowa kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">kwa chiwalo cha wanhu walingumhala.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />“Ila ndodita choni na hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">mlingundeka heni Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">wohambe mijese kuwala Siyoni, chidunda cha heni chelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">hemwe mlingumfugamila mlungu ‘Gadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itagwa ali kwa Chiebulaniya nalyali na mana ya bahati.</char></note>,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">na mwangumlavila nhambiko ya divai mlungu ‘Meni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">65:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Meni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">itagwa ali kwa Chiebulaniya nalyali na mana ya kuduma.</char></note>?’<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Nandiwawichila hemwe kubagama kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">mweng'ha mochinamiza kuli honhu ha kudumulila singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">kwa vila hamnyhidichile londiwachemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">londonjile hamnyhulichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Namdita gehile hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">namhagula gala gawele silingugagana.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Ahyo, heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">“Vitumagwa wa heni wolya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">ila hemwe wehile mokona nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">vitumagwa wa heni wonwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">ila hemwe mowa na ng'halu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">vitumagwa wa heni wosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">ila hemwe modeula.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Vitumagwa wa heni wokwimba na kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">ila hemwe mowa na masinzo na molila kwa usungu.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Ndowapa itagwa linyale wala wawele nandiwahagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">ila itagwa lya hemwe lyolonjigwa kwa chiwalo cha kupanjila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">wolonga, ‘Mkulu Nguluwi yawakopole kota awo wehile.’<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Yoneche kuli isi yalingulanda utambichizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">kotambichizwa na Nguluwi wa kukomya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Yoneche yalingugana kilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">kochilaha kwa itagwa lya Nguluwi wa kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">kwa vila magazo ga katali gokola na kusemwigwa.<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulanga unyale na isi inyale</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />“Lelo, ndolumba ulanga unyale na isi inyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:17">mbuli za katali hazikumbuchilwa kahi.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Msangalale, mlutilile kusangalala mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">kwa chiwalo cha vinhu viwele ndovilumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">Muji wa Yelusalemu ndoudita uwe wa kunojeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">na wanhu wake wosangalala.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Nani ndosangalala kwa chiwalo cha muji wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">na kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wa heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">Lizi lya chililo haluhulikwa kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">kulombocheza na magazo havyowa amo.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Vyali havibagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">wasekulu hawobagama kung'hali mhela wa hewo kufika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">Wone munhu kobagama yawele na miyaka makumi kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">kowa nakabagama yang'hali msongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">ila wone kobagama yang'hali kuwa na miyaka makumi kumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">ayo kowa nakapanjilwa.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Wanhu wa heni wozenga ng'handa na kikala amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">wonyhala mizabibu na kulya mafuza gake.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Hawozenga ng'handa leka wekale wanhu wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">ne kunyala nyhadikwa leka mafuza gake walye wanhu wanji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">Kwa vila wanhu wa heni wondiwahagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">wochikala miyaka minji lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha mafuza ga chituguti cha hewo.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Mijito ja hewo hajiwa ja hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">ne kuponda wana leka wafichigwe na mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">kwa vila wowa watambichizwe na Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">hewo hamwe na walelwa wa hewo.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Lowowa wang'hali kunyhema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:24">ama kundanda, ndowa ndiwedichile.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Mibwa ja kisolo na ming'holo myana jolya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">misimba jolya misolo kota misenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">ila nhimbwisi yowa chilyo cha mizoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Hajiweza kumluma ama kumdumya yoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">kuli chidunda chelile cha heni cheng'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Magazo na ulohozi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">“Ulanga ndo chigoda cha heni cha undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">isi ndo honhu ha kuwichila magulu ga heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Lelo, monzenjela ng'handa ilindaze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Kuli honhu hachi hawele ndoweza kwesela?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Heni ndo ndividitile vinhu avi vyeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">avi vyeng'ha ndo vya heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">Ila ndolajila uganililo kwa munhu yalingunyenyetela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">na yalingulonga gehile ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">yalingukakama hala hoyohulika ulonzi wa heni.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Mwangundavila nhambiko ya misenga milume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">kuno mwanguwakopola wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">mwangundavila nhambiko ya ming'holo myana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">kuno mwangujilavila milungu nhambiko ya mibwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Mwangundavila nhambiko ya nyhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">kuno mwangujilavila jimalukolo nhambiko ya danda ya migubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">mwangufunyhizila heni ubani kota nhambiko ya kukumbuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">kuno mwangujitogola jimalukolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Namihagulila kuwinza nzila za hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na nhumbula za hemwe zangusangalala kwa vinhu avyo vilinguzudiza.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Lelo ndowegalila hemwe magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">gowafika gagala gomlingugadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">kwa vila honyhemile, haduhu yedichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">hondonjile haduhu yahulichize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">Namdita gehile hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">namhagula gala gawele silingugagana.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">kwa hemwe mlingukakama kwa ulonzi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">“Wang'holozenu walinguwazudila hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">na kuwalema kwa chiwalo cha heni, nawalonga kwa kubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">‘Mkulu Nguluwi yatogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">leka natwe tuwone hemwe msumya,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">ila hewo ndo wobasigwa soni.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Mhulichize lizi kulawa mujini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">kulawa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Alyo ndo lizi lya Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">yowagaza wang'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />“Muji wa heni welile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">ndo kota mamo yalinguponda ne kuwa na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">kung'hali kwaluka kwa usungu, nakaponda mwana msongolo.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Whaani yawele nakahulika mbuli kota ayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Whaani yawele nakayona mbuli kota ayi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Ndaze, isi yoweza kupondigwa kwa zuwa limwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">ama wanhu wa isi woweza kulawila mala imwe hela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Yelusalemu ndo kota mamo yawele nakaponda mwana wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">mhela uchefu hela kulawa loyafichile kuli honhu ha kupondela.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Ndaze, ndimigale mwana mhela wa kupondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">hamba ndeche kukunda yapondigwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Ndaze, ndidinye munda wa kuponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">kuno heni ndo ndilingudita wanhu wapondigwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.”<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Mtowe luchenze hamwe na Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">msangalale kwa chiwalo cha muji awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">hemwe mweng'ha mlinguugana muji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">Hemwe muwele namlombocheza kwa chiwalo cha muji awo, mtowe luchenze.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Hemwe wanhu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">mopata chila chinhu chomlinguganigwa kupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">kota vila chali vyochilingupata chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">kulawa kuli matombo ga mayake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">Mosangalala kwa chiwalo cha ukulu wa muji awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">na chila chinhu chiwele mgati mwake.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalagana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">“Ndoudita muji wa Yelusalemu ulutilile goya kota lwanda lulinguchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">umeme vinhu vya sendi nyinji, kulawa kwa wanhu wa isi zinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">vinhu avyo vyohilikwa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">vyomema kuli muji awo kota mazi tendema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">Ndowalolela wanhu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">kota mamo vyoyalinguchilolela chali cha heye.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Ndowahembuliza hemwe ako Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:13">kota mamo vyoyalinguchihembuliza chali cha heye.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Mogona ago na nhumbula za hemwe zosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">modedemka kota misolo midodi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">Aho ndo yozeleka kota heni Mkulu Nguluwi ndanguwamilaga vitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">ila hala hondizudila ndowagaza wang'honyo wa heni.”<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Mkulu Nguluwi kokuya na chiluli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">Kowa mchanya mwa mabawa ga chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">kwa chiwalo cha kuwagaza wala wawele nawamzudiza.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Mkulu Nguluwi kolavya utaguso kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">kowagaza kwa ipanga wanhu weng'ha wawele wofichigwa na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">wala wawele wodumigwa na heye, wowa wenji.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Mkulu Nguluwi kangulonga hino, “Wa baho wanhu walingiwika chiuyeng'ha na kiyeliza leka wenjile kuli vigunda vya kujifugamila milungu. Wanguluta hamwe kwa vilundo na mtambika yawele hagati ha hewo. Wanhu awo wangulyaga migubi na mimdusu na migule na vilyo viyage vikokomoche. Ndikomya wanhu awo wobagama weng'ha hamwe. <verse eid="ISA 66:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />Ndangugazela madito ga hewo na majesa ga hewo. Ndanguya kuwakungajiza wanhu wa isi zeng'ha na ndonga zeng'ha, welumbe hamwe na kuulola ukulu wa heni. <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />Ndowika hali hewo ulajilo wa heni. Wasigale hali hewo ndowegala hali wanhu wa isi ako Talishishi na Puli na Ludi na isi ziwele na wazidahe kutoza upinde, woluta kahi Tubali na Yavani na isi iwele wanhu hawanahulika kuzeleka kwa heni ne kuwona ukulu wa heni. Awo wasenga wa heni wouwikula ukulu wa heni kuli wanhu wa isi azo. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Wowegala hali Mkulu Nguluwi Waisilaeli weng'ha kulawa kuli wanhu wa isi zeng'ha. Wowegala kuno wakwinile falasi na migongolo kota midogowi mikulu na ngamiya na mituka ja falasi mbaka Yelusalemu, kuli chidunda cha heni chelile. Wowegala kota Waisilaeli vyowalingigala nhambiko ya nyhule kuli chinhu chelile mbaka haluga ha heni Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Nani kahi ndowahagula wamwenga hali hewo leka wawe watambika na wamwenga wawe Walawi. Heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />“Kota vila ulanga unyale na isi inyale zondizilumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:22">hoziwa nzinzili mazuwa gose kwa ludali lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:22">ndo walelwa wa hegwe na itagwa lya hegwe vyoliwa nzinzili.<verse eid="ISA 66:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Kuli chila mnvina ya kulawa kwa nyelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">na kuli chila zuwa lya Kwesela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">wanhu weng'ha wokuya kufugamila heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:23">heni Mkulu Nguluwi nandonga.<verse eid="ISA 66:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />“Hamba woluta kulola mitufi ja wala wambelenhuche heni. Fukuzi ziwele zolya mitufi ja hewo hazibagama na chiluli chiwele chowalakaza hachizimya. Wowa izudizo kwa wanhu weng'ha.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>